<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Siwu Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">ƆKO ƉEAKATƆ̃</para>
  <para style="imt">ATƆ̃MEƉEAKATƆ̃</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Samuel Ɔko Ɖeakatɔ̃</char> ɔɖeika i kaɖe makɔdze ɔwi kawirikɔ̃ gu sigaraiɖe karɔ̃ isɛ i Israel kaɖe ame iso. Ara ifiriki wa loba i kaɖe ngbãsɛa ame ɔpɛgu maturi nyaa itɛ mawɛ̃. Maturi magbe loɖe Samuel, kaɖe makɔdze siare ɔtsɔra; Saul, Israel igara ɖeakatɔ̃ gu David, nwɔ sikpãrɛrɛĩ kurabarara ɔɖe katɔ̃ fiɛ ɔba ɔ̃akpese igara, ɔpia kanya i Samuel gu Saul ngbãsɛa atɔ̃me ame.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔko ame atɔ̃medziri ɔkategu nwa mpia i Ndamu Kuere ara wa loɔba afe siko mama ame. Itɔ̃medziri nɖe sɔ, si ɔturi ɔɖe ɔnukuare ɔtã Ɣaa ne, ɔsɛ ɔna isaruɛ i ngbã ame, si ɔ̃ikã Ɣaa atsue ne, kukpakpi nsɛ kuba wũ iso. Nnɛgbe ɔɖiite i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kanya ga ɔsese sɔrɛdze Eli i 2.30 ame sɔ, "Loawarɛ mma nsɛ mawarɛ me, mma nsɛ manyɔ me pupurii ne, mme wũ loanyɔ ma pupurii." (2.30)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔko atɔ̃me ɔɖi kumɛgɔ i maturi adzuni ɔkpɔkpɔtɔ i sigaraiɖe karɔ̃ isɛ i Israel kaɖe ame iso ate. Mabu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ ɔ̃ kowũ nɖe Israel igara, ɣɛɛ maturi ɔla maɔbie igara mama. Ɣɛɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ i maturi ɔbie teteree fiɛ makarɛ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara i ma kuɖɔɛ iso ɔtã ma, ne ɔso ɔsɛ igara ɔtã ma. Ira nyaare nɛ mpia i kame loɖe sɔ, atoasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɛ igara ɔtã kaɖe kɔraa ne, igara gu kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ɔwe i Ɣaa sigaraiɖe kayirinɔ fiɛ Ɣaa ɔɖe ma tɔ̃meɣɛdze (2.7-10). Ɣaa mmara ɔse sɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔwe kaɖekɔ̃ ga mamɔɛ̃ mala makate matã maranase gu mawɛrɛba pelepele.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ɔko Iɣɛɣɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Samuel ɔɖe Israel kɔdze. <char style="ior">1.1-7.17</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saul ɔkpese igara <char style="ior">8.1-10.27</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saul Sigaraiɖe <char style="ior">11.1-15.35</char></para>
  <para style="io1">David gu Saul <char style="ior">16.1-30.31</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ kukpi <char style="ior">31.1.13</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Elkana Gu Ɔ̃ Iyomaturi Ɔkɛlɛ Silo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ marɔ Elkana ɔbɔrɛ i Ramatayim Zufise ɔɖe. Ɔbɔrɛ i Efrayim kabemi karɔ̃ iso. Ɔɖe Yeroxam ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. Yeroxam ɔse ɔɖe Elixu, fiɛ Elixu ɔse ɔɖe Toxu wɔ loɖe Zuf ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ lobɔrɛ i Efrayim kalɛ ame. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elkana ɔyiri marɔ̃go inyɔ. Ɔwɛ̃ iyere ɔɖe Xana, fiɛ ɔnyɔare iyere ɔɖe Penina. Penina ɔɣe mabi ɣɛɛ Xana ne ɔ̃iɣe ɔbi kuwɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Ikɔ biara ame ne, Elkana ɔla ɔ̃abɔrɛ i ɔ̃ ɔmagɛ̃ ame ɔkɛlɛ Silo ɔsɛ ɔ̃asumu ɔsɔrɛ ara ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔlesate. Silo ngbe i Eli mabirɛrɛĩ inyɔ, Xofni gu Pinexas, ɔɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> masɔrɛdze ne. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Iyi irere nɛ iso i Elkana ɔsɔrɛ ara ne, ɔsɛ ɔtã ɔ̃ ɔre Penina sina akpe, ɔtã ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔbiara bɔi wɔ ɔsɔrɛ sina. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Ɣɛɛ Xana ne, ɔtã wũ akpe anyɔ alasɔ ɔɖɔɛ wũ gbaã atoasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iitã wũ ɔɣe mabi. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Ɔ̃ ɔrerɛ, Penina, ɔla ɔ̃abie wũ kanya ame are ɔsu ɔpia wũ sikpã ala kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iitã ɔɣe ɔbi ɔso. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Nnɛgbe ɔsɔgu i katɔ̃ ikɔ biara ame. Ɔwi ɔrere wɔ maɔsɛ mmɔ fiɛ Xana ɔsɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo ne, ɔ̃ ɔrerɛ ɔla ɔ̃abara wũ aɣiãra ɔpia wũ sikpã gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kaku ka ɔ̃abiɛ fiɛ ɔ̃ibaɖe aɖera ala ne iti. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Ɔ̃ ɔrã Elkana ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Xana, be ɔso ato abiɛ kaku? Be ɔso aito aɖe aɖera? Be ɔso ato amararã so i ɔtu ame? Gbaã ne, loawo ɔbara ɔtã-ɔ loɖo mabirɛrɛĩ iweo!"<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xana Ɔkparamakayi Ɔkarɛ Ɔbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Ɔwi ɔwɛ̃ ne gɔ maɔɖe ara manɛ ara maro i Silo i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo ne, Xana ɔta ɔya. Ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne, Eli, sɔrɛdze ne, ɔbɔdzo ɔsɛ i iyara iso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Isɔrɛyo kayogodɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Ibo gu ibɛbɛrɛ nɛ i Xana ame iti ne, ɔkparamakayi ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔla kaku ibiɛ gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Ne ɔkã ndamu ɔɣɛ sɔ, "O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔlesate, si aanyɔ fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go inyɛwe kere fiɛ aanyigi me, fiɛ aibaɣara fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go ɣɛɛ ata wũ ɔbirɛrɛĩ ne, iyɔ loasu wũ losɛ ise lotã-ɔ i ɔ̃ agbanayi ɔɖuɖu ame. Siwɛrɛ̃ ikparɛ̃ra kuiwɛ̃ iibapɛgu ɔ̃ iti iso kuiyikuiyi."<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Gɔ i Xana ɔla ɔ̃akparamakayi ɔ̃ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne, Eli ɔla ɔ̃anyɔ ɔ̃ kanya. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Xana ɔla ɔ̃akparamakayi i ɔ̃ ɔtu ame. Ne Eli ɔbu sɔ ndã nto mimɔɛ̃ wũ alasɔ ɔ̃ kanya to kabubusi ɣɛɛ silɔ iibɔrɛ manɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Ne ɔso ɔkarɛ Xana sɔ, "Ku me ɔwi i ndã aakpa-ɔ? Nyua itãnɛ."<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Ɣɛɛ Xana ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Ooɣo lo, wũ sate, ɔrɔ̃go wɔ nto ɔmararã so gbaã loɖe. Iiɖe wain ɣee ndã kpokporoa kumiwɛ̃ lola loɔnɛ; wũ ɔtu ame amɔrɛã nto loɖi loɣere <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Daabu fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go, ɔrɔ̃go nyanyariã; alasɔ wũ isoma gu ibo, ibɛbɛrɛ siare kayi nto lokparama i ngbe."<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Kere ne, Eli ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Kɛlɛ i isobuɛ ame. Israel Ɣaa si ɔtã-ɔ nnɛ akarɛ wũ."<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Ne Xana ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go ara si abo-ɔ anɔ kere." Ne kama ne ɔɣo ɔri, ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɖe aɖera. Ɔ̃ anɔ ɔfiriki fiɛ ɔ̃isito ɔmararã so.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Kaya tutuutu ne, Elkana gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔta masɛ maasumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ne kama ka makpese makɛlɛ ma aɖe Rama ne. Elkana ɔsɛgu ɔ̃ ɔre Xana, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔ ɔ̃ kayiikparama ne. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ne ɔso Xana ɔla kayiri i ɔwi wɔmɔ ame fiɛ ɔɣe ɔbirɛrɛĩ. Ɔtã wũ iyere sɔ Samuel ɔɖi ne karɔ̃ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Alasɔ lokarɛ wũ lobɔrɛgu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Gɔ ɔwi ɔɣo ana ne, Elkana gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ Silo ngbegɔ masɛ masɔrɛ ikɔ biara isɔrɛ nɛ masɛ mabara fiɛ ɔ̃atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu kuso. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Xana iisɛ, ɔɣere ɔ̃ ɔrã sɔ, "Si loɔɖi ɔbi inyɛ ne, loakɔ wũ lokɛlɛgu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo, fiɛ ka ɔ̃awe i mmɔ pelepele."<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Ɔ̃ ɔrã Elkana ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Bara nnɛ anya sɔ ilɛ-ɔ. We i ngbe gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ aɖi wũ inyɛ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔtã ɔ̃ kaɣɛkasɛ si kaba i ne ame." Ne ɔso Xana ka ɔwe i kaa ɔnyɔ ɔbi iso isɛ iabo ɔwi wɔ ɔnyua imeme.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Gɔ ɔbi ɔɔre inyɛ ne, ɔkɔ ɔbirɛrɛĩ ɔkɛlɛgu Silo. Atoasɔ ɔkoso ne, ɔsu akɔ atɛ nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃, ɔraũ kilo iweo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɔraũ kilo iweo: Ɔraũ efa ɔwɛ̃ </char></note> gu wain bɔikoakpo ɔwɛ̃ ɔto. Ɔkɔ Samuel wɔ loɖe ɔbiɛtɛ ɔkɛlɛgu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo i Silo.<verse eid="1SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Gɔ maɔɖoe nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ne makɔ ɔbirɛrɛĩ makɛlɛgu Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Xana ɔɣere Eli sɔ, "Wũ sate, lokã sɔ, mme nɖe ɔrɔ̃go wɔ loba ɔ̃aya i fɔ kɔrɛ i ngbe, lola loɔkparamakayi loɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Ɔbi wɔgbe lokparamakayi lokarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne. Ɔtã me nnɛ lokarɛ wũ. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ne ɔso nto losu wũ lotã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ɔ̃ɔkpese <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔre i ɔ̃ agbanayi ɔɖuɖu ame." Ne Elkana gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔsumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> i mmɔ ne.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Xana Kayiikparama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Ne Xana ɔkparamakayi ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">"Wũ ɔtu to ɔna isoɣɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ame i wũ isa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa: Iɣɛ itã ɔle</char></note> ɔɔkɔlɛ kato.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Wũ kanya to kaɖe ndamu kapia wũ matsirise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">alasɔ aɖi me nto lona isoɣɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />"Ɔturi kuwɛ̃ iise sekelee lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> awe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Kuwɛ̃ na i fɔ kama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Itasiare kuiwɛ̃ na lɛ bo Ɣaa awe.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />"Midaala ikaiɖe i iteso ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">ɣee minyua akaɖe i katoikɔlɛso nɛmɔ igbã ame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe Ɣaa wɔ nɣe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">Ɔ̃ nsɛ ɔɖaɛ itɔ̃me i maturi awune kurabarara iso.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />"Makpãrɛrɛĩ kuta ɔfɛfɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">ɣɛɛ mma lorɔ̃ sɛ mana ɔle.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Maturi ma nsɛ maɖe aɖera mami saa, ka mapia i awoba ame i aɖera wa maaɖe iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">ɣɛɛ mma loisɛ mana aɖera maɖe saa ne, kukã iisibakpɛ̃ ma kini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Ɔrɔ̃go wɔ loɖe ɔlɛma ɔɔba ɔ̃aɣe mabi ikɔdzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ wɔ loɣe mabi gbodzoo ɔɔba ɔ̃akpese lɛ ɔturi wɔ loiɣe ɔbi ɔnya awe.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔtã ɔturi ngbã, fiɛ ɔ̃ ame nsɛ ɔbɔ kukpi ne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">Ɔsɛ ɔtã ɔturi ɔkɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame, fiɛ ɔ̃ ame nsɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ wũ ɔɖi ɔbɔ ngbã ana.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔbara ɔwɛ̃ wɛrɛba fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔbara ɔmama ranase.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">Ɔ̃ nsɛ ɔbara ɔwɛ̃ ɔbɔsokarɔ̃ fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔkɔlɛ ɔmama kato.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Ɔsɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ mawɛrɛba ɔɖi i sise ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔkɔlɛ maɣiãni kato ɔbɔrɛgu i ndɔ̃ ikpe ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Ɔsɛra maɣiani i makpakpaturi ndɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã sɔ masɛ i kuwarɛ iyara iso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">"Alasɔ karɔ̃ sikaĩ ɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">sɛ̃ iso ɔtsue kayiiso ɔɖuɖu ɔsia ne.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Ɔsɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ ɔ̃ manukuarese inene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">ɣɛɛ maturi nyanyariã to maawɔ i idududu ame.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">"Alasɔ iiɖe ɔturi ɔle nsɛ ɔtã ɔɖeiso.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Maawɔra mma lota maɣɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">Ɔto ɔ̃aɖi silɔ teteree lɛ kadoiɖu ɔpia ma ɔbɔrɛgu i kato.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃aɣɛgu ɔbiara i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso atɔ̃me.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">"Ɔto ɔ̃atã ɔ̃ igara ɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">fiɛ ɔ̃akɔlɛ nwɔ ɔsɔla nnɔĩ isa kato.<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ne kama ne Elkana ɔrui ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ aɖe Rama, ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔsumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> i sɔrɛdze Eli kayirinɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔrɛdze Eli Mabibirɛrɛĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Eli mabibirɛrɛĩ Xofni gu Penixas ɔwe ɔtile. Maiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mapia i kuira ame. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Kiniɔ ne iɖe kubarara i masɔrɛdze magbe gu maturi magbe ndɛ̃ sɔ si ɔrere ɔba ɔsɔrɛ ara ne, sɔrɛdze ɔɖabo ala kugbadai kutɛ katsue i kɔrɔ̃ ɔba, gɔ mato mawa sina. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Ɔto ɔ̃asu katsue ɔtsue mina i ɔruɛ ɣee iwabui ɣee ɔlakutu ɣee daɖisɛĩ ame, iyɔ sɔrɛdze aasu irabiara nɛ kaɖi i kame. Kumɛgɔgbe mala maɔbara i Israel mabi ɔbiara wɔ loba ɔsɔrɛ ara i Silo iso ne. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Ibua ne iso ne, fiɛ maatsuedza iɖa kɔraa ne, sɔrɛdze ɔɖabo ɔ̃aba ɔ̃aɣere nwɔ nto ɔsɔrɛ ara sɔ, "Tã sɔrɛdze sina kɛkɛĩ si ɔfɛ̃; ɔ̃ito ɔ̃afɔ sina dzɛ mawa i fɔ kɔrɛ ɣɛɛ siyuɛ kere ɔto ɔbie."<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Si nwɔ nto ɔsɔrɛ ara ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Tã matsuedza iɖa tɔtɔ, si ka aasu nnɛ abie," iyɔ ɔɖabo aatã mmuai sɔ, "Ooɣo! Su tã me kiniɔ; si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, loaɖi sɛ̃ ku ɔle!"<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Eli mabi magbe ikpi ɔnyanyarĩ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔmi ame gbaã, alasɔ maisɛ mapia kuwarɛ kukuwɛ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛ iso.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Ɣɛɛ ne, Samuel ɔla ɔ̃abara kasumu karabara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Ɔɖe kaporoporoi ga lopia akalala ɔmearapia. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Ikɔ biara ne ɔ̃ ɔnyi sɛ ɔkã awu tagbaraa ɔkɛlɛgu wũ si ma gu ɔ̃ ɔrã Elkana ɔsɛ ikɔ isɔrɛ kabarakɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli ɔ̃afere Elkana gu ɔ̃ ɔre kusɛkusɛ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔtã ɔrɔ̃go wɔgbe si ɔɣe mabi ɔtã-ɔ asu asɛ i nwɔ asu atã wũ kanya." Iyɔ ne kama ne ka maɔrui makɛlɛ kaa. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbualɛ Xana ɔɣe mabirɛrɛĩ itɛ ɔbua gu mabirɔ̃gomi inyɔ. Ɔwi wɔgbe ne, ɔbirɛrɛĩ Samuel, ɔmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Kiniɔ ne, Eli ɔɔbua ɔbe gbaã. Ɔnɔ irabiara nɛ ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ to mabara i Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu iso. Ɔnɔ sɔ ɔ̃ mabi ɔla maɔrɛgu marɔ̃go ma nsɛ masumu i Isarɛ Ikpayo kayogodɔ̃ ana. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ne ɔso ɔkarɛ ma sɔ, "Be ɔso mito mibara ara wagbe igbã? Nto lonɔ ɔturi biara to ɔɣɛ aranyanyariã wa mito mibara. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Wũ mabi, ooɣo lo! <char style="nd">Bosate</char> maturi iito maɖeikaɖe sɛɛ kuiwɛ̃ i mi iso. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Si ɔturi ɔɣɛrɛ ɔ̃ ɔnyii ne, Ɣaa sɛ ɔbuai i kpibaradze iso. Ɣɛɛ si ɔturi ɔbara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso ne, nna loawo nrɔɔ̃ ɔpɛ i ɔ̃ iti?" Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ iinɔ ma ɔse isɛ̃ ma, alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kubie kuɖe sɔ ɔ̃aɖoe ma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Kabirɛrɛĩ Samuel ɔmɔ ku somina ɔbua, ɔ̃ ara ɔbo <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gu maturi anɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔsɛ̃ Eli Iyomaturi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Kiniɔ ne Ɣaameturi ɔwɛ̃ ɔba Eli kɔrɛ ɔba ɔ̃aɣere wũ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ, 'Loɖi so lote fɔ ɔse iyo ku ɔwi wɔ mapia i Egipte karɔ̃ iso i Igarakpakpa kayirinɔ. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Loɖi fɔ ɔse i Israel kumele ɔɖuɖu ndɛ̃ sɔ ɔ̃aɖe wũ sɔrɛdze. Ɔ̃ loasumu i wũ isɔrɛkasege katɔ̃, ɔ̃atsuedza kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã fiɛ ɔ̃apia ɔmearapia i wũ anɔ. Losu Israel mabi asɔrɛ ɔɖuɖu wa masɛ mabaragu ɔtɔ lotã fɔ ɔse iyo ana. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Be ɔso mito misopara wũ isɔrɛ gu karatã ga lokarɛ lotã wũ kasɛkɔ̃? Be ɔso ato awarɛ fɔ mabi aɖo me? Be ɔso mito miɖe sina kasɛ ga nlɛ kaɖo fiɛ kaba iɖa ne mito mina so mibɔrɛgu i isɔrɛ biara nɛ wũ maturi Israel mabi ɔbɔ ame?'<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Israel Ɣaa, ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Loɣɛ losɛ sɔ fɔ iyo gu fɔ ɔse iyo, aawe i wũ kɔrɛ masumu ɔwi daaro.' Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Kuiyikuiyi, iisibaba i ne ame inya! Maturi ma nsɛ mawarɛ me ne, mme wũ loawarɛ ma, ɣɛɛ mma losɛ me i karɔ̃ ne, loasopara ma. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Nyɔ, ɔwi to ɔba gɔ loawɔra fɔ kakpa gu fɔ ɔse iyo, iyɔ ne ɔkpakpa kuwɛ̃ iisibawe i fɔ iyomaturi ɔkparɛ ame. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Iyɔ ne ato aamararã so i wũ kasɛkɔ̃. Atoasɔ loatã ara ɔlɛgu Israel mabi mama ne, ɔkpakpa kuwɛ̃ iibawe i fɔ iyomaturi ɔkparɛ ame kuiyikuiyi. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ pia i fɔ ɔkparɛ ame wɔ loatã ɔwe ngbã, fiɛ loibatɛ̃ wũ ɔri sɔ ɔdaasumu me lɛ sɔrɛdze. Ɣɛɛ ɔto ɔ̃abiɛ anɔmi, fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃awe i isoma gu imararãso ame ɔwi biara. Ɣɛɛ fɔ ɔkparɛ tsɔra ne mato maakpi i ipɛmi kanya.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />" 'Nnɛ loaba i fɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ inyɔ, Xofni gu Pinexas iso, loaɖe-ɔ ikparĩ - ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu to maakpi ku iyi iwɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Loasɛ sɔrɛdze ɔnukuarese, nwɔ loabara i wũ ɔtu gu adzuni iso lotã so. Loasɛra ɔ̃ iyo teteree, fiɛ ɔ̃asumu me i wũ nwɔ masɔla nnɔĩ anɔ ɔwi biara. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Iyɔ fɔ mabi ma loakuti aasɛ sɔrɛdze wɔmɔ kɔrɛ masɛ maakarɛ sikãfudza kɛkɛĩ gu araɖea kutia, fiɛ maapɛ wũ nrɔɔ̃ sɔ, "Botã-ɔ iti, tã bo ɔri si bobuai masɔrɛdze bobara karabara si boana araɖea boɖe." ' "<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔɖi So Ɔte Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Kaporoporoi Samuel ɔwe i Eli kayirinɔ ɔla ɔ̃asumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iisɛ ɔɖegu maturi ika malamala fiɛ kaɖikate ana iisi.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Kasɛ̃ kawɛ̃ ne Eli, nwɔ anɔmi ka nto aba karɔ̃ fiɛ ɔ̃isito ɔwo ara ɔnya, ɔrɛ i ngbegɔ ɔsɛ ɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Ɣaa ɔkaniɛ iinyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔkaniɛ iinyi: Masɛ matsue ɔkaniɛ masɛ i isɔrɛyo ame ita kutsuɛ iɖɔwũ ikuɔ isɛ iabɔrɛ kaya iɖɔwũ ikuɔ fiɛ sɛ manidza </char></note>, Samuel ɔrɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Isɔrɛyo ame, ngbegɔ i Ɣaa Ndamu Aɖaka ɔse. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpere Samuel. Ne Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Nya mme." <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Ne ɔtere ɔkɛlɛ Eli kɔrɛ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Nya mme; ala akpere me."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Ɣɛɛ Eli ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Loikpere-ɔ; kpese sɛ aarɛ." Ne ɔso ɔrui ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃arɛ.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔledza ikpere sɔ, "Samuel!" Ne Samuel ɔta ɔkɛlɛ Eli kɔrɛ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nya mme; ala akpere me."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Eli ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Wũ ɔbi, loikpere-ɔ; kpese sɛ aarɛ."<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Kiniɔ ne, Samuel iitsue <char style="nd">Bosate</char> tɔtɔ, fiɛ maiɖi <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me mate wũ manya ana.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔledza Samuel ikpere ɔkpɛ tɛare. Ɔta ɔkɛlɛ Eli kɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɣere wũ sɔ, "Nya mme; ala akpere me."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Kere ne Eli ɔtsue sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe nto ɔkpere ɔbi. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ne ɔso Eli ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Kɛlɛ aarɛ. Si ɔledza-ɔ ikpere ne, ɣere wũ sɔ, 'Ɖe ika alasɔ fɔ ɔɖabo to ɔkã atsue.' " Ne ɔso Samuel ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃arɛ i ɔ̃ karɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔledza iba ɔ̃aya i mmɔ ɔkpere lɛ saa awe sɔ, "Samuel! Samuel!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Ne Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ɖe ika, alasɔ fɔ ɔɖabo to ɔkã atsue." <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Nyɔ, nto loba loabara ira iwɛ̃ i Israel kaɖe ame. Ɔturi biara wɔ loanɔ ne, ɔyu aamɔɛ̃ somina. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne loatã atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu wa loɣɛ i Eli gu ɔ̃ kakpa iso aaba i kame ita i karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ isɛ iabo kawirikɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Loɣere wũ lofegu sɔ loakpadzɛ̃ ɔ̃ iyomaturi kutsue ɔwi ɖaa. Alasɔ ɔɣe ira ɔsegu i ɔ̃ mabi ikpi gu imusuora nɛ mabara i Ɣaa iso, ɣɛɛ ɔlo i ne iso ɔ̃isɛ̃ ɔtã ma. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ne ɔso lokã ndamu lotã Eli iyo sɔ, "Eli iyo iɣɛrɛ ne, maibasu isɔrɛ ɣee karatã mabara ikpikusoisɔrɛ i ikpi iti kuiyikuiyi.' "<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samuel ɔkpese ɔrɛ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kaɖe ɔsɛ̃. Ɔta ne ɔbusi <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo akui ne. Ɔnigã kaɖikate ga ɔnya iɣere Eli. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Ɣɛɛ Eli ɔkpere wũ ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Wũ ɔbi, Samuel!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Nya mme."<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Be itɔ̃me i Ɣaa ɔɣere-ɔ? Daasu ne akɔla me. Ɣaa si ɔkpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue, ɔledza-ɔ ikpadzɛ̃ si aiɣere me nwa ɔɖuɖu ɔɣere-ɔ." <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ne ɔso Samuel ɔɣere wũ irabiara ɔ̃ikɔla kuiwɛ̃. Ne Eli ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔ̃ nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, ɔbara nnɛ nlɛ i ɔ̃ anɔ."<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samuel ɔba ɔ̃amɔ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwegu wũ fiɛ ɔtã sɔ ɔ̃ itɔ̃me biara nɛ Samuel ɔɣɛ ɔba i kame. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ita i Dan i kato isɛ iabo Beer-Seba i kala, ɔba maatsue sɔ maɔsɛra Samuel lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kanyaɖidze awe. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔla ɔ̃aɖi so ɔ̃ɔte i Silo fiɛ mmɔ ɔɖi so ɔte Samuel iki i itɔ̃me nɛ ɔɣere wũ ame.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ma Filistise Ɔmɔɛ̃ Ndamu Aɖaka Mafɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Samuel atɔ̃me wa ɔpɛ imomo ɔsɛ kakɔi biara i Israel maturi ndɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Kiniɔ ne, Israel mabi ɔta kakpã i ma Filistise iso. Israel mabi ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃ i Ebenezer kɔrɛ fiɛ ma Filistise ɔbara ma ɔkpɛ i Afek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Ma Filistise ɔtagu ma makpakpɛ̃dze masarɛgu Israel mabi, kakpã ɔbɛ gbaã. Ne ma Filistise ɔɖe Israel mabi iso fiɛ maɖoe lɛ maturi kukpi kuna i kakpãkpɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Ɔwi wɔ i makpakpɛ̃dze ɔkpese makɛlɛ kasɛkɔ̃ ne, Israel makpakpa ɔkarɛ ma sɔ, "Be ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã ma Filistise ɔɖe bo iso nɔme? Mitã bosɛ boasu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ndamu Aɖaka i Silo bobɔ. Si aasɛgu bo fiɛ aaɖi bo i matsirise nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ne ɔso makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsese maturi Silo, ne masɛ maasu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔlesate Ndamu aɖaka, nwɔ nsi i makerubi ndɛ̃ mabɔ. Eli mabibirɛrɛĩ inyɔ, Xofni gu Pinexas, ana ɔwe i mmɔ ku Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Ɔwi wɔ i ndamu aɖaka ɔba aabo i kasɛkɔ̃ ne, Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ɔlakulu ku isoɣɔ teteree sɔ karɔ̃ ɔti. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Gɔ ma Filistise ɔnɔ kulu ne makarɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso kulu teteree gɔgbe to i ma Hebrise kasɛkɔ̃?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Gɔ maba maatsue sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka masu mabɔ i kasɛkɔ̃ ne, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />ifɔ̃ ɔmɔɛ̃ ma Filistise gbaã. Maɣɛ sɔ, "Kuɣɔ ɔ ɔɔba kuabo i kasɛkɔ̃ ame. Boɔre nrɔɔ̃! Nnɛgbe igbã iiba inya. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Ndzo mitã bo! Nna loaɖi bo ɔbɔrɛgu i aɣɔ wa mba ɔle nrɔɔ̃ ame? Aɣɔ wagbe lobɔ sinyɛpɛ̃ agbãagbã i ma Egiptese iso i fafuĩ ame ne. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Ma Filistise, miwe katetere! Mibara lɛ marɛrɛ̃, si iiɖe ngbɔ ne miakpese ma Hebrise masande lɛ kumɛgɔ ma wũ maɔɖe bo masande manya awe. Mita lɛ marɛrɛ̃ awe, si mikpɛ̃ kakpã!"<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Ne ɔso ma Filistise ɔkpɛ̃ kakpã ne maɖe Israel mabi iso, ma ɔrɛrɛ̃ biara ɔtere ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ ikpayo ame. Maturi gbodzoo ɔrɔ̃ kakpã. Maɖoe Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ma nsɛ masɛ i ngba iso kukpi sitɛ. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Mamɔɛ̃ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka mafɔ fiɛ maɖoe Eli mabibirɛrɛĩ inyɔ, Xofni gu Pinexas ana.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Iyi nɛmɔ ame ne, ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ lobɔrɛ i Benyamin kamele ame, ɔtere ise ɔbɔrɛ i kakpã ame ɔkɛlɛ Silo. Awu ɔkɛkɛ i ɔ̃ iso fiɛ ɔsebu ɔwe i ɔ̃ iti ame. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Gɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔba ɔ̃abo ne, mmɔ i Eli ka ɔ̃ɔkpase ɔsi i iyara iso i ɔri kuruɛ ɔla ɔ̃anyɔ ɔri iso alasɔ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka ɔtã sɔ ɔ̃ ɔtu iito ɔsɛ i karɔ̃. Gɔ nwɔmɔ ɔbo i ɔmagɛ̃ ame fiɛ ɔɣɛ nnɛ loba ne, maturi ɔbiɛ teteree i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli ɔnɔ kulu ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be loba kulu to kumɛɔ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔpɛsiwa ɔkɛlɛ Eli kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne, Eli ɔɔfɔ akɔ kasiwɛ̃-fafarana fiɛ anɔmi ɔɔbiɛ wũ, ne ɔso ɔ̃isito ɔnya ara. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔɣere Eli sɔ, "Ɔtere lorui lotere i kakpã kanya, lotere loba loabo ku nɔme." Eli ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Wũ ɔbi, be loba?"<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lobɔ itɔ̃me ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Israel mabi ɔrui matere i ma Filistise kanya, makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ɔyu mabo gɔ maturi gbodzoo ɔkpi. Ana ne fɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ inyɔ, Xofni gu Pinexas ana ɔkpi, fiɛ ma Filistise ɔmɔɛ̃ ndamu aɖaka mafɔ maruigu."<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Gɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkpere Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka fiɛ Eli ɔnɔ kere, ɔrɔ̃ simasima i iyara iso i kayogodɔ̃ kanya. Simɔ ɔkarã i karɔ̃ sifɛ̃ ne ɔkpi alasɔ ɔ̃ɔkpa katɔ̃ fiɛ ɔwe ɔrɔrã ana. Ɔkɔ Israel kaɖe akɔ sina.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne, Eli ɔbire, Pinexas ɔre, wɔ lola kayiri ne, ka ɔɔbe gɔ ɔbiɣewi ɔro ɔɔɣo. Ne gɔ ɔnɔ atɔ̃me sɔ mamɔɛ̃ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka mafɔ, ɔ̃ ɔrãse gu ɔ̃ ɔrã ɔɔkpi ne, kayiri ɔtsɛ wũ iɖoɖo ɔluwɛ̃, ne ɔɣe ɔbi ɣɛɛ kuɣe ibo ɔɖo wũ. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Gɔ ɔto ɔkpi ne, marɔ̃go ma nto maɣera wũ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Daanigã; ɔbirɛrɛĩ aɣe." Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃itã mmuai ɣee ɔ̃ibara kuira.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Ɔtã ɔbirɛrɛĩ iyere sɔ Ikabod, ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔɔrui i Israel kɔrɛ" - alasɔ mamɔɛ̃ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka mafɔ fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔrãse gu ɔ̃ ɔrã ana ɔkpi. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔɔrui i Israel kɔrɛ, alasɔ mamɔɛ̃ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka mafɔ."<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ndamu Aɖaka I Ma Filistise Kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Ɔwi wɔ i ma Filistise ɔɔmɔɛ̃ Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka mafɔ kama ne, masu wã i Ebenezer makɛlɛgu Asdod. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Ne masore ndamu aɖaka makɛlɛgu Dagon kuɣɔ isɔrɛyo ame, masu wã masɛ i Dagon irapɔa kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Gɔ Asdod maturi ɔta ku kaɖesɛã kaya ne, mmɔ manya sɔ Dagon ɔrɔ̃ katɔ̃ fu i karɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka katɔ̃! Ne matara Dagon fiɛ masu wũ maɣedza i ɔ̃ kasɛkɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Ɣɛɛ kaɖesɛã kaya ne, gɔ mata ne manya sɔ Dagon irapɔa ɔledza irɔ̃ ifu katɔ̃ i karɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka katɔ̃! Ɔ̃ iti gu nrɔɔ̃ ɔfɛfɛ̃ miɖi iso mise i kayogodɔ̃ fiɛ ikuti ɔ̃ iso kere. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Nnɛgbe ɔso ipɛ nɔme ne, Dagon mabia oo, maturi ma losumu wũ oo, si mabo i Dagon isɔrɛyo i Asdod ne, maisɛ masia kukpa i kayogodɔ̃ mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpadzɛ̃ Asdod gu ɔ̃ awo ame maturi kutsue teteree. Ɔkpadzɛ̃ iwɔ ɔbɔ ma iso ne ɔtã ara ɔmumu maturi ma i mmɔ pelepele. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Gɔ Asdod maturi ɔnya ara wa nto aba ne, maɣɛ sɔ, "Iikote sɔ Israel ɣaa aɖaka aase i bo kɔrɛ alasɔ ɔto ɔkpadzɛ̃ bo gu bo kuɣɔ Dagon kutsue." <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ne ɔso makpere ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔɖuɖu makarɛ ma sɔ, "Be boabaragu Israel ɣaa aɖaka?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Matã mmuai sɔ, "Mitã masu wã makɛlɛgu Gat ɔmagɛ̃siare." Ne ɔso masu Israel Ɣaa aɖaka makɛlɛgu Gat.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Ɣɛɛ gɔ masu wã i mmɔ makɛlɛgu kama ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpadzɛ̃ ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔmɔ kutsue ana, fiɛ itã ifɔ̃ siare ɔmɔɛ̃ ma. Ɔkpadzɛ̃ ɔturi biara kutsue i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame, makpakpa i makoso pelepele ku ara imumu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ne ɔso masu Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka makɛlɛgu Ekron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Gɔ Ɣaa aɖaka to abo i Ekron ɔmagɛ̃siare ame ne, Ekron maturi ɔlakulu mabiɛ maɣɛ sɔ, "Maɔsu Israel ɣaa aɖaka mabɔ bo sɔ aaba aɖoe bo gu bo maturi." <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ne ɔso makpere ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔɖuɖu ne maɣɛ sɔ, "Misu Israel ɣaa aɖaka miruigu, mitã akpese akɛlɛ wã mɔmɔ kasɛkɔ̃ si iiɖe ngbɔ ato aaɖoe bo gu bo maturi." Alasɔ kukpi ifɔ̃ ɔmɔɛ̃ ɔmagɛ̃siare maturi ɔɖuɖu i Ɣaa kɔrɔ̃ teteree i ma iso ɔso. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Mma loikpi ne, ara ɔmumu ma fiɛ ɔmagɛ̃siare kaku ɔkɛlɛ Ɣaa kɔrɛ i kato.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Makpesegu Ndamu Aɖaka Mabɔ Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Ɔwi wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka ɔɔwe i ma Filistise karɔ̃ iso awa akɔdzɛ ne, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />ma Filistise ɔkpere ma masɔrɛdze gu mawase makarɛ ma sɔ, "Nda ngbɔ boabara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka? Miɣere bo kumɛgɔ boabara fiɛ boakpesegu wã bokɛlɛgu wã kasɛkɔ̃."<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Matã mmuai sɔ, "Si mito mikpesegu Israel ɣaa aɖaka mikɛlɛgu ne, midaasese wã kere. Ikote sɔ miasese wũ iɣɛrɛkuso isɔrɛ. Iyɔ ne miana isosarɛ fiɛ miatsue miɖiite sɔ, ne ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iitara ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ i mi iso."<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Ne ma Filistise ɔkarɛ ma sɔ, "Iɖe iɣɛrɛkuso isɔrɛ nɛ boasu bokɛlɛgu wũ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Matã mmuai sɔ, "Mitore sikãrɛtɛa aramua aru gu sikãrɛtɛa kulelei kuru i ma Filistise maɖeisoi iru kanya, alasɔ inyɛpɛ̃ igbã iwɛ̃ loba i mi gu mi maɖeisoi iso. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mibara aramua kumiamia gu kulelei gɔ nto kunina ara i karɔ̃ iso kumiamia, si miapia Israel ɣaa kuwarɛ. Sianyɔ ɔto ɔ̃anyua kutsueikpadzɛ̃ mi gu mi aɣɔ gu karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Be ɔso misɛ̃ mi situ lɛ ma Egiptese Igarakpakpa gu ɔbara awe? Gɔ Ɣaa ɔbara ma amumuɣɔ kama ne, mainyua Israel mabi sɔ mamɔɛ̃ ma ɔri marui ɣɛɛ?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />"Kiniɔ ne, mibara kabore ɣɛtɛ, si mibie manantsuĩnyimɔ inyɔ ma loɣe abi kere fiɛ maipia ikpuã i ɔme manya. Miɖi abi i ma kɔrɛ mipia i ɔkpã ame, si ka mikɔra manantsuĩnyimɔ i kabore iso. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Misu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka mipia i kabore ame. Misu ara wa mitoregu sikãrɛtɛa wa mito mikpesegu misese wũ lɛ iɣɛrɛkuso isɔrɛra mipia i kaɖakai ame i kabore ame i wã kuruɛ. Iyɔ si minyua kabore si kakɛlɛ kã mɔmɔ ɔri, <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />ɣɛɛ mila miɔnyɔ kã. Si kamɔɛ̃ ɔri kakɛlɛ kã mɔmɔ karɔ̃ ame i Bet-Semes isɛ ne, iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe lobɔ kukpakpi gɔgbe i bo iso. Ɣɛɛ si iiba kumɛɔ ne, iyɔ boatsue sɔ iiɖe Ɣaa ɔɖe nto ɔkpadzɛ̃ bo kutsue, ira nɛ loba i bo ɔri iso kere iɖe."<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Ne ɔso mabara ngbɔ. Masu manantsuĩnyimɔ inyɔ, makɔra ma i kabore iso, ne mamɔɛ̃ ma abi mapia i ɔkpã ame ne. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Masu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka masɛ i kabore ame, ne masu kaɖakai ga ame i kulelei gu aramua wa matoregu sikãrɛtɛa ana pia masɛ i wã kuruɛ ne. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Manantsuĩnyimɔ ɔɣo ɔri siĩ makɛlɛ Bet-Semes isɛ, masɛ i ɔri iso fiɛ mato mabiɛ i ɔri ɔɖuɖu iso, maisɛnɛkɛ̃ makɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ ɣee kubena iso. Ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔsiai ma isɛ iabo ta Bet-Semes kume iso.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Kiniɔ ne i ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne, Bet-Semes maturi ɔwe i kagbolomi ame mala maɔrui kamɔ. Matara anɔ kere, ne manya ndamu aɖaka ne. Gɔ manya wã ne mana isoɣɔ gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Kabore ɔsɛ kaba kaatuĩ i itasiare iwɛ̃ kɔrɛ i Bet-Semese Yosua ɔwĩ ame. Maturi ɔkɛkɛ kabore mabara ala ndɔrɛ̃, ne maɖoe manantsuĩnyimɔ masu mafɛ̃ ara matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lɛ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Ma Levise ɔɔmɔɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka gu kaɖakai lobua iso, nga ame i sikãrɛtɛa aratorea pia, masu masɛ i itasiare iso. Iyi nɛmɔ ne ma Bet-Semese ɔsɔrɛ araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu asɔrɛ matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ma Filistise maɖeisoi iru ɔnya ara ɔɖuɖu wa mabara i ngbegɔ mmɔ fiɛ makpese makɛlɛ Ekron ku iyi nɛmɔ ame.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Sikãrɛtɛa aramua wa i ma Filistise ɔsese <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lɛ iɣɛrɛkuso isɔrɛ ne, ibiara ɣɛ itã ɔmagɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ - Asdod, Gaza, Askelon, Gat gu Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Ngbɔ ame sikãrɛtɛa kulelei ɣɛ i ma Filistise maɖeisoi iru simagɛ̃ kanya ne, simagɛ̃siare dzɛ matsue abere maki malɔ ku sɛ̃ kumagɛĩ kanya. Itasiare nɛ i ma Levise ɔsu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka masia iso i Bet-Semes, Yosua ɔwĩ ame ɔkpese ise lɛ aɖansiɛ i nnɛ loba awe ipɛ ɔwi wɔ matsɛrɛ ara wagbe."<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Ɣɛɛ Ɣaa ɔɖoe ma Bet-Semese sikɔdzɛ alasɔ manyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka ame. Ɔmagɛ̃ maturi ɔwe i isoma ame alasɔ ku kɔrɔ̃ teteree i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖoe maturi mamɔ i ma ndɛ̃, <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />ne Bet-Semes maturi ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Nna loawo ɔya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Ɣaa sekelea wɔgbe anɔ? Lɛ i aɖaka aakɛlɛ si arui i ngbe?"<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ne masese makpabo Kiriat-Yearim maturi kɔrɛ sɔ, "Ma Filistise ɔɔkpesegu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka mabɔ. Miba miasu wã mikɛlɛgu mi kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Ne ɔso Kiriat-Yearim marɛrɛ̃ ɔba maasu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka. Masu wã makɛlɛgu Abinadab iyo i kabemi iso. Ne masekelera ɔ̃ ɔbi Eleazar si ɔnyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka iso.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Ɔkpese Israel Kaɖe Kɔdze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Ndamu aɖaka ɔwe i Kiriat-Yearim akɔ gbodzoo, ɔwi ɔɖuɖu ɔɖe akɔ sinyɔ. I akɔ wagbe ame ne, Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ɔla maɔbiɛ maɔkpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Ne Samuel ɔɣere Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu sɔ, "Si mito mifiriki misiai <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu ne, iyɔ ikote sɔ miaɖi nɖebi mama aɣɔ igbã biara i mi ndɛ̃. Minyua kuɣɔrɔ̃go Astarte arapɔa ana, si mitã mi ɔtu si ɔsia i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso. Misumu ɔ̃ ɔnɔwɛ̃saã, iyɔ ne ɔto ɔ̃aɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i ma Filistise nrɔɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ne ɔso Israel mabi ɔɖi Baal arapɔa gu kuɣɔrɔ̃go Astarte arapɔa i ma ndɛ̃ ne masumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔwɛ̃ ne.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Ne Samuel ɔtã Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu silɔ sɔ, "Isreal kaɖe, miba miasikanya i Mizpa si lokparamakayi lopɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nrɔɔ̃ i mi iti." <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ɔwi wɔ maɔsakanya i Mizpa ne, maka ndu ne mafere i karɔ̃ matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ ne manyikanya ne maɖi ma akpi maɣɛ sɔ, "Bobara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso." Samuel ɔɖe kaɖe kɔdze ɔtã Israel i Mizpa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Ɔwi wɔ i ma Filistise ɔnɔ sɔ Israel mabi ɔɔsikanya i Mizpa ne, ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔtsɛ kakpã ita i ma iso. Gɔ Israel mabi ɔnɔ itɔ̃me nɛgbe ne, manigã gbaã ala ma Filistise ɔso. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Maɣere Samuel sɔ, "Daanyua kayiikparama itã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, bo Ɣaa, i bo iti, si ɔɖi bo ɔbɔrɛgu i ma Filistise nrɔɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Ne Samuel ɔsu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ kosoi ɔbara araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ɔkparamakayi ɔpɛ nrɔɔ̃ ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> i Israel kaɖe iti, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã wũ atsue ne.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Gɔ Samuel to ɔbara araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ne, ma Filistise ɔta mato maba i Israel mabi iso si makpɛ̃gu ma kakpã. Ɣɛɛ ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖu kadoiɖu teteree ɔpia ma Filistise, ɔtã manigã gbaã ne Israel mabi ɔɖe ma iso ne. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Ne Israel mabi ɔbɔrɛ ku siwa i Mizpa matere masiai ma Filistise, mato maɖoe ma i ɔri iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ mabo Bet-Kar karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Ne Samuel ɔsu ita ne ɔkarã ne i Mizpa gu Sen ndɛ̃. Ne ɔtã ne iyere sɔ "Ebenezer" ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ngbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbuai bo ɔsɛ ɔ̃abo ne." <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ne ɔso maɖe ma Filistise iso gɔ itã sɔ maisita sɔ maata mabo i Israel karɔ̃ ame ana. Ayi kumɛgɔ i Samuel ɔwe ngbã ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔle ɔta ɔya i Filistise iso. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpesera simagɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ ma Filistise ɔfɔ i Israel mabi kɔrɛ ita i Ekron isɛ iabo Gat ɔtã Israel maturi. Ne Israel ɔɖi magbamikui karɔ̃ i ma Filistise ɔle kayirinɔ. Ne isobuɛ ɔwe i Israel mabi gu ma Amorise ndɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samuel ɔkɛlɛgu Israel kaɖe ikɔ i ɔ̃ agbanayi tsɔra ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Ikɔ biara ne, Samuel ɔsɛ ɔki ɔlɔ ita i Betel, Gilgal gu Mizpa simagɛ̃ ame fiɛ ɔɣɛ atɔ̃me ɔtã Israel mabi i mmɔ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Ɣɛɛ ɔwi biara ɔsɛ ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ Rama, ngbegɔ i ɔ̃ iyo ɔwe, mmɔ ana ɔɣɛ Israel mabi atɔ̃me. Ɔpɛ isɔrɛkasege i mmɔ ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Kaɖe Ɔkarɛ Sɔ Masɛ Igara Matã Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Ɔwi wɔ i Samuel ɔɔbe ne, ɔɖi ɔ̃ mabirɛrɛĩ sɔ maɖe Israel kaɖe matɔ̃meɣɛdze. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Ɔ̃ ibiete iyere loɖe Yoel, fiɛ ɔ̃ kama ɔre iyere ɔɖe Abiya. Maɖe matɔ̃meɣɛdze i Beerseba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ iisu ɔ̃ nsɛgbai. Manyua ɔri sɛɛ masɛ mabie sikã i ɔri nyanyariã iso, mafɔ kawɛrɛra fiɛ maiɣɛ atɔ̃me i ɔri iso.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ne ɔso Israel makpakpa ɔɖuɖu ɔsarɛ ne makɛlɛ Samuel kɔrɛ i Rama ne. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Maɣere wũ sɔ, "Nyɔ, ɔɔsɛ katɔ̃ i akɔ ame fiɛ fɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ iisu fɔ nsɛgbai. Kiniɔ ne, sɛ igara tã bo si ɔɖe bo iso lɛ kumɛgɔ ise i nɖebi mama pelepele ame awe."<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Ɣɛɛ gɔ maɣere Samuel sɔ, "Sɛ igara tã bo si ɔɖe bo iso ne," nnɛgbe iiwe Samuel ɔmɛrɛ̃. Ne ɔso ɔkparamakayi ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Kã atɔ̃me wa ɔɖuɖu maturi to maɣere-ɔ atsue; iiɖe fɔ masɛ̃, ɣɛɛ mme maɔsɛ̃ sɔ lodaaɖe sigara i ma iso. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Lɛ kumɛgɔ mabara me, masɛ̃ me, mato masumu maɣaa mama, ita iyi nɛ loɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso iba iabo kiniɔ ne, kumɛɔ ame mato mabara-ɔ ne. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Kiniɔ ne kã ma atsue, ɣɛɛ sɛ̃ tã ma si aɖi ara karɔ̃ ate ma kukaakɔ tɔtɔ, si atã matsue nnɛ i igara wɔ loaɖe ma iso aabara."<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Samuel ɔɣere maturi ma nto mabie sɔ ɔsɛ igara ɔtã ma, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Ara wa i igara wɔ loaɖe mi iso aabara i ngbe ne: Ɔto ɔ̃atã mi mabirɛrɛĩ ɔbara karabara ku ɔ̃ kubore iso gu ku i apɔngɔ iso fiɛ maɖe ɔ̃ iso madzuɛ̃se i kubore katɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Mawɛ̃ ne ɔto ɔ̃atã sɔ maɖe makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa, mawɛ̃ matã kakpi gu mawɛ̃ matã siru. Mawɛ̃ si mabara karabara i ɔ̃ kakpɛkɔ̃ ame, fiɛ maasɔrɛ̃ ɔraɖui. Mawɛ̃ aaɖe akpakpɛ̃ra gu kubore iso ara mabaradze. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Igara to ɔ̃afɔ mi mabirɔ̃gomi. Mawɛ̃ to maaɖe ngarãdu mabaradze, mawɛ̃ aaɖe maɖerawadze, fiɛ mawɛ̃ aaɖe boɖoboɖo mafɛ̃dze. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Ɔto ɔ̃afɔ mi nkpɛkɔ̃ sɛɛ gu wainnkpɛkɔ̃ gu nnɔĩ nkpɛkɔ̃ ɔsu me ɔtã ɔ̃ makpakpaturi. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Ɔto ɔ̃afɔ geɖebu ɔraɖui wɔ misɔrɛ̃ ikaweova gu wain ikaweova ɔsu ɔtã ɔ̃ makpakpa gu mabuaidze. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Ɔto ɔ̃afɔ mi maɖaborɛrɛ̃ gu maɖaborɔ̃go gu mi manantsuĩ sɛɛ gu mafirimu sɛɛ ɔtã mabara ɔ̃ mɔmɔ karabara matã wũ. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Ɔto ɔ̃afɔ mi mabɔi akuri ikaweova fiɛ mi mɔmɔ to miakpese ɔ̃ masande. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne mito miabiɛ mikpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔtã mi iwarã ɔbɔrɛgu igara wɔ mi mɔmɔ miɖi iti kayirinɔ, ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iibakã mi atsue."<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Ɣɛɛ maturi ɔsɛ̃ maikã Samuel atsue maɣɛ sɔ, "Ooɣo! Boto bobie igara botã so. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Iyɔ boto boase lɛ nɖebi mama. Ɔ̃aɖe sigara i bo iso fiɛ ɔ̃akɔ bo, ɔɖe bo katɔ̃ ɔ̃akpɛ̃ kakpã."<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Ɔwi wɔ i Samuel ɔɔnɔ nwa ɔɖuɖu maturi ɔɣɛ ne, ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɣere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kumɛɔ ame. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã Samuel mmuai sɔ, "Kã ma atsue si asɛ igara atã ma."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Ne Samuel ɔɣere Israel marɛrɛ̃ sɔ, "Ɔbiara si ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ kaa."<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔba Ɔ̃asarɛgu Samuel</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Ranase ɔwɛ̃ ɔwe i Benyamin kamele ame. Ɔ̃ iyere loɖe Kis, ɔ̃ ɔse loɖe Abiel fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔɖe Zeror ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. Zeror ɔse ɔɖe Bekorat, Afia wɔ lobɔrɛ i Benyamin kamele ame ɔɖe Bekorat ɔse. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Ɔwe ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔwɛ̃ ɔɖe kapoporoi ga lobua kare situri gɔ kuwɛ̃ iisire situri ɔɖo wũ i Israel mabi ndɛ̃ fiɛ marɔ wũ sɔ Saul. Ɔɖe ɔturi wɔ lobua ɔkɔlɛ gɔ matsɔra ɔwe i ɔ̃ imɔiti fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iiwe ɔkategu wũ i Israel kaɖe ame.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Ɔwi ɔwɛ̃ ne, Kis wɔ nɖe Saul ɔse mafirimu ɔyu. Ne Kis ɔɣere ɔ̃ ɔbi Saul sɔ, "Kɔ ɔɖabo ɔwɛ̃ bua so iso si mikɛlɛ miabie mafirimu mibɔ." <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ne ɔso ɔmɔɛ̃ ɔri ɔsɛ ɔ̃anyɔnyɔ Efrayim kabemi karɔ̃ iso gu Salisa awo ame ɣɛɛ mainya ma. Makɛlɛ Salim ibuiti ame ɣɛɛ mainya ma. Makɛlɛgu i katɔ̃ masɛ maabie ma i Benyamin ibuiti ame ana ɣɛɛ mainya ma.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Gɔ mabo Zuf ibuiti ame ne, Saul ɔɣere ɔɖabo wɔ ɔsɛgu sɔ, "Ba, tã bokpese bokɛlɛ kaa, si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, wũ ɔse to ɔ̃aɖaa so i bo iso bowũ, gɔ iisibaɖe i mafirimu iso."<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ɣɛɛ ɔɖabo ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Nyɔ, Ɣaa ame ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ wɔ maturi sɛ mawarɛ gbaã pia i ɔmagɛ̃ wɔgbe ame fiɛ irabiara nɛ ɔɣɛ sɛ iba i ne ame. Tã bokɛlɛ mmɔ kiniɔ, siainyɔ ɔto ɔ̃aɣere bo ngbegɔ isɛ boaki."<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Ne Saul ɔkarɛ ɔɖabo sɔ, "Mme kuso boatã wũ si bosɛ? Araɖea wa boto i bo sikoto ame ɔɔro. Bona kuira boatã Ɣaa ame ɔturi. Be boba?"<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ne ɔɖabo ɔtã Saul mmuai ana sɔ, "Nyɔ, sikãfudza ibi se me. Loasu ne lotã Ɣaa ame ɔturi si ɔ̃ate bo ngbegɔ isɛ boakɛlɛ." <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Ɔwiɔ i Israel ne, si ɔturi ɔrere ɔsɛ sɔ ɔ̃akarɛ ira ɔnɔ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ ne, ɔto ɔ̃aɣɛ sɔ, "Ba si bokɛlɛ boanya kanyaara," alasɔ nwɔ masɛ makpere sɔ kanyaɖidze nɔme ne, kanyaara makpere wũ ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Ne Saul ɔɣere ɔɖabo sɔ, "Ilɛ, ba si bokɛlɛ. Ne ɔso mamɔɛ̃ ɔri makɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ ame i Ɣaa ɔturi ɔwe.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Gɔ masɛ mato maya kabemi makɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ ame ne, masarɛgu mabitɛ mawɛ̃ gɔ masɛ maaɖu ndu. Ne makarɛ mabitɛ sɔ, "Kanyaara pia i ngbe?"<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Matã mmuai sɔ, "Aĩ, ɔpia. Ɔɖe mi katɔ̃ kere ɔsɛ ɔto ɔkɛlɛ. Mitara ngba kato. Kiniɔ ame kere ɔba ɔ̃abo i bo ɔmagɛ̃ ame alasɔ ɔmagɛ̃ ame maturi to maasɔrɛ ara i kasɔrɛkɔ̃ ku nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Kumɛgɔ ame miabo i ɔmagɛ̃ ame kere, mito mianya wũ fiɛ ɔ̃akɛlɛ ɔ̃aɖe ara i kasɔrɛkɔ̃. Maturi iito maaɖe ara gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔba, alasɔ ikote sɔ ɔ̃afere kusɛkusɛ i isɔrɛ iso; ne kama fiɛ mma makpedza aaɖe ara. Mikɛlɛ, alasɔ mito mianya wũ i mmɔ kiniɔ."<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ne ɔso makɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ ame, gɔ masɛ maabo kere ne, manya Samuel, ɔsɛ ɔto ɔba i ma kɔrɛ isɛ gɔ ɔ̃ɔɣo ɔri ɔto ɔkɛlɛ kasɔrɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Kiniɔ ne iyi nɛ lofe fiɛ Saul aaba ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔɖi nnɛgbe ɔte Samuel sɔ, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />"Kɔrãkaɖe ku ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne, nto loasese-ɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ lobɔrɛgu i Benyamin karɔ̃ ame. Sɔla wũ nnɔĩ si ɔkpese tɔ̃ɖedze ɔtã wũ kaɖe, Israel. Ɔto ɔ̃aɖi wũ kaɖe ɔbɔrɛgu i ma Filistise nrɔɔ̃ ame. Loɔnyɔ wũ kaɖe nnya, alasɔ ma kaku ɔɔbo i wũ kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Ɔwi wɔ i Samuel ɔnya Saul ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ iso loɖe-ɔ ika i ngbe ne. Ɔ̃ loaɖe sigara i wũ kaɖe iso ne."<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Saul ɔsɛ ɔbore ɔbo Samuel i kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Lotã-ɔ iti, aawo me ɔɣere ngbegɔ nɖe kanyaara iyo?"<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samuel ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Mme nɖe kanyaara ne. Miɖe me katɔ̃ mikɛlɛ kasɔrɛkɔ̃, nɔme ne miaɖegu me ara. Kɔrãkaɖe kaya ne, loatã-ɔ ɔri arui fiɛ loaɣere-ɔ ara ɔɖuɖu wa mpia-ɔ i iti ame. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Mafirimu ma loyu ayi atɛ ngbe ɣɛɛ ne, daaɖaa so i ma iso; alasɔ maɔnya ma. Ne kama ne, mi gu fɔ ɔse iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu i Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu to mabie."<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Benyamin kamele, kakosoi i Israel kaɖe ame lobɔrɛ. Wũ kalɛ ana nɖe kakosoi i Benyamin kamele ɔɖuɖu ame. Be ɔso ato aɣere me itɔ̃me nɛgbe igbã?"<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ne Samuel ɔkɔ Saul gu ɔ̃ ɔɖabo mabo i iyo kame, ne ɔtã ma kasɛkɔ̃ i ɔpɔrɔ̃ iti, i mma makpedza ndɛ̃ - maaɖe lɛ maturi sitɛ. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Ne Samuel ɔɣere ɖerawadze sɔ, "Su sina dzɛ loɣere-ɔ sɔ sise ise bɔ."<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Ne ɔso ɖerawadze ɔsu sina kukpa gu ara wa lobua iso ɔbɔ ɔ̃asɛ i Saul katɔ̃. Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nya sina dzɛ maɖi masɛ-ɔ i ngbe; su si awe. Maɖi sɛ̃ masɛ-ɔ itã ɔwi wɔgbe, ita i ɔwi wɔ loɣɛ sɔ, 'Loɔkpedza maturi.' " Ne ɔso Saul ɔɖe ara ku Samuel ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Gɔ maɔse i kasɔrɛkɔ̃ maba i ɔmagɛ̃ ame kama ne, Samuel ɔɖegu Saul ika i ɔ̃ iyo isã. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Mata ku kaya gɔ kuɣɛ̃ ka kubɔrɛ ne Samuel ɔkpere Saul i iyo isã ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ledza so, si losɛ-ɔ ɔri." Gɔ Saul ɔledza so ɔro ne, ma gu Samuel inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔbɔrɛ i iyo marui. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Gɔ masɛ mato makɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ kawirikɔ̃ ne, Samuel ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Ɣere ɔɖabo sɔ ɔɖe bo katɔ̃." Ne ɔɖabo ɔɖe ma katɔ̃ ɔkpa. "Ɣɛɛ fɔ ne, tuĩ kɛkɛĩ, si loɣere-ɔ atɔ̃me wa Ɣaa sɔ loɣere-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Ɔsɔla Saul Nnɔĩ Lɛ Igara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ne Samuel ɔsu nnɔĩibui ne ɔfere Saul nnɔĩ i iti iso. Ɔpɔrɛ wũ ɔpia so ne ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɔla-ɔ nnɔĩ sɔ si aɖe tɔ̃ɖedze atã ɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Si arui i wũ kɔrɛ nɔme ne, ato aanya marɛrɛ̃ inyɔ i ngbegɔ marɔ sɔ Raxel ikpibiɔ kɔrɛ i Zelza i Benyamin kume iso. Mato maaɣere-ɔ sɔ, "Maɔnya mafirimu ma asɛ ato anyɔnyɔ. Kiniɔ ne fɔ ɔse iisito ɔbu iti ame i ma iso ɣɛɛ ɔto ɔɖaa so ala fɔ ɔso ɔto ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Be loabara fiɛ loanya wũ ɔbi?"<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />"Iyɔ si ata i mmɔ ne kɛlɛ katɔ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ asɛ aabo Tabor kudziri siare kɔrɛ. Marɛrɛ̃ itɛ ma nsɛ mato makɛlɛ Betel maasumu Ɣaa to maasarɛgu-ɔ i mmɔ. Ɔwɛ̃ to ɔ̃ala kutepuĩ kosoi kutɛ, ɔnyɔare to ɔ̃ala maboɖoboɖo itɛ fiɛ ɔtɛare to ɔ̃ala wain bɔikoakpo ɔwɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Maato maya-ɔ fiɛ maasu maboɖoboɖo inyɔ matã-ɔ si afɔ.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />"Ne kama si asɛ Ɣaa kabemi i Gibea kɔrɛ, ngbegɔ i ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃. Gɔ asɛ si aabo i ɔmagɛ̃ ame ne, ato aasarɛgu Ɣaa kanyamaɖidze ikuri nɛ lobɔrɛ i kasɔrɛkɔ̃ fiɛ masɛ mato maba. Mato masa siwɛ̃ masango gu akasa gu aroi gu masango i ma katɔ̃ fiɛ maala maɔɖikanya. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Siwarã to siaba i fɔ iso ku ɔle, fiɛ fɔ wũ aatsɛ kanyaiɖi ku ma; sito siafirikiri-ɔ akpese ɔturi mama kɔraa. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Si ara wagbe ɔba i ne ame ne, bara ibiara nɛ aɖɔɛ, alasɔ Ɣaa piagu-ɔ.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />"Ɖe me katɔ̃ si ala ɔɔkɛlɛ Gilgal. Nto loaba i fɔ kɔrɛ loasɔrɛ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ gu isobuɛ isɔrɛ lotã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Tuĩ ya me ayi akɔdzɛ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ loaba loaɣere-ɔ ara wa aabara."<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnɛ Samuel Ɔɖi Kanya Ɔsɛ Ɔba I Ne Ame.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Gɔ Saul ɔpɛ ɔfiriki si ɔrui i Samuel kɔrɛ ne, Ɣaa ɔtã Saul ɔtu kuseme ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ ame, ne akparĩ ɔɖuɖu wa i Samuel ɔɖeika ɔba i kame ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Gɔ Saul gu ɔ̃ ɔɖabo ɔbo Gibea ne, Ɣaa kanyamaɖidze ikuri ɔba maasarɛgu wũ. Ɣaa siwarã ɔba i ɔ̃ iso ku ɔle ɔluwɛ̃ ne ɔ̃ wũ ɔbua ma ɔɖikanya i ma ndɛ̃ ne. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Ɔwi wɔ i mma ɔɖuɖu lotsue wũ saa ɔnya sɔ ka ɔto ɔɖikanya ku kanyamaɖidze ne, makarɛ so sɔ, "Be igbã iɖe loɔba i Kis ɔbibirɛrɛĩ iso? Saul ana ka mpia i Ɣaa kanyamaɖidze ndɛ̃?"<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ lobɔrɛ i mmɔ ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Nna nɖe mmagbe ɔse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnɛ makarɛ i ngbe ne, iiɖe ɔse wɔ loɣe ma mato makarɛ ɣee nwɔ lote ma ara fiɛ ɔsa ma kanya</char></note>?" Ne ɔso nnɛgbe ɔkpese simai masɛ maɣɛ i ma ndɛ̃ ɖaa sɔ, "Saul ana ka ɔpia i Ɣaa kanyamaɖidze ndɛ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itɔ̃me nɛ makarɛ i ngbe karɔ̃ nɖe sɔ ikuri nɛgbe igbã ne maisɛ mawarɛ ma i Israel ne ɔso Saul wɔ nɖe ranase ɔbi ne, iikote sɔ ɔ̃awe i ma ndɛ̃.</char></note>?" <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Gɔ Saul ɔɖikanya ɔro ne, ɔkɛlɛ kasɔrɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Saul ɔsekoso ɔnya wũ gu ɔ̃ ɔɖabo ne ɔkarɛ ma sɔ, "Lɛ mise?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Bose i mafirimu kabiekɔ̃; ɣɛɛ gɔ boito bonya ma ne, bokɛlɛ Samuel kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Saul ɔsekoso ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɣere me itɔ̃me nɛ i Samuel ɔɣere-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ɔtã botsue gbaã sɔ maɔnya mafirimu." Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃iɣere ɔ̃ ɔsekoso nnɛ i Samuel ɔɣɛ ɔsegu sigaraiɖe iso.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samuel ɔkpere Israel kaɖe ɔsakanya i Mizpa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Ne ɔɣere ma sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Israel Ɣaa sɔ, 'Lokɔ Israel lobɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, fiɛ lofɔ mi lobɔrɛgu i ma Egiptese nrɔɔ̃ ame. Loɖi mi lobɔrɛgu i inyɛwe ame i sigarakuɖekɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu kayirinɔ.' <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne miɔsɛ̃ mi Ɣaa wɔ nsɛ ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i mi atikpi gu amɔrɛã ɔɖuɖu ame. Ne miɣɛ sɔ, 'Ooɣo, sɛ igara tã bo.' Ne ɔso kiniɔ ne miba i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i mi kumele gu nlɛ ame."<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Gɔ Samuel ɔtã Israel kumele ɔɖuɖu ɔbore miba katɔ̃ ne, Benyamin kamele maɖi i kareremi kanya. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ne Samuel ɔtã Benyamin kamele ɔbɔrɛ maba katɔ̃ i ma nlɛ kanya ne, na kareremi ɔsia i Matri kalɛ ne. Katsɔrakɔ̃ ne kareremi ɔsia ne maɖi Saul Kis ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. Ɣɛɛ gɔ manyɔnyɔ wũ ne mainya wũ. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ne ɔso makarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ira ana mabua sɔ, "Ɔturi wɔmɔ ne ɔ̃ɔba i ngbe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Aĩ, Saul ɔkɔla so i ato ndɛ̃."<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ne matere masɛ maaɖi wũ mabɔ. Gɔ ɔya i maturi ndɛ̃ i mmɔ ne, ɔkɔlɛ ɔɖo maturi tsɔra ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samuel ɔɣere maturi ɔɖuɖu sɔ, "Nya ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi i ngbe. Kuwɛ̃ iikategu wũ i kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ne maturi ɔsia kulu teteree sɔ, "Iɣii iiɖuu! Igara si ɔsɛ ngbã dzoroo!"<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Ne Samuel ka ɔɖi sigaraiɖe kubarara asɛra ɔte maturi. Ɔtsɛrɛ mɛ ɔsia i ɔko iso ɔsu ɔsɛ ɔ̃asɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Ne Samuel ɔɖi maturi ɔri, ɔbiara ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ aɖe ne.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Saul ɔ̃ wũ ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ aɖe Gibea. Makpãrɛrɛĩ mawɛ̃ ma situ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔpɛgu ɔkɛlɛgu wũ. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Ɣɛɛ maludze mawɛ̃ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nda i nwɔgbe igbã aawo ɔɖi bo?" Manyɔ wũ pupurii maibɔ wũ karatã kukawɛ̃. Ɣɛɛ Saul ɔlokanana.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔɖe Ma Amonse Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Igara Naxas, Amonse ku ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsɛ maaki malɔ Yabes ɔmagɛ̃ i Gilead ibuiti ame. Ne Yabes maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Baragu bo kanyakawɛ̃ ku ndamu, si bowe i fɔ kayirinɔ."<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Ɣɛɛ Naxas, Amonse ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Loabaragu mi kanyakawɛ̃ ku ndamu i ira iwɛ̃ iso kere; ne nɖe sɔ loawere mi ɔbiara kuɖearɔ̃ inɔmi loɖi lopia Israel ɔɖuɖu kunuarɛ."<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Ne Yabes matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Tã bo ayi akɔdzɛ, si bosese makpabo Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu kɔrɛ; si kuwɛ̃ na ɔ̃aba ɔ̃aɖi bo ne, boanyua so botã-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Ɔwi wɔ i makpabo ɔba Saul ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ marɔ sɔ Gibea fiɛ maɣere maturi atɔ̃me wagbe ne, ma ɔɖuɖu ɔbiɛ kaku teteree. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Ɔwi wɔgbe ame kere i Saul to ɔkpese i sia, ɔsɛ i ɔ̃ manantsuĩ ma nto mapupuri karɔ̃ kama, ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be nto maturi? Be ɔso mato mabiɛ?" Ne maɣere wũ atɔ̃me wa i Yabes maturi ɔɣɛ ne.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Gɔ Saul ɔnɔ ma atɔ̃me ne, Ɣaa Siwarã ɔba i ɔ̃ iso ku ɔle ne ɔfugu sikpã gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ɔsu manantsuĩ inyɔ, ne ɔtutu ma ɔsu kusɛi ɔpia i makpabo mama nrɔɔ̃ ame maki i Israel karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso, mato mapɛ imomo sɔ, "Kumɛgɔgbe mato maabara ɔturi ɔrere manantsuĩ, si ɔ̃ibasiai Saul gu Samuel masɛ maakpɛ̃ ne." Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã ifɔ̃ ɔmɔɛ̃ maturi, ne ma ɔɖuɖu ɔbɔrɛ masikanya lɛ ɔturi ɔwɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Ɔwi wɔ i Saul ɔsa ma kanya ɔro i Bezek ne, Israel marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖe kukpi alafa atɛ fiɛ Yuda mare ɔɖe kukpi sitɛ.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Maɣere makpabo ma loba sɔ, "Miɣere Yabes i Gilead marɛrɛ̃ sɔ, 'Kɔrãkaɖe si iaɣo kakɔme gɔ kuɣɛ̃ sia kerebee ne mito miana iɖi.' " Gɔ makpabo ɔsɛ maaɣere Yabes maturi itɔ̃me nɛgbe ne, mana isoɣɔ gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ma Yabese ɔɣere ma Amonse sɔ, "Kɔrãkaɖe ne boto boatã iti iyɔ si ka miawo bo nnɛ miɖɔɛ ɔbara."<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Kaɖesɛã ne, Saul ɔɣɛ ɔ̃ maturi ɔpia i akuri atɛ ame; ɔɖesɛrã ne mata mabo ma Amonse kasɛkɔ̃ maɖoɖoe ma ikɛlɛ kakɔme kerebee. Mma lokuti magbanadze ɔsame gɔ ma maturi inyɔ kumawɛ̃ iisiwe masakanya.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masia Saul Ita Lɛ Igara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ne Israel mabi ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Mabe lokarɛ sɔ, ' Saul loaɖe bo igara?' Miɖi maturi mamɔ mibɔ bo si boɖoe ma."<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Ɣɛɛ Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Maibaɖoe ɔturi kuwɛ̃, alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi Israel kaɖe nɔme."<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ne Samuel ɔɣere maturi sɔ, "Miba, si bokɛlɛ Gilgal si bosɛ boaɖi kayi bosiaita sɔ Saul nɖe bo igara." <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ne ɔso maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔkɛlɛ Gilgal. I <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i mmɔ ne, maturi ɔsiaita sɔ Saul nɖe igara. Mabara isobuɛ asɔrɛ fiɛ Saul gu Israel mabi ɔɖe iyi siare.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Ɔɖe Maturi Ika Tsɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samuel ɔɣere Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu sɔ, "Lokã irabiara nɛ miɣere me atsue, ne loɔsɛ igara lotã mi ne. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Kiniɔ ne ka miba igara wɔ nɖe mi tɔ̃ɖedze. Ɣɛɛ mme ne, loɔbe posoposo lofudza, wũ mabibirɛrɛĩ ɔɔmɔ mapia i mi kɔrɛ. Ita i wũ siporoporoi ame ne, loɔɖe mi tɔ̃ɖedze iba iapɛ nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Loɣɛ i ngbe. Miɣere me i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ gu ɔ̃ igara wɔ ɔsɔla nnɔĩ kutsue ame si losu ɔrere nantsuĩ, ɔrere ɔfirimu loɖe ɔrere amumu, ɔrere wɔ lowedza inyɛ, ɔrere wɔ kɔrɛ lofɔ kawɛrɛra loɖe lopɛ itɔ̃me lofirikira. Si lobara nwagbe irere ne, loatã ne kuso."<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Matã mmuai sɔ, "Aiɖe bo amumu ɣee awedza bo inyɛ, aifɔ kawɛrɛra abɔrɛgu i kuwɛ̃ kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samuel ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Nɔme ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gu nwɔ ɔsɔla nnɔĩ ɖe aɖansiɛ, sɔ loiɣɛrɛ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Maɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔɖe aɖansiɛ."<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Ne Samuel ɔsɔgu i katɔ̃ ɔɣere maturi sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe loɖi Mose gu Aron fiɛ ɔkɔ mi mawa ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Kiniɔ ne, miya i ngbegɔ miɣɛ, alasɔ nto loba loakidza mi ku ira nɛ mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ lonyigira mi <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ara bɔlɔlɔa wa ɔbara ɔtã mi gu mi mawa.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />"Gɔ Yakob ɔɔbo i Egipte karɔ̃ iso kama ne, mabiɛ makpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ ɔbuai ma, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsese Mose gu Aron. Ma lokɔ mi mawa mabɔrɛgu i Egipte fiɛ masɛra ma i karɔ̃ gagbe iso ne.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />"Ɣɛɛ maturi ɔɣara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ma Ɣaa; ne ɔso ɔtã Sisera, nwɔ loɖe Xazor makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ɔkpakpa, ma Filistise gu ma Moabse igara, ɔkpɛ̃gu fiɛ maɖe mi mawa iso ne. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Mabiɛ makpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne maɣɛ sɔ, 'Bobara ikpi; bosɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne bosumu Baal gu Astarte aɣɔ. Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne ɖi bo i bo matsirise nrɔɔ̃ ame, si boasumu-ɔ.' <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsese Yeru-Baal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marɔ wũ ana sɔ Gideon,</char></note> Bedan, Yefta gu me, Samuel ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã boba boaɖi mi bobɔrɛgu i mi matsirise nrɔɔ̃ ame i kasɛ biara iso, ne ɔso misɛ i kaɣɔ ame.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />"Ɣɛɛ gɔ minya sɔ ma Amonse igara Naxas to ɔba ɔ̃akpɛ̃gu mi ne, miɣere me sɔ, 'Ooɣo, boto bobie igara si ɔɖe bo iso'- atoasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖe mi igara. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Kiniɔ ne nya igara wɔ miɖi i ngbe, nwɔ mikarɛ ala; minyɔ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛra igara ɔtã mi. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Si minigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fiɛ misumu wũ miwarɛ wũ fiɛ miita miya i ɔ̃ mmara iso, si mi gu mi igara wɔ nto ɔɖe mi iso ɔsiai <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne - iyɔ ilɛ! <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Ɣɛɛ si miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, fiɛ si mita miya i ɔ̃ mmara iso ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔkpadzɛ̃ mi mawa awe.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />"Kiniɔ ne, miya i ngbegɔ miɣɛ si minyɔ ira siare nɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔba ɔ̃abara i mi anɔmi ame! <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Kukpɛ ka iɖe kiniɔ. Nto loakpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ ɔsese kado gu kadoiɖu. Iyɔ ne mito mianya iranyanyariã nɛ mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ miɖiite gɔ mikarɛ sɔ ɔsɛ igara ɔtã mi."<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ne Samuel ɔkpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsese kado gu kadoiɖu ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ ame ne. Ne ɔso maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔnigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gu Samuel gbaã.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Kparamakayi tã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa i fɔ maɖabo iti si boibakpi, alasɔ gɔ bokarɛ igara ne, boɔsu iranyanyariã bobua i bo akpi mama ɔɖuɖu iso."<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Midaanigã, miɔbara iranyanyariã ɔɖuɖu nɛgbe; ɣɛɛ midaasɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, bowũ misumu wũ ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Midaasɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> misɛ miasumu aɣɔ siefe. Aibawo isɛɛ kuiwɛ̃ ɔbara atã mi ɣee aɖi mi, alasɔ aɖe ara siefe. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> iibasɛ̃ ɔ̃ maturi, ala ɔ̃ iyere siare ɔso, ana ne iɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isoɣɔ sɔ ɔbara mi ɔ̃ mɔmɔ maturi. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Mme ɣɛɛ ne, kuiyikuiyi, loɔsiaita lotã so sɔ loibabara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso lonyua kayiikparama i mi iti. Lokɛlɛgu i katɔ̃ lote mi ara i ɔri wɔ nɖe ɔsɛɛ fiɛ ɔya iso. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Ɣɛɛ ikote sɔ mianyɔ sɔ gbaã ne, mianigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si misumu wũ ku ɔnukuare ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu. Midaaɣara ara siare wa ɔ̃ɔbara ɔtã mi. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Ɣɛɛ si mikɛlɛgu i katɔ̃ mibara aranyanyariã ne, mi gu mi igara inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ne ɔ̃awɔra mi.<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Ɔnyagalagu Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Saul ɔfɔ akɔ sitɛ̃ fiɛ ɔkpese igara, ne ɔɖe sigara i Israel akɔ sina-anyɔ. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Ɔwi wɔ i Saul ɔɔɖe sigara akɔ anyɔ i Israel ne ɔɖi marɛrɛ̃ kukpi kutɛ ɔbɔrɛgu i Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ame. Ne maturi kukpi kunyɔ ɔwe i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ i Mixmas i Betel kabemi karɔ̃ iso fiɛ kakpi kawɛ̃ ɔwe i Yonatan kɔrɛ i Gibea i Benyamin karɔ̃ iso. Marɛrɛ̃ tsɔra ne ɔkpesera me ɔsese kaa.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonatan ɔta kakpã i ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze kasɛkɔ̃ iso i Geba, ne ma Filistise ɔnɔ ne. Ne Saul ɔtã mapɛ kakpã pirindo maki i karɔ̃ iso maɣɛ sɔ, "Mitã ma Hebrise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma Hebirse: Ma ame nɖe Israael mabi ne.</char></note> si manɔ!" <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Ne ɔso Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ɔnɔ sɔ, "Saul ɔɔta kakpã i ma Filistise kasɛkɔ̃ iso, fiɛ kiniɔ ne ma Filistise ɔɔtsiri Israel mabi teteree." Ne ɔso maturi ɔta makɛlɛ masɛ maabara mawɛ̃ ku Saul i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Ma Filistise ɔsakanya gɔ maakpɛ̃gu Israel mabi. Ma Filistise ɔwe kubore kukpi kutɛ, kubore makãdze kukpi kukuɔ, fiɛ makpakpɛ̃dze ma nsɛ i ngbã iso ɔsi gbodzoo lɛ iwarĩ awe. Makɛlɛ masɛ maabara kasɛkɔ̃ i Mixmas, i Bet-Aven kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Gɔ Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔnya sɔ maɔbo i imɔrɛ̃ nyanyariã ame fiɛ maɔma mapia i kakɔi ne, matere mawɛrɛ i sikpolo gu awiribi gu ata ndɛ̃ gu awo gu atawo ame. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Kɔraa ne, Hebrise mawɛ̃ ɔwara Yordan ɔwore makɛlɛ Gad gu Gilead karɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Saul ɔkpese ɔwe i Gilgal, makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ma mpiagu wũ ɔla maɔti maɔkpakpa ku ifɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Ɔtuĩ ɔya Samuel ayi akɔdzɛ, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔsɛ wũ ɔwi ɣɛɛ Samuel iiba Gilgal, ne Saul maturi ɔtsɛ isame ne. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Misu araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ gu isobuɛ asɔrɛ mibɔ me." Ne Saul ɔbara araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ne. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Kumɛgɔ ame ɔna ɔro isɔrɛ ɔbara kere, Samuel ɔba ɔ̃abo, ne Saul ɔbɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃aya wũ ne.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samuel ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be iɖe abara i ngbe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Lonya sɔ maturi to masasame, fiɛ aiba aabo i ɔwi wɔ aɣɛ iso, ne kama ma Filistise ka mato masakanya i Mixmas. <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />Lobara adzuni sɔ, 'Ma Filistise to maata mabo me iso i Gilgal i ngbe, fiɛ loikarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kusɛkusɛ.' Ne ɔso iɣiɛ me sɔ lobara araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Ne Samuel ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Abara idzimira, aibara i mmara mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ɔtã-ɔ iso. Si ɔbara abara i me iso ne, tee Ɣaa aasɛra fɔ sigarakaɖekɔ̃ i Israel kaɖe ame ɔwi ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ kumɛgɔ aiwarɛ mmara ne, fɔ sigarakaɖekɔ̃ iisibakɛlɛ katɔ̃. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbie ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ igbã ɔto ɔɖɔɛ ku ɔtu fiɛ ɔ̃ɔsɛra wũ tɔ̃ɖedze ɔtã ɔ̃ kaɖe, alasɔ aibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mmara iso."<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ne Samuel ɔrui i Gilgal ɔkɛlɛ Gibea i Benyamin karɔ̃ iso, ne Saul ɔka makpakpɛ̃dze ma mpiagu wũ ne. Ma kusime ɔɖe lɛ alafa akuɔ awe.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Makpakpɛ̃dze Ɔbo I Imɔrɛ̃ Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saul gu ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan gu makpakpɛ̃dze ma mpiagu ma ɔwe i Gibea i Benyamin karɔ̃ ame. Ma Filistise ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃ i Mixmas. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Mayukukpe akuri ɔbɔrɛ i ma Filistise kasɛkɔ̃ i akuri atɛ ame. Ikuri iwɛ̃ ɔɣo ɔri makɛlɛ kato i Ofra ɔmagɛ̃ isɛ i Sual ibuiti ame. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Ikuri mama ɔkɛlɛ Bet-Xoron isɛ, ne itɛare ɔkɛlɛ Israel kume karɔ̃ i Zeboim Kagbolomi kato ito inyɔ fafuĩ ame.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne, torese kuwɛ̃ iiwe i Israel karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso. Ma Filistise iitã ɔri sɔ matorese si mawe alasɔ manigã maɣɛ sɔ, "Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne ma Hebrise to maabara apɛmi ɣee afele!" <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Ne ɔso Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔsu ma akpuã, awoɖikpuã, nɣɛ gu kunyɔĩ, makɛlɛgu ma Filistise ɔruɛ matã ma. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Akpuã gu awoɖikpuã iruɛ kuɣa ɔɖe sikãfudza kukereme gram fafarana fiɛ nɣɛ gu kutsue iruɛ gu ara miɔmiɔ wa masu makã manantsuĩ ɔɖe sikãfudza kukereme gram ina.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ne ɔso iyi nɛ kakpã ɔtu ɔpɛ ne, Saul gu ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan pɛ lowe ipɛmi ɣee ifele; makpakpɛ̃dze ma mpiagu Saul gu Yonatan kuwɛ̃ iiwe wã.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ɔsɛ makɛlɛ maadzuɛ̃ abebodɛ̃ri i Mixmas.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Gu Ɔ̃ Akpirasarãdze Ɔɖoe Ma Filistise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Iyi iwɛ̃ ne Yonatan, Saul ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔɣere ɔporoporoi wɔ loɖe ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze sɔ, "Ba si bokɛlɛ ma Filistise kasɛkɔ̃ i kasɛ nyɔare iso." Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃iɣere ɔ̃ ɔse Saul.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Saul ɔwe i Gibea kabenya i agoa kudziri kayirinɔ i Migron. Makpakpɛ̃dze lɛ alafa akuɔ ɔwegu wũ, <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Axiya ɔwe i ma ndɛ̃, nwɔ lopia ɔmearapia. Axiya ɔɖe Ikabod ɔnyiirɛrɛĩ Axitub ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, Axitub ɔɖe Pinexas ɔbibirɛrɛĩ gu Pinexas ɔɖe Eli <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔrɛdze i Silo ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. Kuwɛ̃ iitsue sɔ Yonatan ɔrui i mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Abebodɛ̃ri wɔ i Yonatan ɔbara adzuni sɔ ɔ̃ɔwara fiɛ ɔ̃akɛlɛ ma Filistise kasɛkɔ̃ ne; kuwɛla pia i kusɛ kunyɔ ɔɖuɖu iso. Kawɛ̃ marɔ sɔ Bozez, fiɛ kanyɔare ɔɖe Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Kuwala kawɛ̃ pia i kato to ikɛlɛ Mixmas isɛ, fiɛ kunyɔare pia i kala to ikɛlɛ Geba isɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonatan ɔɣere kaporoporoi ga nɖe ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze sɔ, "Ba, si bokɛlɛ maɣɔsɔrɛdze mamɔ kasɛkɔ̃ kɔrɛ. Siainyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abara ira i bo iti. Kuira na iatɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔri sɔ ɔ̃atã iɖi, iki i maturi gbodzoo ɣee kɛkɛĩ kere iso."<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />"Akpirasarãdze ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Bara nnɛ ɔɖuɖu abu sɔ iɖe isɛɛ itã bo; sɔgu i katɔ̃, loabuai-ɔ iso."<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonatan ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Iyɔ ba; boasɛ bofe kagbolomi bokɛlɛ ngbegɔ i ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze pia isɛ, si manya bo. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Si maɣere bo sɔ, 'Mituĩ miya i mmɔ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ boba i mi kɔrɛ,' ne boaya i ngbegɔ boɣɛ fiɛ boibakɛlɛ ma kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Ɣɛɛ si maɣɛ sɔ, 'Miya miba bo kɔrɛ,' ne boaya bokɛlɛ, alasɔ ne loaɖe ikparĩ sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsu ma ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame ne."<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ne ɔso ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔtã ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze i kasɛkɔ̃ ɔnya ma. Ne ma Filistise ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nyɔ, ma Hebrise to makpɛ̃ i karɔ̃ mabɔrɛ i awo wa ame mawɛrɛ." <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ne ma Filitise makpakpɛ̃dze i kasɛkɔ̃ ɔkpere Yonatan gu ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze sɔ, 'Miya miba i bo kɔrɛ si boate mi iwola."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Ne ɔso Yonatan ɔɣere ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze sɔ, "Ya ba siai me i kama lo; <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsu ma ɔpia i Israel nrɔɔ̃ ame."<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yonatan ɔya ala nrɔɔ̃ gu ngba ɔkɛlɛ kato, fiɛ ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze ɔ̃ ɔsiai wũ i kama pɛɛ. Yonatan ɔbo i ma Filistise iso marɔ̃ ne ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze ɔsiai ɔɖoe ma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Yonatan gu ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze ɔɖoe ma Filistise mkpakpɛ̃dze sinyɔ i kakpã ɖeakatɔ̃ ame i ngbegɔ loafɔ lɛ iwɛ̃ inyɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Ifɔ̃ ɔmɔɛ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu - mma i kasɛkɔ̃ gu mma mpia i karɔ̃ iso, gu mma nto madzuɛ̃ i kasɛkɔ̃ gu akuri wa nto ata abo ayu maturi ara ɔluwɛ̃ - ne karɔ̃ ɔti. Ɣaa losese ifɔ̃ siare nɛgbe.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔɖe Ma Filitise Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Saul marɛrɛ̃ ma nto madzuɛ̃ i Gibea i Benyamin karɔ̃ ame ɔnya ma Filistise to matere i iwɛrɛ ame makɛlɛ kasɛ biara isɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Ne Saul ɔɣere marɛrɛ̃ ma lowegu wũ sɔ, "Mika makpakpɛ̃dze si botsue mma nna i bo kɔrɛ." Gɔ maka ma ne, manya sɔ Yonatan gu ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze na i mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Saul ɔɣere Axiya sɔ, "Su Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka bɔ." (Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne ase i Israel mabi kɔrɛ.) <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Ɔwi wɔ i Saul to ɔɖegu sɔrɛdze ika ne, ma Filistise ikpɔkpɔtɔ ɔkɛlɛ katɔ̃ ibua iledza ibua i ma kasɛkɔ̃. Ne ɔso Saul ɔɣere sɔrɛdze sɔ, "Ɖi fɔ kɔrɔ̃ i kame."<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ne Saul gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔsakanya fiɛ makɛlɛ kakpã ne. Manya sɔ ma Filistise ɔkpɔkpɔtɔ pelepele, mato maɖoɖoe so ku apɛmi. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Ma Hebrise mawɛ̃ ma loɔwegu ma Filistise mafegu fiɛ maɔsiai ma makɛlɛ ma kasɛkɔ̃ ne, mapɛ mafiriki marui makɛlɛ Israel mabi ma mpiagu Saul gu Yonatan kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Ɔwi wɔ i Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ma loɔwɛrɛ i Efrayim kabemi karɔ̃ ame ɔnɔ sɔ ma Filistise ka mato marui matere ne, ma wũ mabua i kakpã ame matere masiai ma Filistise teteree. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi Israel kaɖe ku iyi nɛmɔ, makpɛ̃ kakpã isɛ iabo Bet-Aven ɔmagɛ̃ gu kama.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Ɔti Maɣendu Ɔɣa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Kiniɔ ne Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔwe i imɔrɛ̃ siare ame ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ, alasɔ Saul ɔɔkã ndamu ɔnyi maturi ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Sigbarĩ si siba ɔrere wɔ loaɖe ara fiɛ kutsuɛ aaɣo, fiɛ loati wũ matsirise kuso!" Ne ɔso Israel makpakpɛ̃dze kuwɛ̃ iiɖe aɖera kuawɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ɔba maabo ipo ame ne manya kuɣesɛi fere i karɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Gɔ mabo i ipo ame ne manya maɣendu to mibɔrɛ, ɣɛɛ kuwɛ̃ iiti ɔɣa, alasɔ mato manigã ndamu. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Ɣɛɛ Yonatan iinɔ sɔ ɔ̃ ɔse ɔkã ndamu ɔnyi maturi, ne ɔso ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔsɛdziri inyaĩ ɔpia i kaɣesɛi ame. Ɔsu kɔrɔ̃ ɔnyɛ maɣendu ɔpia i kanya ame, kere ne ɔna ɔle ne. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Kere ne makpakpɛ̃dze ɔwɛ̃ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Fɔ ɔse ɔkã ndamu teteree ɔnyi makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɣɛ sɔ, ' Sigbarĩ si siba ɔrere wɔ loaɖe ara nɔme!' Ne ɔso i maturi ɔɔfɛ̃ ne."<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonatan ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Tete ɔbɔ imɔrɛ̃ i kaɖe iso. Nyɔ kumɛgɔ lona ɔle gɔ lonɛ maɣendu mɛgbe kɛkɛĩ. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Tee ibua ilɛ iɖo si marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖe maɖe ara wa mamɔɛ̃ i kakpã mabɔrɛgu i ma matsirise kɔrɛ nɔme. Tee maɖoe ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze gbodzoo mabua."<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ gɔ Israel mabi ɔɔkpɛ̃ kakpã mata i Mixmas ikɛlɛ Ayalon fiɛ maɔɖe ma Filistise iso ne, so ɔɔtu ma. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Ne ɔso mata mabo i ara wa mamɔɛ̃ i kakpã ame, masɛsɛ̃ masɛrɛ gu manantsuĩ gu manantsuĩ abi mafere i karɔ̃ fiɛ mawe ma ku ima. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Ne ɔwɛ̃ ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Nyɔ, maturi ka mato mabara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso gɔ mato mawe sina dzɛ ame ima pia."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Miiɖe ɔnukuare mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, mimeledza ita siare mibɔ i ngbe ɔluwɛ̃!" <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Ne Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mikɛlɛ maturi ndɛ̃ si miɣere ma sɔ, 'Mi ɔbiara si ɔsu ɔ̃ masɛrɛ gu manantsuĩ ɔbɔ me, miɖoe ma si miwe ma i ngbe. Midaabara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso gɔ miawe sina dzɛ ima pia i kame.' "</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Ne ɔso ɔbiara ɔsu ɔ̃ nantsuĩ ɔbɔ ne maɖoe ku kasɛ̃ gamɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ne Saul ɔpɛ isɔrɛkasege ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne loɖe ɔkpɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ ɔbara kumɛɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Saul ɔɣere ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze sɔ, "Mitã bokɛlɛ boata kakpã i ma Filistise iso ku kasɛ̃ si bomɔɛ̃ ma ara, boibatã ma kuwɛ̃ ɔkuti ɔwe ngbã."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Matã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Bara nnɛ anya sɔ ilɛ iɖo."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Ɣɛɛ sɔrɛdze ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mitã bokarɛ Ɣaa bonɔ i ngbe."<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔkarɛ Ɣaa sɔ, "Lota kakpã i ma Filistise iso? Ato aasu ma apia i Israel mabi nrɔɔ̃ ame?" Ɣɛɛ Ɣaa iitã mmuai ku iyi nɛmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mi ma nɖe makpakpɛ̃dze matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɖuɖu ne miba i ngbe, mitã bodzuĩ sɔ mme ikpi ɔrere ɔbara ku nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Lokã sɔ, ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ nsɛ ɔɖi Israel si ngbã ne, nwɔ loɣɛrɛ ne ɔkpi kotoo ɔ̃akpi, nane si wũ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan ɔɖe kɔraa ikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi." Ɣɛɛ kuwɛ̃ iiɣɛ kuira.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ne Saul ɔɣere Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu sɔ, "Miya i kasɛ gamɔ isɛ; si bo gu wũ ɔbi Yonatan si boya i kasɛ gagbe."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Ne makpakpɛ̃dze ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Bara nnɛ anya sɔ ilɛ iɖo."<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Ne Saul ɔkparamakayi ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Israel Ɣaa sɔ, "Tã me mmuai sɛɛ. Kareremi ɔte sɔ Saul gu ɔ̃ ɔbi Yonatan loɣɛrɛ, gɔ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖe ibɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Ne Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mibara kareremi i bo gu wũ ɔbi Yonatan ndɛ̃." Ne kareremi ɔmɔɛ̃ Yonatan ne.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ne Saul ɔɣere Yonatan sɔ, "Ɣere me nnɛ abara."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Ne ɔso Yonatan ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Losu wũ ɔsɛdziri inyaĩ lopia i maɣendu ame lonyɛ kɛkɛĩ loɣa. Ne ikote sɔ ka loakpi kiniɔ?"<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Ne Saul ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Aĩ, Ɣaa si ɔkpadzɛ̃ me kutsue, si ɔkpadzɛ̃ me teteree, si aikpi, Yonatan."<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Ɣɛɛ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Yonatan wɔ lotã Israel iɖi siare nɛgbe aakpi? Kuiyikuiyi! Bokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ngbã ne, nane kawɛrɛĩ iibakpase kabɔrɛ i ɔ̃ iti iso. Alasɔ Ɣaa lobuai wũ i nnɛ ɔbara nɔme ame. Ne ɔso makpakpɛ̃dze ɔfɔ Yonatan gɔ ɔ̃isikpi.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ne Saul ɔnyua ma Filistise kama iti ne makpese makɛlɛ ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ ame ne.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Sigaraiɖe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Gɔ Saul ɔkpese Israel igara kama ne, ɔkpɛ̃gu ɔ̃ matsirise i kasɛ biara iso: ma Moabse, ma Amonse, ma Edomse, Zoba magara gu ma Filistise. Kakɔi biara ga ɔkpɛ̃ kakpã ne ɔɖeiso. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Ɔkpɛ̃ teteree ɔɖe ma Amalekse iso fiɛ ɔɖi Israel kaɖe ɔbɔrɛgu i mma loɔmɔɛ̃ ma ara mafɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Saul mabibirɛrɛĩ loɖe Yonatan, Isvi gu Malki-Sua. Ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi kpakpare loɖe Merab fiɛ kosore loɖe Mixal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Ɔ̃ ɔre loɖe Axinoam, ɔɖe Aximaz ɔbibirɔ̃gomi. Ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔkpakpa ɔɖe Abner wɔ loɖe Ner ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, Ner loɖe Saul ɔ̃ ɔse ɔnyiibirɛrɛĩ. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Saul ɔ̃ ɔse Kis gu Abner ɔ̃ ɔse Ner ne, Abiel mabibirɛrɛĩ maɖe.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Saul ngbã ayi ɔɖuɖu ame ne ɔkpɛ̃gu ma Filistise kakpã teteree. Ne ɔso ɔwi ɔrere wɔ i Saul ɔnya ɔturi wɔ mba ɔle ku kagbegbe ne ɔsɛ ɔfɔ wũ ɔpia i ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ame.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔsɛ̃ Saul Lɛ Igara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samuel ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Mme i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsese sɔ losɔla-ɔ nnɔĩ si aɖe igara i ɔ̃ kaɖe Israel iso. Kiniɔ ne, kã atsue si anɔ itɔ̃me nɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔɣɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔlesate to ɔɣɛ sɔ, ' Loakpadzɛ̃ ma Amalekse kutsue ala nnɛ mabara Israel mabi gɔ mawɛrɛ masia Israel mabi ku ɔwi wɔ mabɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso mato maba. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Ne ɔso kɛlɛ kiniɔ, si asɛ aata kakpã i ma Amalekse iso si awɔra ma ku irabiara nɛ maba pelepele. Daanyɔ ma nnya; ɖoe marɛrɛ̃ gu marɔ̃go, mabi gu mabiɛtɛ, manantsuĩ gu masɛrɛ, kupuapɔngɔ gu mafirimu.' "<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔkpere ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsirakanya i Telaim. Makpakpɛ̃dze ma nsɛ masɛ i ngba iso kukpi alafa anyɔ ɔbɔrɛ i Israel ame fiɛ kukpi kuweo ɔbɔrɛ i Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ne Saul ɔkɛlɛ Amalek ɔmagɛ̃siare kɔrɛ masɛ maawɛrɛ masia i kawɛlagbolomi ame. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Ne ɔɣere ma Kenise sɔ, "Mirui, mikɛlɛ minyua ma Amalekse si loibawɔra mi gu ma; alasɔ mibara Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu kayiribielea gɔ mabɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso." Ne ɔso ma Kenise ɔrui i ma Amalekse kɔrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Ne Saul ɔta kakpã i ma Amalekse iso i ɔri ɔɖuɖu iso ita i Xavila ikɛlɛ Sur wɔ mpia i Egipte kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Ɔmɔɛ̃ Agag ma Amalekse igara ɔnyɔa, ɣɛɛ ɔɖoe ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu ku ipɛmi. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Ɣɛɛ Saul gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze iiɖoe Agag gu masɛrɛ gu manantsuĩ ma nlɛ gbaã gu manantsuĩ kosoi ma mba iɖa. Maibie sɔ maawɔra wã pelepele. Ɣɛɛ ibiara nɛ manyɔ pupurii gu mabɔi ma nna ɔle ne mawɔra ma pelepele.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />"Ibo me so sɔ lotã Saul ɔɖe igara alasɔ ɔsɛ̃ me ɔ̃imɔɛ̃ wũ asɛra ɔla." Samuel ɔwe i isoma ame, fiɛ ɔkparamakayi ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kasɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu gamɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samuel ɔta ku kaya tutuutu ɔkɛlɛ si ɔsɛ ɔ̃anya Saul, ɣɛɛ maɣere wũ sɔ, "Saul ka ɔkpa Karmel ɔmagɛ̃ ame. Mmɔ i Saul ɔɔtsue inyigira ɔsu ɔpia so kuwarɛ, ne ka ɔfiriki ɔso ɔri ɔkɛlɛ Gilgal ne."<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Ɔwi wɔ i Samuel ɔbo i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ ne, Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔfere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ! Loɔbara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> asɛra iso."<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso nto lonɔ masɛrɛ ibiɛ? Be nɖe manantsuĩ siwutĩ dzɛ nto lonɔ?"<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Makpakpɛ̃dze losu wã i ma Amalekse kɔrɛ mabɔ. Manyua masɛrɛ gu manantsuĩ ma nlɛ gbaã manyɔa sɔ maasɔrɛ ma matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa, ɣɛɛ ara tsɔra ibiara ne bowɔra wã pelepele."<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samuel ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Nyua ikaɖe! Tã me loɣere-ɔ nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me kɔmakaɖe ku kasɛ̃." Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɣere me."<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samuel ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Atoasɔ anyɔ so sɔ aire kuira saa ne, aiba aakpese Israel kumele tɔ̃ɖedze ɣɛɛ? <char style="nd">Bosate</char> losɔla-ɔ nnɔĩ ɔsɛra-ɔ igara i Israel kaɖe iso. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Ne ɔpia-ɔ katɔ̃me ɔɣere-ɔ sɔ, 'Kɛlɛ si asɛ aawɔra ma Amalekse, maturi nyanyariã mamɔ pelepele. Kpɛ̃gu ma kakpã gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ awɔra ma ɔɖuɖu aɖi.' <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Be ɔso aikã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> atsue? Be ɔso amɔɛ̃ kakpã ame ara asɛ fiɛ abara iranyanyariã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ?"<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ɣɛɛ lowarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Losɛ katɔ̃me ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔpia me. Lowɔra ma Amalekse pelepele fiɛ lomɔɛ̃ ma igara Agag lobɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsu masɛrɛ gu manatsuĩ i kakpã ame, ara wa nlɛ fiɛ maasu matã Ɣaa gɔ maasɔrɛ wã matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa i Gilgal."<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">"Be nsɛ ipia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isoɣɔ iɖo, araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu asɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ɛɛbɛrɛ lɛ maturi si makã Bosate silɔ atsue?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Iwarɛ lɛ iɖo isɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">fiɛ atsueikã lɛ iɖo sɔ afɛ̃ akpalasa iɖa.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Itaiyaiso se lɛ sibɔipɛ ikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">fiɛ iteso ikpi se lɛ iɣɔsɔrɛ ikpi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛ̃-ɔ lɛ igara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">alasɔ asɛ̃ ɔ̃ itɔ̃me."<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Ne Saul ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Lobara ikpi. Loiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mmara gu fɔ asɛra. Lonigã maturi ne ɔso lobara nnɛ makarɛ ne. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Kiniɔ ne, nto-ɔ i kukpa, su wũ ikpi tsɛ me si akpesegu me bokɛlɛ si losɛ loasumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Loibakpesegu-ɔ. Asɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me, fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛ̃-ɔ lɛ Israel igara!"<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Gɔ Samuel ɔpɛ ɔfiriki to ɔrui ne, Saul ɔpɛ ɔ̃ awu kutsueti iso ne akɛ ne. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samuel ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔkɛ Israel sigarakaɖekɔ̃ ɔɖi i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame nɔme. Ɔto ɔ̃asu ɔtã ɔturi mama sɔ ɔɖe igara - ɔturi wɔ nlɛ ɔɖo-ɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Nwɔ nɖe Israel Ikpawaĩ iisɛ ɔla sila ɣee ɔfirikira ɔ̃ adzuni; alasɔ ɔ̃iɖe ɔturi awune sɔ ɔ̃afirikira ɔ̃ adzuni."<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Ne Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Lobara ikpi. Ɣɛɛ pia me kuwarɛ i wũ kaɖe makpakpa gu Israel mabi katɔ̃. Kpesegu me, si loasumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa." <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ne ɔso Samuel ɔkpesegu Saul, ne Saul ɔsumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne. <verse eid="1SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Kɔ Agag ma Amalekse igara bɔ me,"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Agag ɔba i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ ku kafɔkaɖe ku adzuni sɔ, "Gbaã ne sikpã dzɛ loabɔ kukpi ɔɔfe."<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">"Lɛ kumɛgɔ i fɔ ipɛmi ɔbara marɔ̃go gbodzoo lɛ maiɣe mabi ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">ngbɔ ame fɔ ɔnyi aakpese lɛ ɔrɔ̃go wɔ loiɣe ɔbi i marɔ̃go ndɛ̃."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Ne Samuel ɔɖoe Agag i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ne Samuel ɔkɛlɛ Rama, ɣɛɛ Saul ɔkɛlɛ kaa i Gibea i Saul iyo. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ Samuel ɔkpi ne, ɔ̃isisɛ ɔ̃anya Saul ana, atoasɔ Samuel ɔwe i isoma ame i nnɛ i Saul ɔbara iti. Ibo <char style="nd">Bosate</char> so sɔ ɔsɛ Saul sigara i Israel kaɖe iso.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Ɔsɔla David Nnɔĩ Lɛ Igara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Ku me ɔwi aanyua imararãso i Saul iti gɔ loɔsɛ̃ wũ lɛ Israel igara awe? Su nnɔĩ fere i ibui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ibui: I Israel kubarara kanya ne, masɛ mafere nnɔi i isa ame masu masɔla igara</char></note> ame si aɣo ɔri, nto losese-ɔ Yese kɔrɛ i Betlehem. Loɔɖi ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔwɛ̃ sɔ ɔɖe igara."<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Nda loabara loasɛ? Si Saul ɔnɔ ne ɔto ɔ̃aɖoe me."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã mmuai sɔ, 'Su nantsuĩbitɛ wɔ loiɣe ɔnya la si aɣɛ sɔ, "Loba losɔrɛ ara lotã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Kpedza Yese bɔ ara isɔrɛ ame, fiɛ loate-ɔ nnɛ aabara. Nwɔ loɖi ne ɔ̃ aasɔla nnɔĩ atã me ne.<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samuel ɔbara nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ. Ɔwi wɔ ɔbo i Betlehem ne, ɔmagɛ̃ makpakpa ɔba maasarɛgu wũ ku iti ikpakpa. Makarɛ wũ sɔ, "Isobuɛ ame aba?"<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samuel ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Aĩ, isobuɛ ame iɖe; loba losɔrɛ ara lotã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Misekelera so si mibagu me ara isɔrɛ ame." Ne Samuel ɔsekelera Yese gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ fiɛ ɔkpedza ma ɔbɔ isɔrɛ ame ne.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Gɔ maba ne Samuel ɔnya Eliab ne ɔbu sɔ, "Gbaã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nwɔ ɔsɔla nnɔĩ nɣɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i ngbe ne."<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Samuel sɔ, "Daanyɔ sɔ ɔ̃ ɔɖe ala ɔre situri ɣee ɔkɔlɛ ɔso, loiɖi wũ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iisɛ ɔnyɔ ara lɛ kumɛgɔ i maturi sɛ manyɔ ara awe. Maturi sɛ manyɔ ara kato kato kuseme, ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔnyɔ ɔtu ame."<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ne Yese ɔkpere Abinadab ne ɔɣere wũ sɔ ɔnene si ɔsɛ ɔfe i Samuel katɔ̃. Ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɖi nwɔgbe ana." <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese ɔtã Samax ɔsɛ ɔne ɔba si ɔsɛ katɔ̃, ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nwɔgbe ana <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɖi wũ." <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese ɔtã ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ ikɔdzɛ ɔsɛ mafe Samuel katɔ̃, ɣɛɛ Samuel ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɖi mmagbe." <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Ne ɔso ɔkarɛ Yese sɔ, "Mabibirɛrɛĩ ɔɖuɖu ma aba i ngbe ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ɔbirɛrɛĩ kosore ɔkuti ɔpia. Ɣɛɛ ɔkpa ɔ̃anyɔ masɛrɛ iso."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Pia ɔrere si ɔkpere wũ ɔbɔ, boibasɛ i karɔ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔba ɔ̃abo."<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ne ɔso ɔpia ɔturi fiɛ makɔ wũ mabɔ. Ɔɖe ɔbi gu ɔko ɔrɛtɛa nwɔ kuseme nlɛ fiɛ ɔre situri ku anɔmi fɛrɛrɛa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Ne Bosate ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ta si asɔla wũ nnɔĩ, ɔ̃ ɔɖe ne."<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Ne ɔso Samuel ɔsu ibui gu nnɔĩ fiɛ ɔsɔla wũ i ɔ̃ manyiibirɛrɛĩ katɔ̃. Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Siwarã ɔba i David iso ku ɔle ita iyi nɛmɔ iso. Ne Samuel ka ɔkɛlɛ Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">David Ɔbara Karabara Ɔtã Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Kiniɔ ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Siwarã ɔɔrui i Saul iso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã siwarã nyanyariã ɔba siaɖaa wũ.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Saul maɖabo ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Nyɔ, siwarã lalaa dzɛ lobɔrɛ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ to siɖaa-ɔ. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Tã fɔ maɖabo ma i ngbe si mabie ɔturi ɔrere wɔ loawo siwɛ̃ sango ɔsa. Ɔ̃asa wũ si siwarã lalaa dzɛ lobɔrɛ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ ɔba-ɔ iso, iyɔ ito ialɛ-ɔ iɖo."<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔɣere ɔ̃ maɖabo sɔ, "Mibie ɔturi ɔrere wɔ nsɛ ɔsa siwɛ̃ sango kukaakɔ si mikɔ wũ mibɔ me."<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Maɖabo ɔwɛ̃ ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Lonya Yese wɔ lobɔrɛ i Betlehem ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ nɣe kumɛgɔ masa siwɛ̃ sango. Ɔɖe kpãrɛrɛĩ fiɛ ɔba kagbegbe, nwɔ nsɛ ɔɖeika kukaakɔ fiɛ ɔre situri; ana ne<char style="nd">Bosate</char> piagu wũ."<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ne Saul ɔsese makpabo i Yese kɔrɛ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Sese me fɔ ɔbi David wɔ nsɛ ɔnyɔ masɛrɛ iso." <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Ne ɔso Yese ɔkɔ ɔ̃ ɔbi David ne ɔsu ɔfirimu ɔsia boɖoboɖo ato, wain bɔiakokpo ɔwɛ̃ gu katepuĩ bitɛ ɔkɛlɛ Saul kɔrɛ ne.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />David ɔba Saul kɔrɛ ne ɔbo i ɔ̃ karabara ame ne. Saul ɔɖɔɛ wũ gbaã, ne David ɔkpese ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze ɔwɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Saul ɔsese Yese kanya ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Tã David si ɔwe i wũ karabara ame, alasɔ ɔbo me anɔ."<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Ɔwi ɔrere wɔ i siwarã lalaa dzɛ lobɔrɛ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ ɔba i Saul iso ne, David ɔ̃asu ɔ̃ siwɛ̃ sango ɔsa. Iyɔ siwarã lalaa sɛ sita wũ iso, so ɔɔɣɔ Saul ibɛrɛkɛ ilɛ wũ.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">David Gu Goliat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ma Filistise ɔsa ma makpakpɛ̃dze kanya i Soko i Yuda karɔ̃ ame. Mabara kasɛkɔ̃ i Efes Damim, ngbegɔ mpia i Soko gu Azeka ndɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Saul gu Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsakanya ne mabara kasɛkɔ̃ i Ela Kagbolomi ame. Ne ka maya i ngɔi maledza so gɔ maakpɛ̃ kakpã ku ma Filistise. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Ma Filistise ɔwe i kabemi kawɛ̃ iso fiɛ Israel mabi ana ɔwe i kamama iso, kagbolomi ɔwe i ma ndɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kaɖeisoi ga marɔ sɔ Goliat fiɛ ɔbɔrɛ i Gat ɔmagɛ̃ ame i ma Filistise kasɛkɔ̃ ɔbɔrɛ ɔya. Ɔkɔlɛ lɛ meta itɛ awe. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Ɔsu ayiwa ibɔraikoto ɔtɔme fiɛ ɔpia ayiwa igbegbekpirafɔra nɛ mabara kuwolobai masia iso gɔ ne kukereme ɔɖe kilo siru-ikɔdzɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Ɔpia ayiwa akpiraifɔra i ngba fiɛ ɔsu ayiwa ikpɔrɔ ɔsia i imɔiti iso. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Ɔla ifele siare gɔ ne ɔdziri ɔse lɛ katiwedze ɔre awe, fiɛ ne ibɔrata inyaĩ ɔrɔrã ɔɖe lɛ kilo ikɔdzɛ. Nwɔ lola ɔ̃ ikpirafɔra ɔsɛ ɔɖe wũ katɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliat ɔya ne ɔlakulu ɔɣere Israel makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa sɔ, "Be ɔso miɔba miaya sɔ miakpɛ̃ kakpã? Filistise loɖe, mi ne Saul masande miɖe. Miɖi ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ si ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ i ngbe. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Si ɔba ɔ̃akpɛ̃gu me fiɛ ɔɖoe me ne, boakpese mi masande, ɣɛɛ si loɖe wũ iso fiɛ loɖoe wũ ne, miakpese bo masande misumu bo." <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Ne kere Filistise ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nɔme ne nto loyigu Israel makpakpɛ̃dze atsiĩdze! Miɖi ɔturi ɔrere i mi ndɛ̃ si bokpɛ̃." <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Gɔ Saul gu Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ɔnɔ nnɛ i Filitise ɔɣɛ ne, manigã fiɛ mati makpakpa.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Kiniɔ ne David ɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ marɔ sɔ Yese, Efratse wɔ lobɔrɛ i Betlehem i Yuda karɔ̃ ame ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yese ɔwe mabibirɛrɛĩ fafarana. I saul ɔwi ame ne Yese ɔɔsɛ katɔ̃ i akɔ ame fiɛ ɔ̃ɔbe. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Yese mabirɛrɛĩkpakpa itɛ ɔsiai Saul makɛlɛ kakpã ame. Kpakpare loɖe Eliab, ɔnyɔare loɖe Abinadab, fiɛ ɔtɛare nɖe Samax. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />David loɖe kosore, makpakpare itɛ ɔɖuɖu ɔsiai Saul, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />ɣɛɛ David ɔwe ɔla ɔ̃asɛ ɔkpese: Ɔwi ɔmɔi ne ɔsɛ Saul kasɛkɔ̃ fiɛ ɔwi ɔmɔi ne ɔnyɔ ɔ̃ ɔse masɛrɛ iso i Betlehem.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Filistise ɔla ɔ̃abɔrɛ ɔba ɔ̃aya i katɔ̃ kaya gu kutsuɛ biara itã ayi sina.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Iyi iwɛ̃ Yese ɔɣere ɔ̃ ɔbi David sɔ, "Su atitabi sea lita sinyɔ-inyɔ gu boɖoboɖo akuri aweo wagbe, si apɛsiwa akɛlɛgu fɔ manyiibirɛrɛĩ i ma kasɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Su inyɛndu kuboi kuweo kɛlɛgu ma ikuri tɔ̃ɖedze. Nyɔ kumɛgɔ i fɔ manyiibirɛrɛĩ se si aba aaɣere me ngbɔ ise ma. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Mapiagu Saul gu Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu mato makpɛ̃ kakpã ku ma Filistise i Ela Kagbolomi ame."<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Kaya tutuutu ne David ɔnyua masɛrɛ ɔpia i masɛrɛnyoisose ɔwɛ̃ nrɔɔ̃ ame, ɔpia ato fiɛ ɔɣo ɔri lɛ Yese ɔɣere wũ. Ɔbo i kasɛkɔ̃ ku ɔwi wɔ i makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɣo kakpã ame ɔri maaya i ma nsɛkɔ̃ fiɛ kakpã kulu to. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Si ibara ne Israel makpakpɛ̃dze gu ma Filistise mare ka maɣɛgu so i kanɔsɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />David ɔnyua ɔ̃ ara ɔsɛ i nwɔ nto ɔnyɔ ara iso, ɔtere ɔkɛlɛ ngbegɔ i makpakpɛ̃dze ka maɣɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃akpa ɔ̃ manyiibirɛrɛĩ anya. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Gɔ ɔto ɔɖeika ku ma ne, Filistise Goliat ga lobɔrɛ i Gat, ɔsɛ ɔbɔrɛ i ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze kasɛ ɔya, ne ɔlakulu lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔla ɔ̃abara i aɣiãra ame ne David ɔnɔ ne. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Si Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔnya Goliat ne, ma ɔɖuɖu sɛ mati makpakpa ku ifɔ̃ marui matere i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Kiniɔ ne Israel maturi ɔla maɔɣere so sɔ, "Minyɔ kumɛgɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe sɛ ɔbɔbɔrɛ ɔba ɔ̃aya! Ɔsɛ ɔbɔrɛ ɔyigu Israel kaɖe atsiĩdze. Igara to ɔ̃atã ɔturi wɔ loaɖoe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe karana siare. Ɔto ɔ̃asu ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɔtã wũ ɔyiri fiɛ ɔ̃ iyomaturi iisibatã toto i Israel kaɖe ame."<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Ne David ɔkarɛ makpakpɛ̃dze ma nɣɛ i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ sɔ, "Be maabara matã ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ loaɖoe Filistise wɔgbe si ɔɖi kunuarɛ gɔgbe i Israel kaɖe iso? Nna nɖe Filistise ɣɔsɔrɛdze fiɛ ɔ̃ala ɔ̃atia Ɣaa wɔ mba ngbã makpakpɛ̃dze?"<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Ne ɔso maledza nnɛ mala maɔɣɛ iɣere wũ maɣɛ sɔ, "Ne nɖe nnɛ maabara matã ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ loaɖoe wũ ne."<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Ɣɛɛ gɔ Eliab, David ɔnyiibirɛrɛĩ kpakpare ɔnɔ ɔto ɔɖegu makpakpɛ̃dze ika ne, sikpã ɔmɔɛ̃ wũ gbaã. Ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso aba i ngbe? Nna anyua masɛrɛ kɛkɛĩ mamɔ asɛ i fafuĩ ame? Loɣe kumɛgɔ afɔ so aɖe gu kumɛgɔ ɔtile pia i fɔ ɔtu ame, ɔba aba si aanyɔ kakpã."<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Be loɔbara kiniɔ? Ne ɔso loibawo ika ɔɖe kere?" <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Kere ne ɔpɛ ɔfiriki ɔsɛ ɔkɛlɛ ɔturi mama kɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃akarɛ itɔ̃me nɛmɔ ame ne, ne makpakpɛ̃dze mamɔ ɔtã wũ mmuai lɛ ɔkpɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Nnɛ i David ɔɣɛ ne manɔ masɛ maaɣere Saul, ne Saul ɔtã sɔ makɔ wũ mabɔ i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />David ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Kuwɛ̃ daaɖaa so i Filistise wɔgbe iti, fɔ ɔɖabo to ɔ̃asɛ ɔ̃akpɛ̃gu wũ."<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "David, aibawo ɔsɛ aakpɛ̃gu Filistise wɔgbe, kaporoporoi kere aɖe, fiɛ ɔ̃ ne kpãrɛrɛĩ ɔɖe ta ɔ̃ siporoporoi ame."<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Ɣɛɛ David ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Fɔ ɔɖabo ne ɔ̃ ɔse masɛrɛ ɔsɛ ɔnyɔ iso. Ɔwi ɔrere si dzata ɣee iketeke ɔba iamɔɛ̃ sɛrɛ i ma ikuri ame ne, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nsɛ losiai wũ ku ikpo lofɔ sɛrɛ loɖi i ɔ̃ kanya ame. Si ɔpɛ ɔfiriki si ɔbo me iso ne, nsɛ lomɔɛ̃ wũ ku siwɛrɛ̃, fiɛ nsɛ lowuĩ wũ ikpo loɖoe. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Fɔ ɔɖabo ɔɔɖoe dzata gu iketeke; Filistise ɣɔsɔrɛdze wɔgbe to ɔ̃ase lɛ ma ndɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ kere awe, alasɔ ɔtia Ɣaa wɔ mba ngbã makpakpɛ̃dze. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ loɖi me i dzata mirɔĩ gu iketeke mirɔĩ ame, to ɔ̃aɖi me ɔbɔrɛgu i Filistise wɔgbe nrɔɔ̃ ame."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Saul ɔɣere David sɔ, "Kɛlɛ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔwegu-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Ne Saul ɔsu ɔ̃ mɔmɔ kakpã arapia ɔpia David. Ɔsu igbegbekpirafɔra arapia ɔpia wũ fiɛ ka ɔtɔmedza wũ ayiwa ikoto. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Ne David ɔtɔ Saul ipɛmi ɔmatãra i arapia iso ne ɔsɛ ɔkiki ɔnyɔ alasɔ wã iso karabara iimatã wũ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Loibawo ɔkɛlɛgu ara wagbe i wũ iso, alasɔ wã iso karabara iimatã me." Ne ɔso ɔɖi wã ɔsɛ. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Ne ɔsu ɔ̃ mabɔikɔdze ɔsɛdziri ɔto i ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ame, ɔɖi ata pɔlɔpɔlɔa aru i kaworei ame, ne ɔsu wã ɔpia i ɔ̃ masɛrɛnyɔisose akpo kame, ɔsu iwɛĩpɛa ɔto i kɔrɔ̃ fiɛ ɔtsɛ isɛ ikɛlɛ Filistise kɔrɛ isɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne Filistise, ku nwɔ lola ɔ̃ akpiraifɔra ɔwe i ɔ̃ katɔ̃ fiɛ ka ɔsɛ ɔto ɔbore ɔbo David. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Filistise ɔnyɔ David ɔsese ne ɔnya sɔ kaporoporoi kere ɔɖe, ɔrɛtɛ fiɛ ɔre situri. Ne ɔso ɔnyɔ David pupurii. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Ɔɣere David sɔ, "Kpɛkpɛ loɖe ɔso ato sidziri ato aba i wũ kɔrɛ? Ne Filistise ɔgbarĩ David ku ɔ̃ aɣɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Ne Filistise ɔɣere David sɔ , "Ba i ngbe, si loasu fɔ sosina lotã kurodzai gu kuputubɔi!"<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />David ɔɣere Filistise sɔ, "Ato aba i wũ iso ku ipɛmi gu ifele gu ikpɔrɔ, ɣɛɛ mme nto loba i fɔ iso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Ɔlesate, Israel makpakpɛ̃dze Ɣaa, nwɔ atia iyere ame. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Nɔme ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asu-ɔ ɔpia i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ lowuĩ-ɔ ira loɖe i karɔ̃ fiɛ loatu-ɔ iti. Nɔme ame ne, loasu ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze makpia lotã ɔwiri ame kurodzai gu kuputubɔi. Iyɔ kayiiso ɔɖuɖu aatsue sɔ Ɣaa mɔmɔ pia i Israel. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Mma ɔɖuɖu losakanya i ngbe to maatsue sɔ iiɖe ipɛmi ɣee ifele i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔsu ɔɖi maturi; alasɔ kakpã ne Ɣaa kare kaɖe, fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃asu mi ɔɖuɖu ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame."<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Gɔ i Filistise sɛ ɔto ɔbore ɔbo wũ si ɔbo wũ iso kere ne, David ɔtere mala ɔkɛlɛ katɔ̃ gɔ ɔ̃asarɛgu wũ. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Ɔpia kɔrɔ̃ i ɔ̃ akpo ame ɔɖi ita, ɔpia ne i iwɛĩpɛa ame ɔfuĩdza ɔwuĩ Filistise i itɔ̃gbo. Ita ɔwã ibo i itɔ̃gbo ame, ne ɔrɔ ɔkɔlɛ anɔ ɔfu i karɔ̃ ne.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Ne ɔso David ɔɖe Filistise iso ala iwɛĩpɛa gu ita; ɔ̃ila ipɛmi ɣɛɛ ɔwuĩ Filistise ɔfere i karɔ̃ ɔɖoe wũ.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />David ɔtere ɔsɛ ɔya i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ. Ne ɔmɔɛ̃ Filistise ipɛmi ɔɖi i ne ɔyuɛ ame ne. Gɔ ɔɖoe wũ kama ne, ɔtu ɔ̃ iti ɔɖi ku ipɛmi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Ɔwi wɔ i ma Filistise ɔnya sɔ ma kpãrɛrɛĩ siare ɔɔkpi ne, mapɛ mafiriki marui matere. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ne Israel gu Yuda makpakpɛ̃dze ɔbɔrɛ maya ku kulu matere masiai ma Filistise ta Gat kabɔrɛnya ikɛlɛ gu Ekron kuyogodɔ̃ kanya. Makpikpi mafere i ɔri ita i Saraim ikɛlɛ Gat gu Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Gɔ Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɔtere masiai ma Filistise fiɛ maɔkpese ne, mabodza ma Filistise ara i ma kasɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 17:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />David ɔsu Filistise iti ɔbɔ Yerusalem; ɔsu Filistise akpakpɛ̃ra ɔsɛ i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ikpayo ame.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Gɔ Saul to ɔnyɔ David sɛ ɔto ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃asarɛgu Filistise ne, ɔkarɛ Abner wɔ loɖe makpakpɛ̃dzekpakpa sɔ, "Abner, nna ɔbirɛrɛĩ nɖe ɔporoporoi wɔmɔ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abner ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "O igara, lokã sɔ loiɣe."<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Ne igara ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Karɛ nɔ sɔ nna ɔbirɛrɛĩ ɔɖe."<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Ku David ikpese iba gɔ ɔ̃ɔɖoe Filistise ne, Abner ɔkɔ wũ ɔbɔ Saul anɔ, gɔ David to Filistise iti i kɔrɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Saul ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Ɔrɛrɛĩ, nna ɔbi aɖe?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Fɔ ɔɖabo Yese wɔ lobɔrɛ i Betlehem ɔbi loɖe."<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔkpɛ̃gu David Sirerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Gɔ David ɔɔɖegu Saul ika ɔro kama ne, Yonatan ɔbara mawɛ̃ ku David i siwarã ame, fiɛ ɔɖɔɛ wũ lɛ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ awe. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Ita i iyi nɛmɔ iso ne, Saul ɔfɔ David ɔwe i kɔrɛ, ɔ̃isiɖi wũ ɔri sɔ ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ kaa i ɔ̃ ɔse iyo. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Ne Yonatan ɔkã ndamu ɔnyikanya ku David alasɔ ɔɖɔɛ wũ lɛ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonatan ɔɖi awu tagbaraa wa ɔpia ɔtã David. Ana ne ɔtã David ɔ̃ kato awu ta ɔ̃ ipɛmi gu kuta gu ɔ̃ kafiami.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Irabiara nɛ Saul ɔpia David sɔ ɔbara ne ɔsɛ ɔbara ne kukaakɔ ire iti. Ala ne ɔso ne, Saul ɔtã wũ siɖebia kɔlɛa i ɔ̃ makpakpãdze ndɛ̃. Nnɛgbe ɔwe makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu gu ta Saul makpakpa ɔmɛrɛ̃.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ɔwi wɔ i makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɔkpese mato maba kaa gɔ David ɔɔɖoe Filistise ne, marɔ̃go ɔbɔrɛ i Israel simagɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame maba maasarɛgu Igara Saul. Mato maka aka matɔ ku isoɣɔ, mato masa akasa gu akasa agbã mama. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Gɔ mato matɔ ne, mato maɖi ɔnɔ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">"Saul ɔɔɖoe ɔ̃ kukpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">fiɛ David ɔɔɖoe ɔ̃ kukpi kuweo."<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Saul iiɖɔɛ nnɛ maka maɣɛ, ɔso ɔna sikpã gbaã. Ne ɔɣere so sɔ, "Mato maɣɛ sɔ David ɔɔɖoe maturi kukpi kuweo ɣɛɛ mme ne kakpi kawɛ̃ kere. Ikuti kɛkɛĩ mato maamɔɛ̃ wũ sigara!" <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Ita i ɔwi wɔmɔ iso ne Saul ɔkarã sirerɛ inɔ kukaakɔ i David iso.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Kaɖesɛã ne siwarã nyanyariã dzɛ lobɔrɛ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ ɔba i Saul iso ku ɔɣiɛ. Ɔtsɛ kanyaiɖi ibara ara lɛ iti loɔbo wũ aku i ɔ̃ iyo, gɔ David to ɔsa siwɛ̃ sango lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔsɛ ɔbara. Ifele ɔwe i <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Saul kɔrɔ̃ ɔluwɛ̃ ɔwɛrɛ̃ ne ɔɣere so sɔ, "Loatsue David lomatãra i ibere iso." Ɣɛɛ David ɔtere ne kanya ikpɛ inyɔ.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Saul ɔtsɛ David inigã alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwegu David ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔre kama i Saul kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔtã David ɔrui i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ fiɛ ɔbara wũ makpakpɛ̃dze kakpi kawɛ̃ ɔkpakpa, ne David ɔkɔ makpakpɛ̃dze i ma kakpã ame. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Irabiara nɛ ɔbara ne ɔna isaruɛ gbaã alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwegu wũ. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Gɔ Saul ɔnya kumɛgɔ i David ɔna isaruɛ ne, ɔnigã wũ ɔbua. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Ɣɛɛ ɔbiara i Israel gu Yuda ɔɖuɖu ɔɖɔɛ David, alasɔ ɔkɔ ma makpakpɛ̃dze masɛ kakpã kukaakɔ.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Saul ɔɣere David sɔ, "Nya wũ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi kpakpare, Merab i ngbe. Loasu wũ lotã-ɔ ayiri; tɔtɔ ne kpɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kakpã ku kagbegbe tã me." Alasɔ Saul ɔɣere so sɔ, "Loibaɖi kɔrɔ̃ losia wũ iso. Ma Filistise si mabara nnɛmɔ!"<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Ɣɛɛ David ɔkarɛ Saul sɔ, "Nna loɖe, be nɖe wũ iyomaturi ɣee wũ ɔse kalɛ i Israel kaɖe ame sɔ loakpese igara ɔmase?" <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Ɣɛɛ gɔ ɔwi ɔɣo sɔ Saul aasu Merab, ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɔtã David ɔyiri ne, ɔsu wũ ɔtã Adriel, ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lobɔrɛ i Mexola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Kiniɔ ne, Saul ɔbibirɔ̃gomi Mixal ɔwe i kuɖɔɛ ame ku David, gɔ maɣere Saul masegu i ne iso ne ɔna isoɣɔ.<verse eid="1SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Saul ɔbara adzuni sɔ, "Loasu wũ lotã wũ, si ɔ̃akpese iyebi ɔtã David iyɔ ne ma Filistise kɔrɔ̃ asia wũ iso." Ne ɔso Saul ɔɣere David sɔ, "Kiniɔ ɔri ɔkpɛ nyɔare ɔɔbusi sɔ aakpese wũ ɔmase."<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ne Saul ɔtã ɔ̃ maɖabo silɔ sɔ, "Miɖe David ika iwɛrɛ ame miɣere wũ sɔ, 'Nyɔ, igara sɛ ɔɖɔɛ-ɔ fiɛ ɔ̃ maɖabo ɔɖuɖu sɛ maɖɔɛ-ɔ; kiniɔ kpese ɔ̃ ɔmase.' "<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Maɣere David atɔ̃me wagbe. Ɣɛɛ David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔnyɔ mito sɔ ira kosoi iɖe sɔ aakpese igara ɔmase? Wɛrɛba kere loɖe fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iiɣe me."<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Gɔ Saul maɖabo ɔɣere wũ nnɛ i David ɔɣɛ ne, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Miɣere David sɔ, ' Igara iito ɔbie ɔrɔ̃go iti ara iɖo ma Filistise kulafa akurinyaĩ siko, ne loaɖe wũ matsirise ibara itikuso ne.' " Saul adzuni wa ɔbara loɖe sɔ ma Filistise si maɖoe David.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Ɔwi wɔ i maɖabo ɔɣere David atɔ̃me wagbe ne, ɔna isoɣɔ sɔ ɔ̃akpese igara ɔmase. Ne ɔso fiɛ ɔwi wɔ masɛ aaɣo ne, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />David ɔkɔ ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze masɛ maaɖoe ma Filistise alafa anyɔ ne ɔsu ma akurinyaĩ siko ɔbɔ ne. Maka wã ɔɖuɖu ayi ɔsu ɔtã igara gɔ David ka ɔ̃akpese igara ɔmase. Ne Saul ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi Mixal ɔtã David ɔyiri ne.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Gɔ i Saul ɔtsue sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwegu David fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi Mixal ɔɖɔɛ David ne, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Saul ɔnigã wũ ɔbua, fiɛ ɔkpese David tsirise i ɔ̃ agbanayi tsɔra ame.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa ɔla maɔsɛ kakpã, ayi kumɛgɔ mabara ngbɔ ne, David sɛ ɔna isaruɛ ɔɖo Saul makpakpa tsɔra. Ne ɔso David ɔba ɔ̃afɔ iyere.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔbie Sɔ Ɔ̃aɖoe David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Saul ɔɣere ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan gu ɔ̃ maɖabo ɔɖuɖu sɔ maɖoe David. Ɣɛɛ Yonatan ɔɖɔɛ David gbaã <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />ne ɔso ɔsɛ̃ wũ sɔ, "Tete to ɔbie ɔri wɔ ɔ̃aɖoe-ɔ. Dzuɛ̃ so ku kɔrãkaɖe kaya; kɛlɛ aabie kakɔi si awɛrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nto loaɣere tete sɔ si bokɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame ngbegɔ apia. Nto loaɖe wũ ika i fɔ iso. Iyɔ loaɣere-ɔ irabiara nɛ lonya i ne ame."<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonatan ɔɖe ɔ̃ ɔse Saul ika sɛɛ i David iso ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Igara daabara ɔ̃ ɔɖabo David iraboa. Ɔ̃ibara-ɔ iraboa kuiwɛ̃ fiɛ nnɛ ɔbara ne iɖe kusia gbodzoo itã-ɔ. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Ɔsu ɔ̃ ngbã ɔpia i kukpi gu ngbã ndɛ̃ ɔwi wɔ ɔɖoe Filistise Goliat. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu iɖeiso siare, anya ne fiɛ ana isoɣɔ. Be ɔso aabara ɔturi lɛ David wɔ loiɣɛrɛ, iraboa iki sɔ aaɖoe wũ siefe?"<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Saul ɔkã Yonatan atsue fiɛ ɔkã ndamu mɛgbe sɔ, "Lokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> pia ngbã ne, maibaɖoe David."<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Ne ɔso Yonatan ɔkpere David ne ɔɣere wũ irabiara nɛ maɣɛ. Ɔkɔ wũ ɔbɔ Saul, ne David ɔwe i Saul kɔrɛ lɛ ɔwiɔ.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Kakpã ɔtu ɔpɛ ɔkpɛ ɔwɛ̃ ana, ne David ɔbɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃akpɛ̃ ma Filistise. Ɔkpɛ̃ ma Filistise ku ɔle teteree igbã sɔ itã matere i ɔ̃ kanya.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Ɣɛɛ siwarã lalaa dzɛ lobɔrɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ ɔba i Saul iso gɔ ɔsi ɔto ifele i kɔrɔ̃ i iyo. Gɔ David to ɔsa siwɛ̃ sango ne, <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Saul ɔbie sɔ si ɔtsue wũ ifele ɔmatãra i ibere iso. Ɣɛɛ David ɔkɔlɛ ɔɣo gɔ i Saul to ɔtsue ifele ɔpia i ibere ame. Kasɛ̃ gamɔ ne David ɔna ɔri ɔrui ɔtere.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mixal Ɔɖi David Ngbã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Saul ɔsese makpakpɛ̃dze i David iyo. Ɔɣere ma sɔ madzuɛ̃ si maɖoe wũ ku kaya. Ɣɛɛ David ɔre Mixal, ɔsɛ̃ wũ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Si airui atere ku kasɛ̃ gagbe i fɔ ngbã iti ne, mato maaɖoe-ɔ ku kɔrãkaɖe." <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ne ɔso Mixal ɔbuai David iso ɔsora wũ ɔkigu i fesere kanya fiɛ ɔrui ɔtere. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Ne Mixal ɔsu irapɔa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irapɔa: Iyo biara ɔwe ɣaa i iyo i Israel karɔ̃ iso marɔ ne sɔ 'teraphim' i Hebrew siɖe ame</char></note> ɔsu ɔrara i karɛkɔ̃ iso ɔfu ne arapia fiɛ ɔsu katepuĩ siwɛrɛ̃ ɔsia i iti kasiakɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Ɔwi wɔ i Saul ɔsese ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze sɔ masɛ maamɔɛ̃ David ne, Mixal ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔto ɔnyɛ."<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Ne Saul ɔledza makpakpɛ̃dze isese sɔ masɛ maanyɔ David, ne ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Mikɔ wũ i ɔ̃ karɛkɔ̃ iso mibɔ me si loaɖoe wũ." <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Ɣɛɛ gɔ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔbo i iyo kame ne, manyɔ ne irapɔa nrɛ i karɛkɔ̃ iso fiɛ katepuĩ siwɛrɛ̃ se i iti kasiakɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Saul ɔɣere Mixal sɔ, "Be ɔso asɔsɔla me ngbɔ fiɛ atã wũ tsirise ɔrui ɔtere?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mixal ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Ɔɣere me sɔ, 'Si aibuai me lorui lotere ne loaɖoe-ɔ.' "<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔɔrui ɔtere ne, ɔkɛlɛ Samuel kɔrɛ i Rama ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɣere wũ nwa pelepele i Saul ɔɔbara wũ. Ne ma gu Samuel ɔkɛlɛ Nayot masɛ maawe i mmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Masɛ maaɣere Saul sɔ, " David pia i Nayot i Rama." <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Ne ɔso ɔsese ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze sɔ masɛ mamɔɛ̃ David. Ɣɛɛ gɔ manya kanyamaɖidze ikuri to maɖikanya fiɛ Samuel ɣɛ i mmɔ lɛ ma tɔ̃ɖedze ne, Ɣaa Siwarã ɔba i Saul maturi iso fiɛ ma wũ maɖikanya. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Maɣere Saul i ne iso, ne ɔsese makpakpɛ̃dze ɔbua ne ma maɖikanya ana. Saul ɔsese makpakpɛ̃dze ɔkpɛ tɛare ne ma wũ maɖikanya. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Kawirikɔ̃ ne, ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔrui ɔkɛlɛ Rama ne ɔkɛlɛ itawo siare i Seku. Ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Lɛ i Samuel gu David pia?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Maɣɛ sɔ, "Mapia i Nayot i Rama."<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔkɛlɛ Nayot i Rama. Ɣɛɛ Ɣaa Siwarã ɔba i ɔ̃ iso, ne ɔsɛ ɔto ɔɖikanya gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔkɛlɛ Nayot ne. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Ɔkɛkɛ ɔ̃ arapia, ne ɔ̃ wũ ɔɖikanya i Samuel anɔ. Ɔɖi isɔ̃ ɔrɛ ɔla ibara ngbɔ ikpɛnɛ ɔɖuɖu ku kasɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu. Nnɛgbe ɔso i maturi sɛ maɣɛ sɔ, "Saul ɔ̃ wũ ne ɔpia i kanyamaɖidze ndɛ̃?"<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Ɔbuai David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Ne David ɔrui ɔtere i Nayot i Rama ɔkɛlɛ Yonatan kɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃akarɛ wũ sɔ, "Be lobara? Be nɖe iranyanyariã nɛ lobara? Nda kowũ loɣɛrɛ fɔ ɔse ɔso ɔto ɔbie sɔ ɔɖoe me?"<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonatan ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Kuiyikuiyi, aito aakpi! Tete iisɛ ɔbara kuira, ikosoi iɖe oo ɣee isiare iɖe sɔ ɔ̃isɛ ɔtã me lotsue. Be ɔso ɔsu nnɛgbe ɔkɔla me? Iiɖe ngbɔ iɖe!"<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Ɣɛɛ David ɔkã ndamu i Yonatan anɔ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Fɔ ɔse ɣe sɔ wũ ara ɔbo-ɔ anɔ ne ɔɣere so sɔ, 'Iikote sɔ Yonatan aatsue nnɛgbe si iiɖe ngbɔ ne ɔto ɔ̃amararã so.' Ɣɛɛ ne, lokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> pia ngbã fiɛ fɔ wũ apia ngbã ne, loisidzorogu kukpi."<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonatan ɔɣere David sɔ, "Irabiara nɛ abie sɔ lobara ne, loabara lotã-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Ne ɔso David ɔt a Yonatan mmuai sɔ, "Nyɔ, kɔrãkaɖe boto boaɖe Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyiɖea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyiɖea: Iyi nɛ iso iyomaturi i Israel sɛ masarɛ maɖe ara manɛ ara masakanya.</char></note>, fiɛ ilɛ sɔ loaɖe ara ku igara, ɣɛɛ tã losɛ loawɛrɛ i karɔ̃ iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kɔrãnɔwɛ̃ ku kutsuɛ. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Si fɔ ɔse ɔkarɛ nnɛ ɔso lioba ne, ɣere wũ sɔ, "David ɔkarɛ ɔri sɔ si ɔpɛsiwa ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ aɖe Betlehem, alasɔ ɔ̃ kalɛ ɔɖuɖu to masɔrɛ ma ikɔ biara ara i mmɔ.' <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Si ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Ilɛ kukaakɔ,' ne iyɔ fɔ ɔɖabo ba kaɣɔ. Ɣɛɛ si ɔna sikpã ne, iyɔ si atsue gbaã sɔ ɔɖo teteree sɔ ɔ̃abara me iraboa. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Fɔ ɣɛɛ ne, bara fɔ ɔɖabo kayiribielea, alasɔ miɔkã ndamu mitã so i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Si loɣɛrɛ ne, iyɔ ɖoe me fɔ mɔmɔ! Daaɖi me atã fɔ ɔse!" <verse eid="1SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonatan ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Kuiyikuiyi! "Aɣe sɔ si loɣe ira kɛkɛĩ losegu tete iso sɔ ɔɖo teteree sɔ ɔ̃aɖoe-ɔ ne loaɣere-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />David ɔkarɛ Yonatan sɔ, "Nna loaɣere me si fɔ ɔse ɔtã-ɔ mmuai ku sikpã? <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonatan sɔ, "Ba, tã bonene bokɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame." Ne ɔso ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔkɛlɛ mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Ne Yonatan ɔɣere David sɔ, "Lokã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Israel Ɣaa iso sɔ loaɖe tete ika kɔrãnɔwɛ̃ lɛ ɔwi wɔgbe ame! Si ɔba adzuni sɛɛ i fɔ iso ne, loasese-ɔ kanya si aatsue. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Ɣɛɛ si tete ba adzuni sɔ ɔ̃abara-ɔ iraboa ne, si loiɣere-ɔ loɖi-ɔ ɔri i isobuɛ ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔkpadzɛ̃ Yonatan kutsue teteree ɔledza ikpadzɛ̃. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔwegu-ɔ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔ̃ɔwegu wũ ɔse. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ɣɛɛ nyɔ me nnya mɛ nna katuĩ lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kayiribielea awe ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã, si maibaɖoe me. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Daaɖi fɔ kayiribielea i wũ iyomaturi iso - nane si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔwɔra David matsirise biara ɔɖi i karɔ̃ iso kɔraa."<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ne ɔso Yonatan ɔkã nadmu ku David iyo ɔɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔwɔra David matsirise." <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Ne Yonatan ɔtã David ɔledza ita isia i ɔ̃ kuɖɔɛ ndamu iso ɔta wũ, alasɔ Yonatan ɔɖɔɛ wũ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɖɔɛ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ne Yonatan ɔɣere David sɔ, "Kɔrãkaɖe nɖe Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyiɖea. Mato maanya sɔ ana i mmɔ, alasɔ fɔ kasɛkɔ̃ to kaase kakunu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Kɔrãnɔwɛ̃ ne, ito ikɛlɛ kutsuɛ ne, kɛlɛ ngbegɔ asɛ aawɛrɛ ku ɔwi wɔ i imɔrɛ̃ nɛgbe ɔsɛ karɔ̃, si aya asia i ita nɛ marɔ sɔ Ezel kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nto loapɛ mirɛ̃ itɛ i ne kasɛ, lɛ iraɔ lonya nto lopɛ. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Iyɔ loapia ɔporoporoi i mmɔ loɣere wũ sɔ, 'Kɛlɛ abie mirɛ̃.' Si loɣere wũ sɔ, 'Nyɔ, mirɛ̃ se i fɔ kasɛ gagbe ne; su me bɔ i ngbe ne,' iyɔ si abɔrɛ aba, alasɔ ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> pia ngbã ne, apia i kaɣɔ ame, itikpi kuiwɛ̃ na. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Ɣɛɛ si loɣere ɔporoporoi sɔ, 'Nyɔ, mirɛ̃ se i fɔ katɔ̃ igu ame ne,' iyɔ si arui mala, alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔtã sɔ arui. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Ise i itɔ̃me nɛ bo gu-ɔ ɔɣɛ iso ne, nyigi sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe aɖansiɛ i bo gu-ɔ ndɛ̃ ɖaa."<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ne ɔso David ɔwɛrɛ i karɔ̃ iso, gɔ Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyiɖea ɔba ne, igara ɔsɛ i karɔ̃ ɔɖe ara. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Ɔsɛ i ngbegɔ ɔsɛ ɔsɛ i ibere kɔrɛ i Yonatan kanɔsɔ̃, fiɛ Abner ɔsɛ i igara kɔrɛ, ɣɛɛ David kasɛkɔ̃ ɔse ikunu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Saul iiɣɛ kuira ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ, alasɔ ɔbu sɔ, "Iraɔ kokooko lobara David gɔ itã sɔ ɔ̃isekele i kubarara kanya - gbaã ɔ̃isekele." <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Ɣɛɛ kaɖesɛã ne, iyi nyɔare i kuwa ame David kasɛkɔ̃ ɔse ikunu ana. Ne Saul ɔkarɛ ɔ̃ ɔbi Yonatan sɔ, "Be ɔso fiɛ Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ iiba aɖera kaɖekɔ̃ ku kɔmakaɖe ɣee nɔme?"<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatan ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "David ɔtã me iti ɔkarɛ ɔri sɔ si ɔkɛlɛ Betlehem. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Tã lokɛlɛ alasɔ bo iyomaturi to mabara isɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ ame, fiɛ wũ ɔnyiibirɛrɛĩ ɔkpere me sɔ ikote sɔ loawe i mmɔ. Si wũ ara ɔbo-ɔ anɔ ne, tã me ɔri si losɛ loanya wũ manyiibirɛrɛĩ.' Nnɛgbe ɔso fiɛ ɔ̃iba igara ɔpɔrɔ̃ katukɔ̃ ne."<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Saul ɔfugu sikpã gbaã i Yonatan iso ne ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Ɔrɔ̃go ladze gu ɔtsuelese ɔbi aɖe! Loɣe sɔ aɣɛ i Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ kama gɔ iɖe fɔ mɔmɔ kunuarɛ gu ɔnyi wɔ loɣe-ɔ kunuarɛ. <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Ayi kumɛgɔ i Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ pia ngbã i karɔ̃ gagbe iso ne, fɔ oo, fɔ sigarakaɖekɔ̃ oo, iibaya. Kiniɔ ne sese ɔturi si ɔsɛ ɔ̃akɔ wũ ɔbɔ me alasɔ ikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi!"<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonatan ɔkarɛ ɔ̃ ɔse sɔ, "Be ɔbara? Be ɔso maaɖoe wũ?" <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Ɣɛɛ Saul ɔfuĩdza ifele si ɔɖoe wũ. Kere ne Yonatan ɔtsue sɔ ɔ̃ ɔse ɔbara adzuni sɔ ɔ̃aɖoe David.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyiɖea ikpɛnɛ nyɔare nɛmɔ ne Yonatan ɔna sikpã teteree gɔ ɔta i ɔpɔrɔ̃ katukɔ̃, ɔ̃isiɖe ara, alasɔ ɔmarã so i ɔ̃ ɔse kunuarɛ nsɛgbai i David iso.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Kaɖesɛã kaya ne, Yonatan ɔbɔrɛ ɔkɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame si ɔ̃asarɛgu David. Yonatan ɔkɔ kaporoporoi ɔsɛgu. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Ne ɔɣere kaporoporoi sɔ, "Tere si asɛ anyɔnyɔ mirɛ̃ mɛ lopɛ." Gɔ ɔtere ɔto ɔkɛlɛ ne Yonatan ɔpɛ ɔrɛ̃ ɔɖegu wũ katɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Ɔwi wɔ i kaporoporoi ɔsɛ ngbegɔ i Yonatan mirɛ̃ ɔkpase ne, Yonatan ɔkpere wũ sɔ, "Sirɛ̃ se i katɔ̃ igu ame." <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Kere ne ɔlakulu ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Pɛsiwa! Sɛ mala! Daatuĩ!" Kaporoporoi ɔsu mirɛ̃ ne ɔkpese ɔba i ɔ̃ sate kɔrɛ ne. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />(Kaporoporoi iitsue kuira i nwagbe ɔɖuɖu iso; Yonatan gu David kere nɣe.) <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Kere ne Yonatan ɔsu ɔ̃ akpakpɛ̃ra ɔtã kaporoporoi ne ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Su wã si akpese akɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ ame."<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Gɔ kaporoporoi ka kakpa ne, David ɔbɔrɛ i ngbegɔ ɔwɛrɛ i ita kɔrɛ kala isɛ. Ne David ɔbɔitikarɔ̃ ikpɛ itɛ, ɔfu anɔ i karɔ̃ ɔtã Yonatan. Ne kama ka mapɔrɛ so mapia so fiɛ mabie kaku ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu, ɣɛɛ David ɔbiɛ ɔɖo Yonatan.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Yonatan ɔɣere David sɔ, "Kɛlɛ i isobuɛ ame, alasɔ bokã ndamu i bo kulaa ipia ame botã so i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere ame. Boɣɛ sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe aɖansiɛ i bo gu-ɔ ndɛ̃, gu fɔ ɔɣekparɛ gu wũ ɔɣekparɛ ndɛ̃ ɔwi daaro.' " Ne David ɔrui fiɛ Yonatan ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ ame ne.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔrui Ɔtere I Saul Kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />David ɔkɛlɛ Nob ɔmagɛ̃ ame si ɔsɛ ɔ̃anya Aximelek wɔ nɖe sɔrɛdze. Aximelek ɔti ɔkpakpa ku ɔwi wɔ ɔnya wũ, ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso asɛ fɔ ɔnɔwɛ̃? Be ɔso kuwɛ̃ nagu-ɔ?"<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />David ɔtã sɔrɛdze Aximelek mmuai sɔ, "Igara lopia me katɔ̃me fiɛ ɔɣere me sɔ, 'Kuwɛ̃ daatsue kuira ɔsegu i katɔ̃me ga nto lopia-ɔ iso gu nnɛ aabara.' Ɣɛɛ wũ maturi ne, loɣere ma sɔ masarɛgu me i kakɔĩ kawɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Kiniɔ ne, be nse-ɔ loana lopia i kanya? Tã me boɖoboɖo abo aru ɣee irere nɛ aba."<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Ɣɛɛ sɔrɛdze ɔtã David mmuai sɔ, "Lona boɖoboɖo fefea kuwɛ̃. Ɣɛɛ boɖoboɖo wɔ masekelera se i ngbe, fɔ maturi aawo ɔɖe si mairɛgu ɔrɔ̃go i ayi wagbe ame."<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Ne David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Gbaã ne boɔrera so kama i marɔ̃go iso lɛ bosɛ bobara ɔwi ɔrere loɣo ɔri. Makpakpɛ̃dze iso se sekelee ta karabara ga loisekele ame. Nda ngbɔ iase nɔme wɔ bowũ!" <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ne ɔso sɔrɛdze ɔtã wũ boɖoboɖo wɔ masekelera alasɔ boɖoboɖo kuwɛ̃ na i mmɔ iɖo boɖoboɖo wɔ masɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, fiɛ maɔmɔɛ̃ masu i ɔ̃ anɔ, masu nwɔ mba ɔtɔ masɛ ku iyi nɛ masu nwɔmɔ maruigu.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Kiniɔ ne Doeg wɔ nɖe Edomse fiɛ ɔɖe Saul masɛrɛnyɔisose ɔkpakpa ɔwe i mmɔ, masia wũ kɔrɔ̃ masɛ i mmɔ ku iyi nɛmɔ si ɔledza so ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />David ɔkarɛ Aximelek sɔ, "Ana ifele ɣee ipɛmi i ngbe ɣɛɛ? Loisu wũ ipɛmi ɣee ikpira kuiwɛ̃ loto, alasɔ igara katɔ̃me ga ɔpia me ɔbua kanya gbaã.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ika nɛ David to ɔɖe ngbe pelepele ne, ɔkɔla nnɛ ɔso ɔba i sɔrɛdze kɔrɛ alasɔ igara Saul ɔturi wɔ nɖe Doeg ɔwe i mmɔ.</char></note>"<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Sɔrɛdze ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Filistise Goliat wɔ aɖoe i Ela Kagbolomi ame ipɛmi se i ngbe. Masu ɔkati mamini ne ise i ɔmearapia kama. Si ato abie ne ne, su ne, ipɛmi mama kuiwɛ̃ na i ngbe iɖo ne."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Kuiwɛ̃ na lɛ ne awe, su ne tã me."<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">David Ɔsɛ Gat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Iyi nɛmɔ David ɔpia kama i i Saul kɔrɛ ɔkɛlɛ Axis Gat igara kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Ɣɛɛ Axis maɖabo ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Iiɖe David wɔgbe nɖe Israel karɔ̃ igara ɣɛɛ? Iiɖe ɔ̃ nɖe nwɔ iso maka kuka ku ma katɔ ame sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">" 'Saul ɔɖoe ɔ̃ kakpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">fiɛ David ɔɖoe ɔ̃ kukpi kuweo ɣɛɛ'?"<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />David ɔnɔ atɔ̃me wagbe fiɛ ɔnigã Axis, Gat igara. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ne ɔso David ɔko ɔbara lɛ ɔto ɔlala i ma anɔmi ame. Ne gɔ ɔpia i ma kɔrɛ ne ɔbara ara lɛ lalase awe. Ɔla ɔ̃abara akparĩ ɔ̃ɔsia i kuyogodɔ̃ akui iso fiɛ ɔto ɔsora minyatu ɔfere i ɔkore iso.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Axis ɔɣere ɔ̃ maɖabo sɔ, "Nyɔ, ɔrɛrɛ wɔgbe! Iti ɔɔbo wũ aku! Be ɔso mikɔ wũ mibɔ me? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Malalase loɔro me iso i ngbe ɔso mikɔ nwɔgbe mibɔ si ɔba ɔ̃abara nwagbe i wũ katɔ̃? Ikote sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe aaba i wũ iyo?"<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔsɛ Ɔ̃awɛrɛ I Adulam Ɔkpolo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />David ɔrui i Gat ne ɔpia kama ɔkɛlɛ Adulam ɔkpolo ame ne. Ɔwi wɔ i ɔ̃ ɔse iyomaturi gu ɔ̃ manyiibirɛrɛĩ ɔnɔ ne makɛlɛ ɔ̃ kɔrɛ i mmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Ne mma ɔɖuɖu lomɔrɛ̃ ɣee mato kuso ɣee mapia i ibo gu ibɛbɛrɛ ame ɔkɛlɛ David kɔrɛ ne ɔkpese ma tɔ̃ɖedze. Marɛrɛ̃ ma lowegu wũ ɔɖe lɛ alafa ana awe.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kama ne David ɔrui i mmɔ ɔkɛlɛ Mizpa i Moab karɔ̃ iso ne ɔɣere Moab igara sɔ, "Lotã-ɔ iti tã wũ ɔse gu wũ ɔnyi si maaba maasɛ i fɔ kɔrɛ i ngbe gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ loatsue nnɛ i Ɣaa aabara ɔtã me." <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ne ɔso ɔnyuã ɔ̃ maɣese ɔsɛ i Moab igara kɔrɛ fiɛ mawe i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ ayi kumɛgɔ i David ɔwe i ɔlekasɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Ɣɛɛ Ɣaa kanyaɖidze Gad ɔɣere David ku iyi iwɛ̃ sɔ, "Daawe i ɔlekasɛkɔ̃, kɛlɛ Yuda karɔ̃ iso." Ne ɔso David ɔrui i mmɔ ɔkɛlɛ Xeret ipo ame.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔɖoe Aximelek Gu Masɔrɛdze Mama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Kiniɔ ne Saul ɔnɔ sɔ manya David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔɔba maabo i Yuda. Iyi nɛmɔ ne, Saul ɔsɛ i kudziri siare kayirinɔ i kabemi iso i Gibea. Ɔla ɔ̃ ifele i kɔrɔ̃ fiɛ ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa ɔɖuɖu ɔya maki malɔ wũ. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Saul ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Mikã me atsue, Benyamin marɛrɛ̃! Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ne ɔto ɔ̃atã mi ɔɖuɖu kukpɛkɔ̃ gu wainnkpɛkɔ̃? Ɔto ɔ̃abara mi ɔɖuɖu matɔ̃ɖedze ɔtã makpakpɛ̃dze kukpi gu makpakpɛ̃dze alafa? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ɛɛbɛrɛ ne ɔso i mi ɔɖudu ɔɔbara kanya kawɛ̃ mita miɣɛ me iso? Mi kuwɛ̃ iiɣere me ɔwi wɔ i wũ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔbara kanyakawɛ̃ ndamu ku Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. Miisu kuira i wũ iso. Yese ɔbi ne, wũ ɔɖabo ɔɖe, ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne wũ ɔbi to ɔtã wũ katetere sɔ ɔwɛrɛ ɔsia si ɔ̃abo me iso ɔluwɛ̃, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔto ɔbara ku nɔme."<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Ɣɛɛ Doeg Edomse wɔ nɣɛgu Saul makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Lonya Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔba Aximelek wɔ nɖe Axitub ɔbibirɛrɛĩ kɔrɛ i Nob. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Aximelek ɔkarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nnɛ i David aabara. Ne Aximelek ɔtã David araɖea gu Filistise Goliat ipɛmi ana ne."<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Ne igara ɔpia ɔturi ɔsese sɔrɛdze Aximelek, Axitub ɔbibirɛrɛĩ gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu ma nɖe masɔrɛdze i Nob kɔrɛ ne. Ne ma ɔɖuɖu ɔba igara kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, " Kiniɔ ne, kã atsue Axitub ɔbibirɛrɛĩ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Aĩ, wũ sate." <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Saul ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Be ɔso mi gu Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔbara adzuni lalaa i wũ iso? Be ɔso atã wũ araɖea gu ipɛmi? Be ɔso akarɛ Ɣaa ira anɔ atã wũ? Be ɔso atã sɔ ɔta ɔya me iso si ɔwɛrɛ ɔsia gɔ ɔ̃abo me iso ku nɔme?"<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Aximelek ɔtã igara mmuai sɔ, "Nna nɖe ɔnukuarese lɛ David, igara ɔmase, i fɔ maɖabo ɔɖuɖu ndɛ̃? Ɔ̃ nɖe fɔ madzuɛ̃se tɔ̃ɖedze fiɛ ɔturi biara i fɔ iyomaturi ame sɛ ɔwarɛ wũ gbaã! <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Ana ne nnɛgbe iiɖe ɔkpɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ wɔ lokarɛ Ɣaa sɔ ɔɣere David nnɛ sɔ ɔbara. Igara si ɔdaakidza me ɣee wũ ɔse iyomaturi kuwɛ̃, alasɔ fɔ ɔɖabo iiɣe kuira i itɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu nɛgbe iso."<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Ɣɛɛ igara ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Aximelek gbaã ne, mi gu fɔ ɔse iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu to miakpi."<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ne igara ɔtã madzuɛ̃se ma i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ silɔ sɔ, "Mifiriki si miɖoe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> masɔrɛdze, alasɔ ma wũ ka masia i David iso. Maɣe sɔ ɔtere ɔto ɣɛɛ maiɣere me."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Ɣɛɛ igara makpakpa iibie sɔ maaɖi kɔrɔ̃ masia i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> masɔrɛdze iso.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Ne igara ɔtã Doeg silɔ sɔ, "Firiki si aɖoe masɔrɛdze." Ne ɔso Edomse Doeg ɔfiriki ne ɔɖoe ma ne. Ɔɖoe maturi fasifasina-iru ma loɖe masɔrɛdze ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɖoe maturi gbodzoo i Nob, masɔrɛdze ɔmagɛ̃. Ɔɖoe marɛrɛ̃, marɔ̃go, mabiɛtɛ, mabinya, manantsuĩ, mafirimu gu masɛrɛ i mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Ɣɛɛ Abiatar, Aximelek ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, fiɛ Aximelek ɔɖe Axitub ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, ɔpia kama ɔtere ɔsɛ ɔ̃abua i David iso. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Ɔɣere David sɔ Saul ɔɔɖoe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> masɔrɛdze. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ne David ɔɣere Abiatar sɔ, "Iyi nɛmɔ gɔ i Edomse Doeg ɔwe i mmɔ ne, lotsue sɔ ɔto ɔ̃aɣere Saul kokooko. Mme wũ iti ɔso maɖoe fɔ ɔse iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />We i wũ kɔrɛ; daanigã. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ nto ɔti fɔ ngbã kama ne, mme wũ ɔto ɔti wũ mire kama. Ato aawegu me i kaɣɔ ame."<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔɖi Keilax Ɔmagɛ̃ Maturi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Ɔwi wɔ maɣere David sɔ, "Nyɔ, ma Filistise to makpɛ̃gu Keilax maturi fiɛ mato mayu ma kamɔ i amɔtu ne," <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />David ɔkarɛ ɔnɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ sɔ, "Losɛ loakpɛ̃gu ma Filistise magbe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Kɛlɛ aata kakpã i ma Filistise iso si aɖi Keilax maturi."<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Ɣɛɛ David marɛrɛ̃ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Bopia i Yuda ngbe kɔraa boto bonigã. Ito iawe bo ifɔ̃ gbaã si bokɛlɛ Keilax boakpɛ̃gu ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze!"<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Ne David ɔledza <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikarɛ ana, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Kɛlɛ Keilax, alasɔ nto loasu ma Filistise lopia-ɔ i nrɔɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ne ɔso David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔkɛlɛ Keilax masɛ maakpɛ̃gu ma Filistise, masore ma iyomabɔi. David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖoe ma Filistise gbodzoo fiɛ ɔɖi Keilax maturi. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />(Kiniɔ ne, Aximelek ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, Abiatar ɔɔsu masɔrɛdze ɔmearapia ɔbɔ ku ɔwi wɔ ɔtere ɔba David kɔrɛ i Keilax.)<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔtere Ɔti David Kama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Ɔnyiiɔ ɔɣere Saul sɔ David ka ɔkpa Keilax. Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɣaa ɔɔsu wũ ɔpia i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame, alasɔ David ɔɔtɛ̃ so ɔpia lɛ yorɛdze awe iki gɔ ɔbo ɔmagɛ̃ ku kuyogodɔ̃ gu isɛ̃sidziri." <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ne Saul ɔkpere ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu, si makɛlɛ Keilax masɛ maki malɔ mabo David gu ɔ̃ maturi iso.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔtsue sɔ Saul to ɔbara ɔriita adzuni i ɔ̃ iso ne, ɔɣere Abiatar sɔrɛdze sɔ, "Su ɔmearapia bɔ." <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "O <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Israel Ɣaa, fɔ ɔɖabo ɔɔnɔ sɔ Saul ɔɔbara adzuni sɔ ɔ̃aba ɔ̃awɔra Keilax ɔmagɛ̃ ala wũ ɔso. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Keilax kaɖemabi aaɖi me matã Saul? Saul to ɔ̃aba i ngbe lɛ lonɔ? O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Israel Ɣaa, Loto-ɔ i kukpa ɣere fɔ ɔɖabo."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔto ɔ̃aba."<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />David ɔledza ikarɛ ana sɔ, "Keilax kaɖemabi aaɖi bo gu wũ marɛrɛ̃ matã Saul?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Mato maaɖi-ɔ matã."<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ne ɔso David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ lɛ alafa akuɔ, ɔrui i Keilax, mala maɔta i kakɔi kawɛ̃ makɛlɛ kakɔi mama. Gɔ Saul ɔnɔ sɔ David ɔɔpia kama ɔbɔrɛ i Keilax ne, Saul iisikɛlɛ mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />David ɔwe i fafuĩ ame kuwɛrɛkɔ̃ gu i kubemi ame i Zif fafuĩ ame. Saul ɔla ɔ̃abie wũ ku iyi biara, ɣɛɛ Ɣaa iisu David ɔpia wũ i nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔwe i Xores i Zif Fafuĩ ame ne, ɔnɔ sɔ Saul sɛ i ɔri ɔto ɔba Zif; si ɔba ɔ̃aɖoe wũ. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Ne Saul ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan ɔkɛlɛ David kɔrɛ i Xores ɔsɛ ɔ̃apia wũ katetere sɔ ɔwe ɔle i Ɣaa ame. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Daanigã, wũ ɔse Saul iibasia kɔrɔ̃ i fɔ iso. Ato aaɖe igara i Israel fiɛ mme losiai i fɔ kama. Saul, wũ ɔse mɔmɔ ana kɔraa ɣe nnɛgbe." <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Yonatan gu David ɔbara ndamu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Ne Yonatan ɔkɛlɛ kaa, ɣɛɛ David ɔwe i Xores.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Zif maturi ɔsɛ Saul kɔrɛ i Gibea masɛ maaɣɛ sɔ, "David wɛrɛ i bo kɔrɛ i Xores kuwɛrɛkɔ̃ i Xakila kabemi ame i Yesimon kala. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />O igara, kiniɔ ne, ɔwi ɔrere aɖɔɛ ne ba, iyɔ boto boamɔɛ̃ wũ bopia-ɔ i igara nrɔɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔfere mi kusɛkusɛ ala misu ira i wũ iso. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Mikɛlɛ mialedza ara ame inyɔ kukaakɔ. Minyɔ ne ame si mitsue ngbegɔ i David sɛ ɔɖɔɛ isɛ gu nwɔ lonya wũ i mmɔ. Masɛ maɣere me sɔ ɔbua ɔbe anɔ gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Mibie ngbegɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ ɔwɛrɛ si mikpese miba miatã me ne itsue kukaakɔ. Iyɔ loakɛlɛgu mi, si ɔpia i ndɛ̃mɔ, loapɛti wũ lonya wũ i Yuda nlɛ ɔɖuɖu ame."<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Ne ɔso maɣo ɔri maɖe Saul katɔ̃ makɛlɛ Zif. Kiniɔ ne David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔwe i Maon Fafuĩ ame, i Araba i Yesimon kala. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Saul gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔtsɛ David inyɔnyɔ. Gɔ maɣere David ne, ɔso ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃awe i itasiare kɔrɛ i Maon Fafuĩ ame. Gɔ Saul ɔnɔ nnɛgbe ne ɔti David kama ɔkɛlɛ Maon Fafuĩ ame.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Saul gu ɔ̃ maturi sɛ i kube kasɛ kawɛ̃, fiɛ David gu ɔ̃ maturi ana ɔwe i kasɛ nyɔare isɛ, mato mapɛsiwa matere i Saul kɔrɛ. Gɔ ame i Saul gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ka mato mabore mabo maba maamɔɛ̃ David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ne, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />kpabo ɔba Saul kɔrɛ ku kanya sɔ, "Ba mala! Ma Filistise ɔɔta mabo i karɔ̃ ame lo!" <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔnyua itere isiai David, ne Saul ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃akpɛ̃gu ma Filistise. Ne ɔso mato makpere kakɔi gagbe sɔ ita nɛ kɔrɛ maɣɛ so siri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ita nɛ kɔrɛ maɣɛ so siri: Sela Xamaxlekot</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Ne David ɔrui i mmɔ ɔya ɔbɔrɛ i mmɔ ɔsɛ ɔ̃awe i En Gedi kuwɛrɛkɔ̃ ne.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔtã Saul Ɔwe Ngbã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Gɔ Saul ɔsɛ ɔ̃akpɛ̃gu ma Filistise ɔkpese ɔba kama ne, maɣere wũ sɔ, "David pia i En Gedi Fafuĩ ame." <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔsu makpakpɛ̃dze ma nlɛ maɖo kukpi kutɛ ma maɖi i Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ame. Ne makɛlɛ masɛ mato manyɔnyɔ David gu ɔ̃ maturi i Kupututepuĩ Ata kɔrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Ɔsɛ ɔba masɛrɛrrerɔ̃ sikpã dzɛ mpia i ɔri kuruɛ iso, ɔkpolo ɔwɛ̃ pia i mmɔ, ne Saul ɔkɛlɛ mmɔ sɔ ɔ̃asɛ ɔdziriso. David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ana ɔwe i ɔkpolo kame isɛ dzoroo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ne David marɛrɛ̃ ɔɣɛ siwɔwɔi sɔ, "Nɔme nɖe iyi nɛ iso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖeika ku ɔwi wɔ ɔɣere-ɔ sɔ, 'Loasu fɔ tsirise lopia-ɔ i nrɔɔ̃ ame sɔ abara wũ lɛ abie.' " Ne David ɔkpɛ̃ pɔkɔsɔɔ ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃atu Saul awu tagbaraa wa ɔpia kutsueti kasɛi gɔ Saul iitsue.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Ne kama David kaɣere ɔɖaa wũ gbaã alasɔ ɔtu Saul awu kutsueti <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Ɔɣere ɔ̃ maturi sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> daatã me ɔri sɔ loabara ne igbã i wũ sate, ɣee lotara kɔrɔ̃ losia wũ iso; ala nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ ɔɖe ɔso." <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />David ɔsu atɔ̃me wagbe ɔsɛ̃ ɔtã ɔ̃ maturi sɔ madaata mabo i Saul iso. Ne Saul ɔrui i ɔkpolo kɔrɛ ɔɣo ɔri ne. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Ne David ɔbɔrɛ i ɔkpolo ame ne ɔlakulu ɔkpere Saul sɔ, "Igara, wũ sate!" Gɔ Saul ɔpɛ ɔfiriki ɔnyɔ kama ne, David ɔbɔitikarɔ̃ fiɛ ka ɔkɔlɛ ɔfu ku anɔ i karɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Be ɔso ato akã atsue gɔ maturi to maɣɛ sɔ, 'David to ɔbie teteree sɔ ɔ̃aɖoe-ɔ'? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Nɔme ne ɔɔnya kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu-ɔ ɔpia me i nrɔɔ̃ ame i ɔkpolo ame. Mawɛ̃ ɔɣere me sɔ loɖoe-ɔ, ɣɛɛ lonyua-ɔ; loɣɛ sɔ, 'Loibatara kɔrɔ̃ losia i wũ sate iso, alasɔ nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ ɔɖe.' <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Nyɔ, tete, nyɔ fɔ awu tagbaraa kasɛi ga nto i kɔrɔ̃ ame! Lotu kã loɖi i fɔ awu tagbaraa kutsueti iso ɣɛɛ loiɖoe-ɔ. Kiniɔ ne nɔkarɔ̃ si atsue sɔ lona adzuni sɔ loabara-ɔ iraboa ɣee lota loya-ɔ iso. Loiɣɛrɛ-ɔ, ɣɛɛ ato agbere me si aɖoe me. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔɣɛ itɔ̃me i bo gu-ɔ ndɛ̃. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔti-ɔ kuso i aranyanyariã wa ato abara me iti, ɣɛɛ loibabara-ɔ kuira. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Lɛ kumɛgɔ masɛ maɣɛ kokooko sɔ, "Maturi nyanyariã nsɛ mabara aranyanyariã,' ne ɔso loibabara-ɔ kuira.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />"Nna i Israel igara ɔbɔrɛ si ɔmɔɛ̃? Nna ato ati kama? Lona kuɣa lɛ kpɛkpɛ kpia ɣee toto. <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔɖe bo tɔ̃meɣɛdze si ɔɖaɛ itɔ̃me i bo gu-ɔ ndɛ̃. Ɔbo i itɔ̃me ame si ɔfɔ me, si ɔɖi ɔte sɔ loiɣɛrɛ si ɔfɔ me i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame."<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔro nnɛgbe iɣɛ ne, Saul ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Wũ ɔbi David, fɔ silɔ siɖe i mmɔ?" Ne ɔtsɛ ibiɛ teteree. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ase bɔlɔlɔ aɖo me, ɔɔbara me isɛɛ ɣɛɛ lobara-ɔ ilalaa. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Kiniɔ kere aɣere me isɛɛ nɛ abara me, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu me ɔpia-ɔ i nrɔɔ̃ ame, ɣɛɛ aiɖoe me. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Si ɔturi ɔnya ɔ̃ tsirise ne, ɔsɛ ɔnyua wũ ɔrui kere sɔ ɔ̃ibabara wũ iraboa? <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔtã-ɔ kuso kukaakɔ i kumɛgɔ abara me nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Loɣe sɔ gbaã ne ato aaɖe igara fiɛ Israel sigarakaɖekɔ̃ aya i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Kiniɔ ne kã ndamu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso tã me sɔ aibawɔra wũ ɔkparɛ ɣee anukutu wũ iyere i wũ ɔse iyomaturi ame."<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Ne ɔso David ɔkã ndamu ɔtã Saul. Ne Saul ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ kaa, ɣɛɛ David gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔrui makɛlɛ kawɛrɛkɔ̃.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Kiniɔ ne Samuel ɔkpi, ne Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ɔsakanya mabiɛ wũ. Ne ka mabiara wũ i ɔ̃ aɖe i Rama ne.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 25:1">David Gu Abigail</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Ne David ɔso ɔkɛlɛ Maon Fafuĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maon Fafuĩ: Ne ame nɖe Paran fafuĩ ne.</char></note> ame ne. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ lobɔrɛ i Maon ɔmagɛ̃ ame ɔwe karɔ̃ i Karmel. Ɔwe karana gbaã; kutepuĩ kakpi kawɛ̃, masɛrɛrerɔ̃ kukpi kutɛ ma siwɛrɛ̃ ɔla ɔ̃akparɛ̃ i Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Ɔ̃ iyere loɖe Nabal fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔre iyere loɖe Abigail. Abigail ɔre situri fiɛ ɔtsue iwola gbaã, ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ ɔrã wɔ lobɔrɛ i Kaleb ɔkparɛ ame ɔɖe ɔtilese fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔnyɔ maturi nnya kɔraa.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Gɔ David ɔwe i fafuĩ ame ne, ɔnɔ sɔ Nabal to ɔkparɛ̃ ɔ̃ masɛrɛrerɔ̃ siwɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Ne ɔso David ɔsese maporoporoi iweo ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Misɛ Nabal kɔrɛ i Karmel si miya wũ mitã me. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Miɣere wũ sɔ, "Sɛ ngbã dzoroo! Isosarɛ ita mi gu fɔ iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu! Ara si alɛgu irabiara nɛ aba!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />" 'Kiniɔ lonɔ sɔ masɛrɛrerɔ̃ siwɛrɛ̃ ikparɛ̃ ɔwi iɖe. Ɔwi wɔ i fɔ masɛrɛnyɔisose ɔwe i bo kɔrɛ ne, boila ma ku kubena fiɛ ɔwi ɔɖuɖu wɔ mawe i Karmel ne ma kuira iiyu. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Karɛ fɔ mɔmɔ maɖabo si maɣere-ɔ. Ne ɔso nyɔ wũ maporoporoi nnya, gɔ boba i iyiɖea ɔwi ame. Nto-ɔ i kukpa tã fɔ maɖabo gu fɔ ɔbi David irere nɛ awo.' "<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Ɔwi wɔ i David maturi ɔba maabo ne, maɣere Nabal, David kanya. Ne mawe masia i mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabal ɔtã David maturi mmuai sɔ, "Nna nɖe David? Nna nɖe Yese ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔgbe? Maɖabo gbodzoo kato marui matere i ma makɔse kɔrɛ kiniɔgbe. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Be ɔso loasu wũ aɖera gu ndu gu mabɔi ma loɖoe sina, i mma lokparɛ̃ siwɛrɛ̃ iyere ame, lotã maturi ma loiɣe ngbegɔ mabɔrɛ?"<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />David maturi ɔpɛ mafiriki makpese makɛlɛ. Gɔ masɛ maabo ne, maɣere David irabiara nɛ loba. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />David ɔɣere ɔ̃ maturi sɔ, "Misu mi apɛmi misarã!" Ne ɔso masu ma apɛmi masarã, fiɛ David ɔ̃ wũ ɔsarã ɔ̃ ire. Maturi lɛ alafa ana awe ɔkɛlɛgu David fiɛ maturi alafa anyɔ ɔwe mala maɔnyɔ ma ara iso.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Nabal ɔɖabo ɔwɛ̃ ɔɣere Nabal ɔre Abigail sɔ, "David ɔsese makpabo ɔbɔrɛgu i fafuĩ ame si matã bo ɔkɔse Nabal, David kaya, ɣɛɛ bo ɔkɔse ɔtitia ma. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Ɣɛɛ ne marɛrɛ̃ magbe ɔla bo kukaakɔ. Maila bo ala kubena fiɛ ɔwi wɔ ɔɖuɖu bokɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame bowe bomatã ma ne kuira iiyu bo. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Madzuɛ̃ bo kasɛ̃ i kakɔme ɔwi wɔ ɔɖuɖu bonyɔ masɛrɛrerɔ̃ iso i ma kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Kiniɔ ne dzuĩ ne si anyɔ sɔ be aawo ɔbara, alasɔ itikpi to iaba i bo ɔkɔse gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu iso. Ɔɖe ɔtilese gbaã sɔ kuwɛ̃ iibaɖe wũ ika ɔnɔ."<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigail iinina ɔwi ɖuɖuuɖu. Ne ɔsu boɖoboɖo abo alafa anyɔ, wain bɔiakpo anyɔ, masɛrɛrerɔ̃ iru sina, atitabi sea kilo iweo-ikɔdzɛ, wainabikorea abo kulafa, aboi akpano alafa anyɔ, ɔsu wã ɔsorera mafirimu. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ne ɔɣere ɔ̃ maɖabo sɔ, "Miɖe katɔ̃ mila miɔsɔ; nto loasiai mi." Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃iɣere ɔ̃ ɔrã Nabal.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Gɔ ɔsi i ɔ̃ ɔfirimu iso ɔto ɔba ɔ̃abo i kube kuwɛlagbolomi kɔrɛ ne, David gu ɔ̃ maturi ana ka mato maso kube maba i ɔ̃ isɛ, ne ɔsarɛgu ma ne. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />David to ɔɣere ɔ̃ maturi kere sɔ, "Siefe kere iɖe sɔ lodzuɛ̃ nwɔgbe ara i fafuĩ ame gɔ ɔ̃ kuira iiyu. Ɔtã me isɛɛ nɛ lobara wũ kuso ku ilalaa. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Ɣaa si ɔɖoe David, si ɔdaanyɔ me nnya si lonyua ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ ɔbirɛrɛĩ ɔwɛ̃ gbanadze i ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu ame ku kɔrãkaɖe kaya!"<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Gɔ Abigail ɔnya David ne, ɔso i ɔ̃ ɔfirimu iso mala ne ɔkɔlɛ ɔfu i karɔ̃ i David katɔ̃. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Ɔkɔlɛ ɔfu i ɔ̃ ngbatɔ̃ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Wũ sate, tã iɣɛrɛ si iba i wũ ɔnɔwɛ̃saã iso. Lotã-ɔ iti tã fɔ ɔɖabo si ɔɖegu-ɔ ika; kã atsue si anɔ nnɛ i fɔ ɔɖabo ba ɔ̃aɣɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Wũ sate daasu ira i Nabal ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔtilese wɔmɔ iso. Ɔse kere lɛ ɔ̃ iyere ɔɣɛ - ɔ̃ iyere nɖe Kadzunisɛĩ, fiɛ adzinisɛ̃ra piagu wũ. Mme, fɔ ɔɖabo ɣɛɛ ne, loinya marɛrɛ̃ ma wũ sate ɔsese.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />"Kiniɔ ne, gɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔtã sɔ fɔ, wũ sate aiɖoe ɔturi fiɛ aibara atikuso ku fɔ mɔmɔ nrɔɔ̃, lokã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, gu ayi kumɛgɔ apia ngbã ne, fɔ matsirise gu ma ɔɖuɖu lobara adzuni sɔ maabara wũ sate iraboa ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔkpadzɛ̃ ma kutsue lɛ Nabal awe. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Su karatã ga i fɔ ɔɖabo ɔbɔ wũ sate, tã fɔ maturi ma nsiai-ɔ. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Loto-ɔ i kukpa su ikpi nɛ fɔ ɔɖabo ɔbara tsɛ wũ alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã sɔ wũ sate ɔkparɛ aaɖe sigara idzoro, alasɔ ɔsɛ ɔkpɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kakpã. Tã sɔ iranyanyariã kuiwɛ̃ daawe-ɔ iso ayi kumɛgɔ apia ngbã. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Atoasɔ ɔturi to ɔti fɔ ngbã kama kɔraa ne, wũ sate ngbã aawe i kafɔ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔnyi ira teteree ame alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa aamɔɛ̃-ɔ ɔla. Ɣɛɛ ɔto ɔ̃ayura fɔ matsirise ngbã lɛ kumɛgɔ i ɔturi sɛ ɔfuĩdza ita ku ala iwɛ̃ĩ awe. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbara wũ sate isɛɛ biara nɛ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ i ɔ̃ iso fiɛ ɔ̃ɔbara wũ tɔ̃ɖedze i Israel kaɖe iso ne, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />wũ sate iibawe i ɔ̃ kaɣere isoma ato kayirinɔ i ituriɖoe siefe ɣee sɔ ɔtikuso ɔ̃ mɔmɔ. Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbɔ wũ sate isaruɛ ne, nyigi fɔ ɔɖabo."<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />David ɔɣere Abigail sɔ, "Maale <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, Israel Ɣaa, nwɔ losese-ɔ sɔ sarɛgu me nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Lobie sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔfere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ alasɔ akpa anɔ gbaã. Aɖi me abɔrɛgu i ituriɖoe gu i kusoiti ku wũ mɔmɔ nrɔɔ̃ nɔme. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, lokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Israel Ɣaa pia ngbã ne, nna loatɛ̃ me ɔri sɔ loibabara-ɔ iraboa, si iiɖe ɔba aba i wũ kɔrɛ mala ne, tee Nabal marɛrɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ iisibawe ngbã ku kaya."<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ne David ɔfɔ ara wa Abigail ɔbɔ wũ fiɛ ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Kɛlɛ iyo ku isobuɛ. Loɔnɔ fɔ atɔ̃me fiɛ loabara nnɛ akarɛ."<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Gɔ Abigail ɔsɛ Nabal kɔrɛ ne, ɔpia i iyo ɔto ɔɖe iyi lɛ igara awe. Ɔsia i kayi iso fiɛ ɔto ɔrɛ̃ ndã kukaakɔ. Ne ɔso ɔ̃iɣere wũ kuira gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kaɖesɛã. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Kaya ne, gɔ ndã ɔɔkpa Nabal ne, ɔ̃ ɔre ɔɣere wũ ara ɔɖuɖu wagbe. Ɔluwɛ̃ ne ɔna ɔnyɛ ta ɔtu ame fiɛ ɔka i sosina ame ɔse lɛ ita. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Lɛ ayi aweo kama ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkɔ Nabal ne ɔkpi.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔnɔ sɔ Nabal ɔkpi ne, ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Maale <char style="nd">Bosate</char>! Ɔ̃ɔbara Nabal ɔtikuso ɔtã me i kumɛgɔ ɔtia me ɔso. Ɔɖi ɔ̃ ɔɖabo ɔbɔrɛgu ikpi ibara ame fiɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ Nabal kutsue ala iranyanyariã nɛ ɔbara iti."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ne David ɔsese Abigail kanya sɔ si ɔkpese ɔ̃ ɔre. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Ɔ̃ makpabo ɔkɛlɛ Karmel ne maɣere Abigail sɔ, "David ɔpia bo i fɔ kɔrɛ sɔ bokɔ-ɔ bobɔ wũ si aba aayiri wũ."<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Ɔkɔlɛ ɔfu anɔ i karɔ̃ ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nya fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go i ngbe, nwɔ lonyua so sɔ ɔ̃asumu-ɔ fiɛ ɔ̃afore ɔ̃ sate maɖabo ngba." <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigail ɔpɛsiwa ɔta ɔsɛ i ɔ̃ ɔfirimu iso. Ɔ̃ maɖabo iru ɔsiai wũ fiɛ ɔkɛlɛgu David makpabo ɔsɛ ɔ̃ɔkpese David ɔre. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />David ɔɔyiri Axinoam wɔ lobɔrɛ i Yezrel, ne ma gu Abigail ɔɖe David mare ne. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Ɣɛɛ Saul ɔɔsu ɔ̃ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi Mixal, David ɔre, ɔtã Paltiel wɔ nɖe Lais ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ lobɔrɛ i Galim ɔmagɛ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔtã Saul Ɔwe Ngbã Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Ma Zifse mawɛ̃ ɔkɛlɛ Saul kɔrɛ i Gibea ne maɣɛ sɔ, "David wɛrɛ i Xakila kabemi iso, nga nto kanyɔ Yesimon."<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔkɛlɛ Zif Fafuĩ ame, ku makpakpɛ̃dze ma nlɛ maɖo kukpi kutɛ ma maɖi i Israel kaɖe ame sɔ maanyɔnyɔ David i mmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Saul ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃ i ɔri wɔ nsia i Xakila kabemi ga nto kanyɔ Yesimon iso kuruɛ, ɣɛɛ David ɔwe i fafuĩ ame. Ɔwi wɔ ɔnya sɔ Saul ɔɔti wũ kama ɔba i mmɔ ne, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ɔsese mavɛlɛdze sɔ si matsue sɔ gbaã Saul ɔɔba ɔ̃abo i mmɔ.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Ne David ɔɣo ɔri ɔkɛlɛ ngbegɔ i Saul ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃ ne. Ɔnya ngbegɔ i Saul gu Abner wɔ nɖe Ner ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ loɖe makpakpɛ̃dzekpakpa, ɔrɛ. Saul ɔrɛ i kasɛkɔ̃ kame, fiɛ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔki malɔ wũ.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Ne David ɔkarɛ Aximelek, Xitise gu Abisai wɔ nɖe Zeruya ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, Yoab ɔnyiibirɛrɛ̃ sɔ, "Nna loasɛ Saul kɔrɛ i kasɛkɔ̃ ku me?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Ne Abisai ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Loasɛgu-ɔ."<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Ne ɔso David gu Abisai ɔkɛlɛ makpakpɛ̃dze kɔrɛ ku kasɛ̃, Saul rɛ sirɛ ɔsu wũ i kasɛkɔ̃ ame i mmɔ gɔ ifele karã i karɔ̃ ame i ɔ̃ iti kɔrɛ. Abner gu makpakpɛ̃dze ana ɔrɛ maki malɔ wũ.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abisai ɔɣere David sɔ, "Ɣaa ɔɔsu fɔ tsirise ɔpia-ɔ i nrɔɔ̃ ame nɔme. Kiniɔ ne tã lotsue wũ lomatãra ala wũ ifele, loibatsue wũ ikpɛ inyɔ."<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Ɣɛɛ David ɔɣere Abisai sɔ, "Daawɔra wũ! Nna loabara nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ iraboa fiɛ ɔ̃ibafɔ kutsueikpadzɛ̃? <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> pia ngbã ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mɔmɔ to ɔ̃aɖoe Saul, si ɔ̃ ɔwi ɔba ne ɔ̃akpi ɣee ɔ̃akpi si ɔsɛ kakpã. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> daatã me ɔri sɔ loabara nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ iraboa. Kiniɔ ne su ɔ̃ ifele gu ndu ibui wa nse amatã ɔ̃ iti kɔrɛ si borui."<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ne ɔso David ɔsu ifele gu ndu kabui i Saul iti kɔrɛ ne marui ne. Kuwɛ̃ iinya ma ɣee ɔtsue ne, ɣee ɔta i sirɛ. Ma ɔɖuɖu ɔkpi sirɛ, alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔpia ma i sirɛ ame dzoroo.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ne David ɔsɛ ɔwara ɔkɛlɛ kasɛ nyɔare ne ɔya i kabemi itititɛ̃ gɔ igu ɔwe, igbado gbodzoo ɔwe i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Ne David ɔkpere makpakpɛ̃dze gu Abner wɔ nɖe Ner ɔbibirɛrɛĩ teteree ɔsese sɔ, "Abner, aito aatã me mmuai ɣɛɛ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abner ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Fɔ nna aɖe, nto ɔkpere igara?"<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Abner, ɔrɛrɛ̃ aɖe, iiɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ aɖe ɣɛɛ? Nna nse lɛ fɔ i Israel kaɖe? Be ɔso aidzuɛ̃ fɔ sate igara? Ɔnyiiɔ ɔba si ɔwɔra fɔ sate igara. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Nnɛ abara iilɛ. Ayi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> pia ngbã ne, ikote sɔ mi gu fɔ maturi aakpi alasɔ miidzuɛ̃ mi sate, nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ. Nyɔ fɔ kɔrɛ kilɔ. Lɛ i igara ifele gu ndu ibui wa lose amatã ɔ̃ iti se?"<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Saul ɔtsue David silɔ ɔɖiite ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "David wũ ɔbi, fɔ silɔ siɖe?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Aĩ sɛ̃ siɖe, wũ sate igara." <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso wũ sate to ɔtere ɔti ɔ̃ ɔɖabo kama? Be lobara fiɛ mme ikpi lobara loɣɛrɛ? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Kiniɔ ne wũ sate igara si ɔkã ɔ̃ ɔɖabo atɔ̃me atsue. Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lotã sɔ ta ya me iso ne, iyɔ ne ɔfɔ wũ isɔrɛ. Si maturi kɔrɛ ibɔrɛ ɣɛɛ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔgbarĩ ma! Maɔtã me lorui i wũ kasɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kaɖekɔ̃ ame ne maɣɛ sɔ, 'Kɛlɛ aasumu aɣɔ.' <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Kiniɔ ne daatã wũ ima si ifere i karɔ̃ dzoroo i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ kɔrɛ. Israel igara ɔbɔrɛ ɔba ɔto ɔnyɔnyɔ toto - lɛ kumɛgɔ i ɔturi sɛ ɔgbere tsɛru i kube iso."<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ne Saul ɔɣɛ sɔ, "David wũ ɔbi, lobara ikpi, kpese ba. Loisibabara-ɔ iraboa alasɔ asu wũ ngbã sɔ mifɔ kuɣa nɔme. Gbaã ne, loɔbara ara lɛ kadzunisɛĩ fiɛ loɣɛrɛ gbaã."<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Nya igara ifele i ngbe, tã fɔ ɔporoporoi ɔwɛ̃ si ɔba ɔ̃afɔ ne. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔtã ɔturi biara kuso ala ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ gu ɔnukuareiɖe iti. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu fɔ ngbã ɔpia i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame nɔme. Ɣɛɛ loibasia kɔrɔ̃ i nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsɔla nnɔĩ iso. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Gbaã ne lɛ kumɛgɔ fɔ ngbã ɔfɔ kuɣa mitã me nɔme ne, kumɛɔ i wũ ngbã si mifɔ kuɣa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ si ɔɖi me i amɔrɛã ɔɖuɖu ame."<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Ne Saul ɔɣere David sɔ, "Ɣaa si ɔfere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ wũ ɔbi David; ato aabara ara siare fiɛ gbaã ne aaɖeiso."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Ne ɔso David ɔɣo ɔ̃ ɔri, ne Saul ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛ kaa.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">David I Ma Filistise Ndɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Ɣɛɛ David ɔɣere so sɔ, "Ayi wagbe ame ne Saul to ɔ̃aɖoe me. Ira sɛɛ nɛ loɖo loawo ɔbara nɖe sɔ loatere lokɛlɛ ma Filistise karɔ̃ iso. Iyɔ Saul ka ɔto ɔ̃anyua me inyɔnyɔ i kakɔi karere i Israel karɔ̃ iso, iyɔ nto loabɔrɛ i ɔ̃ nrɔɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ne ɔso David gu maturi alafa akuɔ ɔrui makɛlɛ Gat igara Axis wɔ nɖe Maox ɔbibirɛrɛĩ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔwe i Gat ku Axis. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ biara ɔwegu ɔ̃ iyomaturi, fiɛ David mare inyɔ Axinoam wɔ lobɔrɛ i Yezrel gu Abigail wɔ lobɔrɛ i Karmel, Nabal wɔ loɔkpi ɔre ɔwegu wũ. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Ɔwi wɔ Saul ɔnɔ sɔ David ɔɔtere ɔkɛlɛ Gat ne, Saul iisinyɔnyɔ wũ.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Ne David ɔɣere Axis sɔ, "Si wũ ara ɔbo-ɔ anɔ ne, tã me kasɛkɔ̃ i fɔ ɔmagɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ame i fɔ karɔ̃ iso. Be ɔso fɔ ɔɖabo aasɛgu-ɔ i igara ɔmagɛ̃ ame?"<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ne ɔso Axis ɔtã wũ Ziklag ɔmagɛ̃ ku iyi nɛmɔ fiɛ ɔkpese Yuda magara ɔre ita ɔwi wɔmɔ iso. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />David ɔwe i ma Filistise karɔ̃ iso ikɔ iwɛ̃ gu awa ana.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔsɛ maata mabo Gesurise, ma Girzise gu ma Amalekse. (Ta kokowi ne, maturi magbe ka masi i karɔ̃ ga nfere kakpa Sur gu Egipte iso.) <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Si David ɔta kakpã i marere iso ne ɔ̃isɛ ɔtã marɛrɛ̃ ɣee marɔ̃go ɔwe ngbã. Ɣɛɛ ɔsɛ ɔsu masɛrɛrerɔ̃ gu manantsuĩ, mafirimu gu kupuapɔngɔ gu arapia. Iyɔ ɔ̃akpese ɔba Axis kɔrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Si Axis ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Lɛ akɛlɛ nɔme asɛ aata abo?" David sɛ ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Losɛ Negev i Yuda isɛ ɣee Negev i Yerameel karɔ̃ ame ɣee Negev i ma Kenise karɔ̃ ame." <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔnyua ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go kuwɛ̃ sɔ ɔwe ngbã si ɔ̃akɔ wũ ɔbɔ Gat. Ala ɔbu sɔ, "Sianyɔ mato maatã itsue i bo iso sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i David ɔbara ne.' " Ngbɔ loɖe ɔ̃ kubarara ayi kumɛgɔ ɔwe i ma Filistise karɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Axis ɔfɔ David ɔɖe ne ɔɣere so sɔ, "Ɔ̃ maturi Israel mabi ɔtsiri wũ, gɔ ka ɔto ɔ̃aɖe wũ ɔɖabo ɔwi ɖaa."<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Ɔsɛ Endor Buɛkpiserɔ̃go Kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne ma Filistise ɔsira ma makpakpɛ̃dze kanya si makpɛ̃gu Israel kaɖe. Axis ɔɣere David sɔ, "Nto lonyɔ ɔri sɔ mi gu fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze aabua me iso bosɛ kakpã ame."<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />David ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ilɛ, iyɔ fɔ mɔmɔ ato aanya nnɛ i fɔ ɔɖabo aawo ɔbara."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Axis ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ibua ilɛ gbaã, nto loakpesera-ɔ wũ mɔmɔ dzuɛ̃se ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã."<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne, Samuel ɔɔkpi fiɛ Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ɔɔbiɛ wũ mabiara wũ i ɔ̃ aɖe Rama. Saul ɔɔsa mawase gu mma nsɛ makpere makpise ɔɖi i karɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Ma Filistise ɔsikanya maba maabara kasɛkɔ̃ i Sunem, gɔ i Saul ɔsa Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu kanya mabara kasɛkɔ̃ i Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Gɔ Saul ɔnya ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze ne, ɔnigã fiɛ ɔtu ɔpɛ wũ gbaã. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Saul ɔkarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nnɛ sɔ ɔbara, ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iitã mmuai i kurɛ ame oo, Ɣaa kanyaɖidze iso oo ɣee Urim iso. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ne Saul ɔɣere ɔ̃ madzuɛ̃se sɔ, "Mibie ɔrɔ̃go wɔ nsɛ ɔkpere makpise, si losɛ loakarɛ ira lonɔ i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">"Matã mmuai sɔ, "Ɔwɛ̃ pia i Endor."<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ne ɔso Saul ɔkɔla so, ɔpia arapia mama, ne ma gu marɛrɛ̃ inyɔ ɔsɛ ɔrɔ̃go kɔrɛ ku kasɛ̃ ne. Ɔɣere ɔrɔ̃go sɔ, "Kpere siwarã si atara nwɔ iyere lokpere atã me."<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Ɣɛɛ ɔrɔ̃go ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Gbaã ne miɣe nnɛ i Saul ɔbara. Ɔ̃ɔsa mawase gu mma nsɛ makpere makpise ɔɖi i karɔ̃ ame. Be ɔso miba migbere me si loakpi?"<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Saul ɔkã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere ame ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Lokã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ mpia ngbã, maibakpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue kukuwɛ̃ si abara nnɛgbe."<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ne ɔrɔ̃go ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Nna sɔ lokpere lotara lotã-ɔ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Ne ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Kpere Samuel tara tã me."<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Gɔ ɔrɔ̃go ɔnya Samuel ne, ɔfã teteree ɔɣere Saul sɔ, "Fɔ Saul aɖe! Be ɔso asɔsɔla me?"<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Ne igara Saul ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Daanigã. Be iɖe ato anya?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Ne ɔrɔ̃go ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nto lonya siwarã to sita sibɔrɛ i karɔ̃ ame."<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Ne ɔkarɛ sɔ, "Nda ngbɔ sise?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Siɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃kpakpa wɔ mpia awu tagbaraa ɔto ɔbɔrɛ ɔba."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ne Saul ɔtsue sɔ Samuel ɔɖe, ne ɔbɔitikarɔ̃ ɔkɔlɛ ɔfu i karɔ̃ ne.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samuel ɔkarɛ Saul sɔ, "Be ɔso aba aɖaa me ato atara me?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Ne Saul ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Lopia i imɔrɛ̃ siare ame. Ma Filistise to makpɛ̃gu me, fiɛ Ɣaa ɔɔsɛ̃ me. Ɔ̃isisɛ ɔtã me mmuai kumiwɛ̃ iki i arɛ ame ɣee kanyamaɖidze iso. Ne ɔso lokpere-ɔ sɔ si aɣere me nnɛ loabara ne."<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Ne Samuel ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso aakarɛ me, kiniɔ gɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛ̃-ɔ fiɛ ɔ̃ɔkpese fɔ tsirise? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbara nnɛ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ɔkigu i wũ iso. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔkpɛti sigarakaɖekɔ̃ ɔɖi fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔ̃ɔsu ɔtã fɔ ɔnyii ɔwɛ̃ - David. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara ngbɔ alasɔ aiwarɛ wũ fiɛ aiɖi ɔ̃ sikpã siare kayi i ma Amalekse iso, ne ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã ato anya nwagbe nɔme ne. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃aɖi mi gu Israel makpakpɛ̃dze nrɔɔ̃ ɔtã ma Filistise, kɔrãkaɖe ne fɔ mɔmɔ gu fɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ to miaba i wũ kɔrɛ i ngbe. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã ma Filistise ɔɖe Israel makpakpɛ̃dze iso."<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ɔluwɛ̃ Saul ɔrɔ̃ ɔrɛ dzɔlɔlɔ kukarãme ɔɖuɖu i karɔ̃, ifɔ̃ ɔyi i ɔ̃ ame ala Samuel atɔ̃me wa ɔnɔ ɔso. Ɔle ɔɔro wũ iso alasɔ ɔ̃iɖe kuira ku ikpɛnɛ ɔɖuɖu gu kasɛ̃ gamɔ.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Ɔwi wɔ i ɔrɔ̃go ɔba Saul kɔrɛ fiɛ ɔnya sɔ ɔto ɔmararã so gbaã ne, ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nyɔ, fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃go ɔɔwarɛ-ɔ; fiɛ lomɔrɛ̃dza wũ ngbã lobara nnɛ aɣere me sɔ lobara. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Kiniɔ ne, kã fɔ ɔɖabo atsue si lotã-ɔ aɖera si aɖe si aana ɔle fiɛ aɣo ɔri akɛlɛ."<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Saul ɔsɛ̃ ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loibaɖe ara."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ maturi ɔbua i ɔrɔ̃go iso masɛ̃ mapia wũ, ne ka ɔkã ma atsue. Ɔta i karɔ̃ ne ɔsɛ i karɛkɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ɔrɔ̃go ɔwe nantsuĩ poroporoi wɔ lowe iɖa i ɔkpã ame i iyo, ne ɔɖoe wũ ɔluwɛ̃ ne. Ɔsu ɔraũ, ɔkpɔkɔtɔ fiɛ ɔfɛ̃ boɖoboɖo wɔ maipia inyagɛ̃kua i kame. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ne ɔsu ne ɔtu ɔpɔrɔ̃ ɔtã Saul gu ɔ̃ rrmarɛrɛ̃ fiɛ maɖe. Ne ka marui kasɛ̃ kasɛ̃ gamɔ ame ne. r<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Axis Ɔkpesera David Ɔsese Ziklag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Ma Filistise ɔsira ma makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu kanya i Afek, ne Israel maturi ɔbara kasɛkɔ̃ i ndu godɛã kɔrɛ i Yezrel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Gɔ ame i ma Filistise maɖeisoi gu ma makpakpɛ̃dze ɔsɛ mabɔrɛ i ma akuri ame, mawɛ̃ kulafa fiɛ mawɛ̃ kakpi ne, David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔsɛ masiai i Igara Axis i kama isɛ. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa ɔnya ma ne makarɛ sɔ, "Be i ma Hebrise to mabara i ngbe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Axis ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "David wɔ loɖe Israel Igara Saul ɔkpakpa ɔɖe. Ka ɔpia i wũ kɔrɛ koko lɛ ikɔ gu kama, fiɛ ita i iyi nɛ ɔrui i Saul kɔrɛ iba iabo nɔme ne, loinyagu wũ iɣɛrɛ kuiwɛ̃."<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Ɣɛɛ ma Filistise makpakpɛ̃dze makpakpa ɔnagu Axis sikpã gbaã ne maɣɛ sɔ, "Kpesera ɔrɛrɛ̃, si ɔkɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ atã wũ ame. Iikote sɔ ɔ̃akɛlɛgu bo i kakpã ame, si iiɖe ngbɔ ne ɔto ɔ̃apɛ ɔfiriki ɔkpɛ̃ bo i kakpã ame. Ɔto ɔ̃aledza ɔ̃ sate anɔ ibo iɖo si ɔtutu bo maturi ati. <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Iiɖe David wɔgbe iso mato matɔ, maɖi ɔnɔ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">" ' Saul ɔɔɖoe ɔ̃ kukpi kukpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">fiɛ David ɔ̃ kukpi kuweo kukpi kuweo'?"<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ne ɔso Axis ɔkpere David ne ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Lokã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ, ɔɔɖe ɔnukuare, tee iawe me ɔmɛrɛ̃ sɔ aawe i wũ makpakpɛ̃dze ame. Ita i ɔwi wɔ aba i wũ kɔrɛ ipɛ nɔme ne, loinyagu-ɔ iɣɛrɛ kuiwɛ̃, ɣɛɛ maɖeisoi iitɔrã masia i fɔ iso. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Kpese si akɛlɛ i isobuɛ ame; daabara kuira nɛ loibawe ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔmɛrɛ̃." <verse eid="1SA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />David ɔkarɛ Axis sɔ, "Be lobara? Mme iɣɛrɛ anya i fɔ ɔɖabo iso ita iyi nɛ loba iba iapɛ nɔme? Be ɔso loibasɛ loakpɛ̃ wũ sate igara matsirise?"<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Axis ɔtã David mmuai sɔ, "Loɣe sɔ abo me anɔ lɛ Ɣaa kpabo awe; ɣɛɛ ma Filistise maɖeisoi ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Iikote sɔ ɔ̃asɛgu bo kakpã ame.' <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Ne ɔso ta mala ku fɔ sate maɖabo ma lobagu-ɔ si mirui ku kaya si kaɖe ɔna kasɛ̃."<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ne ɔso David gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔta mala ku kaya makpese makɛlɛ ma Filistise karɔ̃ ame. Ne ma Filistise ɔkɛlɛ Yezrel ne.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">David Ɔɖe Ma Amalekse Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔbo Ziklag ku ikpɛnɛ tɛare. Kiniɔ ne ma Amalekse ɔɔta mabo Negev gu Ziklag. Mata makpɛ̃gu Ziklag mawɔra wũ fiɛ matsuedza wũ. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Ne mamɔɛ̃ marɔ̃go gu ɔbiara i kame, makoso gu makpakpa pelepele lɛ mafɔrɔĩ. Maiɖoe ɔturi kuwɛ̃ i ma ndɛ̃ ɣɛɛ makɔ ma maruigu.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Ɔwi wɔ i David gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔba Ziklag ɔmagɛ̃siare ame ne, manya sɔ mawɔra wũ ku ɔtɔ fiɛ mamɔɛ̃ ma mare gu mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi makɛlɛgu. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Ne ɔso David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔbiɛ teteree gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔle ɔro maabiɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Mayukukpe ikuri ɔmɔɛ̃ David mare inyɔ ɔɖuɖu - Axinoam wɔ lobɔrɛ i Yezrel gu Abigail, Nabal wɔ lobɔrɛ i Karmel fiɛ ɔ̃ɔkpi ɔre. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />David ɔmararã so gbaã alasɔ marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖeika sɔ maapɛ wũ ata; kaɖo ɔwe i ɔbiara ame ala ma mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔso. Ɣɛɛ David ɔwe ɔle i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔ̃ Ɣaa ame.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Ne David ɔɣere sɔrɛdze Abiatar, Aximelek ɔbibirɛrɛĩ sɔ, "Su ɔmearapia bɔ me." Abiatar ɔsu wã ɔbɔ wũ, <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />ne David ɔkarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔ sɔ, "Lotere losiai mayukukpe ikuri nɛgbe? Nto loana ma lomɔɛ̃?" Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã wũ mmuai sɔ, "Tere siai ma, ato aana ma amɔɛ̃ afɔ maturi ma mamɔɛ̃ i kakpã ame."<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />David gu maturi alafa akuɔ ma lowegu wũ ɔba Besor Kawɛlagbolomi ame, ne ma mawɛ̃ ɔwe i kama i mmɔ, <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />alasɔ so ɔɔtu maturi alafa anyɔ gɔ maawara kawɛlagbolomi. Ɣɛɛ David gu maturi alafa ana ɔsɔgu itere isai mayukukpe.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />David maturi ɔnya Egiptese ɔwɛ̃ i karɔ̃ ame, ne makɔ wũ mabɔ David ne. Matã wũ ndu ɔnɛ fiɛ matã wũ aɖera - <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />wa loɖe akpano wa masu aboi kasɛi mabara gu wainabikorea abo anyɔ. Ɔɖe fiɛ ɔbo ɔle, alasɔ ayi atɛ buu i kasɛ̃ ku anɔwã ne ɔ̃iɖe kuira ɣee ɔnɛ ndu.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />David ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Nna nɖe fɔ sate? Lɛ abɔrɛ? Ɔtã mmuai sɔ, ɔ Egiptese loɖe fiɛ Amalekse ɔwɛ̃ ɔɖabo loɖe. Ayi atɛ loɔfe gɔ wũ sate ɔnyua me ɔsɛ i ngbe gɔ nto lonyɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Bosɛ boata bobo i Negev i Keret gu nrɔ̃ mɛ nɖe Yuda mire gu Negev i Kaleb karɔ̃ ame iso. Botsuedza Ziklag ɔmagɛ̃."<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />David ɔkarɛ wũ sɔ, "Aawo ɔkɔ me bokɛlɛ mayukukpe ikuri nɛgbe kɔrɛ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Kã tã me i Ɣaa iyere ame sɔ, aibaɖoe me ɣee aɖi me nrɔɔ̃ atã wũ sate, iyɔ ne nto loakɔ-ɔ lokɛlɛgu i ma kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ne ɔso ɔkɔ David ɔkɛlɛgu ngbegɔ mapia, mmɔ masame masi i karɔ̃ iso, mato maɖe ara, manɛ ara mana isoɣɔ lalaa ala kakpãramɔɛã gbodzoo wa masore maborɛgu i ma Filistise gu Yuda nrɔ̃ ame iti. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />David ɔkpɛ̃gu ma ita i kutsuɛ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kaɖesɛã kutsuɛ, ma kuwɛ̃ iiwo ɔrui ɔtere iɖo maporoporoi alafa ana ma losɛ kupuapɔngɔ iso ne matere. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />David ɔfɔ irabiara nɛ ma Amalekse ɔsu gu ɔ̃ mare inyɔ ana. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Kuira iiyu; makoso oo, makpakpa oo, ɔporoporoi oo ɔbitɛ oo, kakpãramɔɛã oo ɣee ira mama nɛ masu. David ɔfɔ irabiara ɔbɔ ana. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Ɔfɔ masɛrɛ gu manantsuĩ ɔɖuɖu, ne ɔ̃ maturi ɔsore wã maɖe iyomabɔi mama katɔ̃, mato maɣɛ sɔ, "Nwagbe nɖe David kakpãramɔɛã."<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Kere ne David ɔba maturi alafa anyɔ ma so ɔɔtu fiɛ maisisiai wũ kɔrɛ, mma manyua ma masɛ i kama i Besor Kawɛlagbolomi kɔrɛ. Mabɔrɛ maba maasarɛgu David gu maturi ma ɔsɛgu. Gɔ i David gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ to maba ne, David ɔsɛ ɔkɛlɛ ɔya mmamɔ. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Ɣɛɛ maturi nyanyariã ɔɖuɖu gu marebiese i mma losiai David ndɛ̃ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Boibatã ma kakpãramɔɛã wa bofɔ alasɔ maisiai bo bokɛlɛ. Ɣɛɛ ne, ɔrɛrɛ̃ biara si ɔfɔ ɔ̃ ɔre gu mabi si ɔrui."<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />David ɔtã mmuai sɔ, "Ooɣo, wũ manyii, iikote sɔ boasu nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã bo bobara kumɛɔ. Ɔnyɔ bo iso fiɛ ɔsu makpɛ̃guse ma lota maya bo iso ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Kuwɛ̃ iibatɔrã ɔsia i nnɛ mito miɣɛ iso. Ɔturi wɔ lowe i kama i bo ara kɔrɛ ɔkpɛ aase lɛ nwɔ losɛ kakpã ɔkpɛ, mi ɔɖuɖu ɔkpɛ aaɖe iwɛ̃." <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />David ɔbara ne asɛra gu mmara ɔsɛ i Israel ita i iyi nɛmɔ iso ipɛ nɔme.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Ɔwi wɔ i David ɔba ɔ̃abo i Ziklag ne, ɔsu kakpãramɔɛã awɛ̃ ɔsese Yuda matɔ̃ɖedze, mma loɖe ɔ̃ malaa ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nya fɔ karatã i kakpãramɔɛã wa bona i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> matsirise kɔrɛ."<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Ɔsese mma mpia i Betel, Ramot Negev gu Yatir; <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />mma i Aroer, Sifmot, Estemoa <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />gu Rakal; ɔsese mma i ma Yeraxmese simagɛ̃ ame gu ma Kenise; <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />mma i Xorma, Bor Asan, Atax <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />gu Xebron; gu mma i ngbegɔ ɔɖuɖu David gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔɔkiki.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Gu Ɔ̃ Mabibirɛrɛĩ Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Kiniɔ ne ma Filistise ɔkpɛ̃gu Israel maturi, matere i ma Filistise kanya. Israel maturi gbodzoo ɔrɔ̃ kakpã i Gilboa Kube iso. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Ma Filistise ɔtere masiai Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ teteree ne maɖoe ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ Yonatan, Abinadab gu Malki-Sua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Kakpã ɔwe ɔle i Saul kasɛ ɔɖuɖu iso, ne gɔ kutamapɛdze ɔbo i Saul iso ne mapira wũ gbaã.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Saul ɔɣere ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze sɔ, "Ɖi fɔ ipɛmi si atsue aɖoe me, si maɣɔsɔrɛse magbe iibaba maaɖoe me mabara me aɣiãra."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze ɔnigã ɔso ɔ̃iɖoe wũ. Ne ɔso Saul ɔsu ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ipɛmi fiɛ ɔrɔ̃ ɔbo ne iso ɔkpi. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Gɔ i akpirasarãdze ɔnya sɔ Saul ɔɔkpi ne, ɔ̃ wũ ɔsɔ̃ so i ɔ̃ ipɛmi iso ɔkpigu wũ. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ne ɔso Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ itɛ ɔɖuɖu gu ɔ̃ akpirasarãdze gu ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu ɔkpi ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ iso.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Ɔwi wɔ i Israel maturi ma nsi i kagbolomi isɛ gu mma i Yordan ɔwore kama isɛ ɔnya sɔ Israel makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɔtere fiɛ Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ ɔɔkpi ne, marui matere manyua ma simagɛ̃. Ne ma Filistise ɔba maafɔ sɛ̃ ame masɛ ne.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Kaɖesɛã gɔ i ma Filistise ɔsɛ sɔ maamamala mma lokpi akpakpɛ̃ra ne, manya Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ itɛ ɔkpi marɛ i Gilboa Kube iso. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Matu Saul iti fiɛ masu ɔ̃ iso akpiraifɔra, ne masese makpabo makiki i ma Filistise karɔ̃ iso mapɛ itɔ̃me imomo i ma aɣɔ asɔrɛyo gu maturi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Masu Saul iso akpiraifɔra masɛ i Astarte kasɔrɛkɔ̃ fiɛ mapɛ ɔ̃ kuturidziri mamatãra i Bet San ibere iso.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Gɔ i Yabes Gilead maturi ɔnɔ nnɛ i ma Filistise ɔbara Saul ne, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />ma makpãrɛrɛĩ ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ ɔri kasɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu makɛlɛ Bet San. Maɖi Saul gu ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ makpise i Bet San ibere iso makɛlɛgu Yabes masɛ matsuedza ma i mmɔ. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ne masu ma akui mabiara i kudziri siare kayirinɔ i Yabes ne ka manyikanya ayi akɔdzɛ.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>